<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Lapite</book>
  <para style="h">Lapite</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lapite</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lapite</para>
  <para style="mt">Lapite</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi nuomsa i ci in migilote’ zolna a zui lo mi, mawneite’ lampi-ah a ding lo mi, mi thusim lote tawh a toton lo mi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />amau’ lungnopna in Topa’ thu sung beh ma hi-in, sun le zanin ama’ thu a lungngaingai mite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate pen luitui luong gei-a kisuon, ama’ hunin ga a, a te a vul ngai lo singkungte tawh a kibang uhi. A sepna uh bangkimah amate a dau uh a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Migilote ahile tua bang ahi sih a, hui in a semmang ansi tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin migilote in thukhenna a thuoh zo sih vua, maw neite zong khu mi thumante lahah a ta zo sih ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Topa in thuman mite’ lampi cing a, ahi vangin migilote’ lampi kisiemang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bang dingin minamte kipawl dapin, mite in a mawhnapi sawmdap uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa le a sathau nu pa langkhatah leitung kumpite a pangton vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Amau’ ei khina khaute bottanin, eite kung panin a khaute uh i paimang ding hi, a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantunga a to pa nui a; Topa in amate zako hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a lungthahna tawh amate hopi ding a, ama in lungsona tawh amate zausahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ka muol siengtho Zion tungah ka kumpipa ka tosah zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in Topa’ thukip ka tangko ding hi: Ama in keima kungah, “Nang ka tapa na hi hi; tuni-in nang kang piengsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima kungah hing ngen in, na luo dingin minamte ka bawl ding a, leimong dongin na neisa ka suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sia cieng khat tawh amate na satkeh ding a, beelkheng pa in leibeel a denguoi bangin, nangma in amate na dengguoi ding hi,” ei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ziehin kumpite aw, tu-in pil ta un; leitung a uh mite aw, thuhilna thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zauna tawh Topa’ na semin, linna tawh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama’ keng nam unlen, tua ahi sihle ama ang lungthah ding a, lamkalah na sigam ding uhi; bangzieh ahei cile ama’ lungthahna khu mallang tahin a kikuontaw hi. Ama a bel mi zosie mi nuomsa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka galte tam sam e! Kei ei langpang ding mi tam mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi tampite in keima kungah, “Nang adingin Pasien sungah huna om lo hi,” ei ci uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nangma khu ka kimvela ka kidalna lum na hi a, ka vang le ka lu ei phongto pa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa tungah nahpi-in ka kiko a, ama in a muol siengtho panin keima ei dawng hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima lumin ka kimu hi; Topa in ei kep ziehin ka khanglo kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kimkotah keima ei langpang mi tul sawm tampite ka giing sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw tho in! Kei ei hunkhie in, ka Pasien aw! Bangzieh ahei cile nang in ka galte na pangbeh gawp a, migilote’ ha na sutawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hutkhietna khu Topa -a’ ahi hi; na mite tungah na thupha tung taheh! Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Dih ei tangsah Pasien aw, kang hlat ciengin ei dawng in! Nangma in ka lungkham ciengin nopsahna nei pie hi. Keima ei hepi inlen, ka thungetna ei za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />No, mite aw, ka minphatna in bang tanvei zumna thuoh ding ahei? Bang tanvei thumawhnate dei-in zuouthu sui lai ding na hi uh ahei? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa in ama adingin mi muonhuoite a tuomkoi lam thei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lungbuoi ciengun maw sih un; na lupna tung vuah ngaisun unlen, dai tahin om un. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A man biehpiehnate pie unlen, Topa muong un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tampite in, “Sil hoi kimkhat mu thei uleng maw! Kote tungah na maipha khuovah hing tangsah in, Topa aw!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An le lenggazu a hau cieng vua amate a lungnop uh sangin nangma in a lienzaw lungnopna ka lung sungah nei guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nuomtahin lumin ka kimu ta ding hi; azieh pen Topa aw, nangma beh in bihtahin keima nei lumsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka thugente na bil daw in; ka khuisahnate ei don in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Kumpi le ka Pasien aw, na kunga thu ngen ka hi ziehin ka kikona ei ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, zingmawngin ka aw na za hi; zingmawngin na kungah ka thu hing tutin kang ngah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen gitlona nuom a sa Pasien na hi sih hi; nangma tawh sietna omton thei lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi kisatheite na mai-ah ding lo ding hi; nangma in sietna bawlte na muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in zuouthu gente na susie a, Topa in sisan suote le mi sol theite a huo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hizongle a kicing na itna kip ziehin na inn sungah kang lut ding a, na biehinn siengtho lamah zatahna tawh kang kunsuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, ka galte ziehin na thumanna-ah kei ei pui in; ka mai-ah na lampi tangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kam sung vuah thuman om lo hi; a lungtangte uh zong sietna ding vive ahi hi; a lawl uh pen hankhuh kihongsa ahi a; a kampi utawh mi a mot pawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien aw, a khielna uh amate ma puosah inlen; amau’ ngaisutna ma tawh amate puasah in; a khielna uh tampite ziehin amate notmang in, bangzieh ahei cile amate in nang ang ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle nang ang beel mi zosie kipahsah in; amate in lungdamin la sasah den ta’n. Nangma sungah na min a it mite a kipah thei nadingin amate tungah na dalna puon zah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa aw, nangma in thumante thupha na pie hi; nangma in angvanna tawh amate lum bangin na sung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, na lungthah ciengin ei phawhsie sinlen, na thangpai ciengin zong thu ei hil sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa aw, gimin ka tha nem ziehin ei hepi in; Topa aw, zau-in ka gu ka tangte a kilin ziehin kei ei damsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hlagau zong zau-in genthei mama hi. Topa aw, bang tanvei sawt ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw hing kihei inlen, ka hinna ei hun in. Na itna kip ziehin keima ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile sina sungah nang ang kiphaw nading om lo hi. Misikhuo-ah koi in nang ang phat thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka tautauna-in ka gim a, zan sielin ka hlitui in ka lupna a hlummang hi. Ka kaakaa na lamin ka lupna a tehlop dildel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka dana ziehin ka mit miel a, ka gal zosiete ei bawlin ka mit a thazawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sietna a bawl mi zosie ka kung panin kihemkhie un, azieh pen Topa in ka kaana aw za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in ka thumna ei za zo hi; Topa in ka thungetna ei sang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka galte zosie zau-in a maizum ding uhi; amate a kilekia ding vua, thakhatin maizumna a thuoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, nangma kang bel hi; kei ei del zosiete kung panin ei hundam inlen ei hunkhie in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />tua hi sihle amate in humpi bangin ei ehmal ding uhi; amate in ei kaiphitin ei hun ding koima om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, keima in tam bang ka sep khah a, ka khut in sep khiel a nei leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />sietna tawh ka guolte ka thuhkia a, a hang om lopi-in ka galte ka bulu leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />galte in kei ei delin ei pha hinlen, lei lahah ka hinna tuoncilin, leivui lahah ka hlagau siel ta uheh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa aw, a lungthahsa-in hing tho in; ka galte lungsona langah hing dingto in. Ka Pasien aw, hing tho in; nang in thukhenna ding na se zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na opna kimah mite kikhawmsah inlen, amate tung a sangna mun topha tungah to in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in mite tungah thu a khen hi; Topa aw, ka thumanna le ka sunga om citahna tawh kizui-in thu ei khen in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lungsim le lungtang a sittel a thuman Pasien aw, migilote’ gitlona tawpsah inlen, mi thumante sukip in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien khu ka kidalna lum ahi a, lungsim dih mite a hundam pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien khu a thuman thukhen mangpa ahi a, nisiela a lungthah Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat a kisiakia sih leh, Pasien in a namsau tat hiem ding hi; ama in a thalpi kuoi-in a dawi zo ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama in si theina galhiemte a baisa-in koi zo a, ama in a thaltang meisi leng bangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En in, amate in gitlona gai-in nau bangin ngaisut hoi lona a pai vua, nau a suo bangin zuouthu a suohsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in dum bawlin a to vua, a bawlsa dum sung ma-ah a kie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ngaisut hoi lote uh pen a luzang vuah tukia a, a tatsietna uzong a luzang ma vuah a tukia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama’ thumanna ziehin Topa tungah lungdam ka ko ding a, Sangpen Pa Topa’ min phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thunei pen kohaw’ Topa aw, leitung zosie-ah na min bangza-in thupi ahei! Vante tungah na minthanna na koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na galte ziehin galte le phula pa na daisah nadingin, nausente le naupangte’ kam sung panin munkip na phupieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na khutmete tawh na bawl vantungte ka en a, na phukipsa hlapi le aasite ka et ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />na ngaisut tham dingin mihingte bang hi a, na thudon tham dingin mihingte bang hi lel ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien sangin amate a neuzaw hiau-in na bawl a, minthanna le patawina lukhu na khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na khuta na bawlsate tungah uhna za amate na pie hi; nangma in a keng nei vuah sil bangkim,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuu le bawngtang zosie le gam lahah gamsa zosie zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />hui lahah a leng vate le tuipi sunga om ngate, tuipi sunga lamhla kici poma, na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thunei pen kohaw’ Topa aw, leitung zosie-ah na min bangza-in thupi ahei!
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka lungsim zosie tawh Topa tungah lungdamna kang ko ding hi; a lamdang na nasepna zosie a unpi-in ka gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma sungah lungdamin ka kipah ding hi; Sangpen Pa aw, keima in na min phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka galte a nuakia ciengin, na mai-ah amate pua-in kisie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nangma in ka thu a tangin na lenkip hi; topha tungah nang na to a, a manin thu na khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Minamte na phawhsie a, migilote na susie hi; kumtawnin a maimang dingin a min uh na phietmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tawntung sietna sungah galte a mangthai uhi; a khuopite uh na phungkal hi; a kiphawna mama uh kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa khu kumpi-in a to zing a, ama in thukhenna dingin a topha phutdet zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in thuman tawh leitung mite thu khen a, a kilawm a kituohin mite thu a khen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kibawlsie mite adingin Topa khu mun muonhuoi ahi a, hamsat hun ciengin kibuhna munkip ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa aw, nang ang suite na nuasie lo ziehin, nangma’ min a theite in nang ang muong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zion-a teng Topa phatna la sa un. Mite lahah ama’ nasepnate pulah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen sisan phula pa in amate a phawh kha hi; ama in gimna a thuoh mite’ kikona a mangngil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa aw, keima ei hepi inlen, kei ei muda mite tung pana ka thuoh gimna ei mu in; nangma khu sina tunkot pana keima ei domto pa na hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuaci’n keima in Zion tanu’ kotpite-ah ang kiphatna la kisa zosie phawhkia-in, nangma’ hotkhietna sungah ka lung a dam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amau’ bawl dum sungah minamte a kiesuh vua, a lenthang siena vuah amau’ keng ma a awh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa amama ang kipulah a, ama in thu a khen hi; amau’ khut tawh a sepna sung vuah migilote a awh uhi. [Higgaion. Selah]
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Misikhuo-ah Pasien a mangngil minam zosie le migilote a pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile tasamte kimangngil zing lo ding a, mizawngte’ kinepna zong a kisie zing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hing thoto in, Topa aw! Mihingte kizosah sin; nangma mai-ah minamte thu kikhen taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa aw, amate zausah inlen, mihing maimai a hina uh minamte theisah in. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, bang dinga gamla din na hei? Hahsat hunin bang dinga kiphuol ta vanuh na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilote in kiphatsahna tawh mizawngte a bawlsie uhi, amau’ gelsa ngaisutna ma-ah amate awhsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile migilote in a lungsim sung vua om a lunggulna uh a kisahtheipi vua, mi huoihamte in nga nopna tawh Topa gausamin a taisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Migilote in kiphatsah maisuo tawh, “ Topa in hing kan sih va” a ci uhi; amate in a ngaisutna zosie vuah, “Pasien om sih,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tatna zosie vuah a maa uh vang zing a, na thukhennate sang luo ahi ziehin amate in a mu ban sih uhi; amate in na galte zosie a simmaw bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in a lungsim sung vuah, “Ei kilawh zo sih va; khan tawntungin gimna tuoh sih vai,” ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kamte uh awsie, zuouna, le bawlsietna tawh kidim hi; amau’ kam sungah a hoi lo ngaisutna le tawnkhielna vive a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi buhdap dingin khuo sungah amate a to uhi; amate in a kiphuolna uh munte-ah mawnei lote a that uhi. A mit un a cimawte dap et a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />humpi in gamlahah a buhdap bangin buhin, mizawngte mat sawmin a pangdap vua, amate in amahaw’ len-ah mizawngte kai-in a man uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate kunin a nenthop vua, amate in a hatna utawh mi cimawte a puasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in a lungsim sung vuah, Pasien in tuate mangngil ta, ama in a mai sel zo ta, mu nawn sih va,” ci-in ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa aw, thoto in; Pasien aw, na khut lamto in; a kibawlsie mite mangngil sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Migilote in bang dingin Pasien taisanin, amau’ lungsim sungah, “Nang in thu ei sit sih vateh,” ci uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle nang in na mu hi! Na khuta na lah thei na dingin nangma in buoina le gimna thuohte na melci hi. Na kungah mi cimawte ang ki-ap uhi; nang tagate panpi pa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilote le sietna a bawl mite’ khut kuoitan pieh in; amau’ gitlona khat zong na mu lo za dongin sui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa khu kumtawn kumpi hi a, ama’ gam panin minamte kisie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, nang in mi nunnemte’ deina na za ding hi; a lungsim uh na hatsah ding a, na bil na ngat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in leitung panin zauna a tuo nawn lo nadingin, tagate le a kibawlsie mite adingin thutangin kikhen ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in Topa ka beel hi; bangci bangin keima kungah, “Va bangin muol tungah tai in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile en in, miel lahah migilote in lungsim thumante kap dingin a thalkhau sung vuah thaltang a guong vua, a thal uh a kuoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A bulpite kisie po leh, mi thumante in bang ei law zo ding ahei?” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A biehinn siengtho sungah Topa om a, Topa’ topha vantungah a om hi. Ama in mihingte encien a, a mit in amate sittel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in thuman mite le migilote zelah a, a kheltat nuom mite ama’ hlagau in muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in migilote tungah mei-am le kaat zusah ding a, amau’ nga ding hai pen ahile khuopi huisa pialpual hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa a thuman hi; ama in a dih gamtatnate dei hi; thuman mite in ama’ mai a en ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw ei panpi in, azieh pen Pasien zatah koima om nawn lo hi; mihingte lah panin mi muonhuoite a maimang sieng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate khatlekhat a kisol uhi; amate in phatsolna kamzol le lungsim nam ni tawh thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in maitang phatna nephu zosie le kiphatsahna a piengsah leiite atsan hinlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuate in, “I leii tawh i guolzo ding hi; i nephute eimahaw’ neisa hi lel, i pu uh koi ahiei?” a ci viel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mizawngte’ na kilah pieh a, mi cimawte a tau ziehin, tu-in ka dingto ding hi, Topa in ci hi; “A lunggul uh ahi bihna munah amate ka koi ding hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa’ kamciemte pen a siengtho kamciemte ahi a, meikhuh sungah sagivei a kisiengsah ngun tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, nang in kote nei dal ding hi; tami khang mite lah panin kote nei kem zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite lahah a gina lote a kipatawi ziehin, migilote muncin ah a vah kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, bang tanvei sawt lai ding ahei? Kei ei mangngil suoh ding na ta amah? Ka kung panin bang tanvei na maitang sel lai ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungsim sungah bang tanvei gimna thuohin sunthapai-in ka lungsim da lai ding ahei? Bang tanvei kei tungah ka galpa kitawisang lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngaisun inlen ei dawng in, Topa ka Pasien aw! Ka mitte hing vahsah in, tua hi sihle sina kimutna sungah ka kimu ta ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tuale ka galpa in, “Ama ka zo ta hi,” ei ci kha ding hi; keima ka citun ahi ziehin ka galte lungdam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hizongle keima in na itna kip ka muong hi; nangma’ ei hutdamna sungah ka hlagau a kipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang in kei nei limbawl ziehin Topa tungah la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mimawte in a lungsim sung vuah, Pasien om lo hi,” ci uhi. Amate a kisie vua, a kidahhuoite a sem uhi; sil hoi sem koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien a sui, mipil khat beh a om ei mah, ci a thei nadingin, Topa in vantung panin mihingte ei ensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a unpi-un a lampiel sieng vua, a kibangin a letat sieng uhi; sil hoi a sem mi koima om lo a, khat zong a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An neh bangin ka mite netumin, Topa tunga thu a ngen lo, sietna a bawl mi zosie in theina nei talawm lo uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khumnah amate zau tahin a om ding uhi, azieh pen Topa in thuman mihonte ompi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Note in mizawngte’ gelna na subuoi ding vua, ahi vangin Topa pen a kibuhna uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zion panin Israel-te’ kihotkhietna hing tung dawh ta leh izaw! Topa in ama’ mite vangphatna a piehkia ciengin, Jacob a lungdam ding hi; Israel zong kipah mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, na puonbuh sungah koi om thei ding ahei? Na muol siengtho tungah koi teng thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gen baang loin kalsuon a, thuman tawh gamta-in, a lungsim sung vuah thuman a gen mite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a leii utawh mi a daisah lo mite, a lawm a guol tungah sietna a bawl lo mite, a vengte a mawsah lo mite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a mit in migilote simmaw-in, hinanle Topa a zatah mite; amau’ nat nading nangawnah a ciem pel lo mite;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />summet nga nadinga mi sum a palahsah lote, mawnei lote langkhatah guhgol a ne lote a teng ding uhi. Tam banga gamtate ahile a kilawh ngai sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, na kunga kang kibuh ziehin keima ei dal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah, “Nang, ka Topa na hi hi; nang tawh loin hoina ka nei sih hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gam sunga mi siengthote ahi ule, mi thupite ahi vua, ka lungkimna kici zosie amau’ sungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Adang Pasien a teel mite in amau’ dan a khangsah hi. Keima in amau’ sithe biehnate ka bawlpieh sih ding a, keima in ka nephu tawh amau’ min ka lo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa khu keima’ teelsa ka tanh le ka hai ahi hi; nang in keima’ nga ding na tawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei adingin mun nuom tengah gamgi ang tu hi; keima in gamluo hoi ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thu ei kuppi Topa ka phat hi; ama in zanin zong ka lungsim in thu ei hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima mai-ah Topa ka omsah hi; ka zietlamah ama a op ziehin kei ka kilawh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ziehin ka lung a dam a, ka hlagau zong a kipah hi; ka pumpi zong lungmuongin a tawlnga ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen Misikhuo ah keima nei paimang sih a, na mi muonhuoi pa zong Leihawm na musah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang in hinna lampi nei lah hi. Nangma opna-ah lungdamna bukim a om hi; nangma’ zietlamah kumtawn nopsahnate a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw thutang kang ngetna ei za inlen, ka kikona ngai in; a zuou lo ka nephu tawh kang thungetna na bil na daw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na kung panin ka dihtanna hing peisah in; na mit in thuman musah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lungtang sittel inlen, zanin ka kungah hing haw-in, ei ze-et lacin ka sungah gitlona na mu sih ding hi; ka kam in zong bangma a genkhiel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Midangte’ gamtatna tawh kisai-in ahile, na nephu pana kammal ziehin mi tatsiete’ lampite ka pelh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lampite-ah kip tahin ka kalsuon hi; ka keng a kitawnkhaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma kang hlan hi, azieh pen nang in nei dawng ding hi; na bil ei ngat inlen, ka thugente ei za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A galte uh kung panin na zietlam khutah kibuhna a suite hundam pa aw, lamdang tahin na itna kip hing lah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mitnauta bangin kei ei kem in; na hla hlim nei-ah ei phuol inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ei bawlsie migilote le ei imtawm a giinhuoi ka galte kung panin keima ei phuol in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau’ lungtang in hepina a nei sih uhi; a kam utawh amate a kiphatsah ham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in ei sulzui uhi; tu-in amate in ei kui-im uhi; amate in tuol den nadingin mittuhna-in ei nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate ahile a elmal nuom humpi tawh a kibang vua, humpi khanglai sabuh tawh a kibang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa aw, hing tho in, amate tawh kimaituo inlen thalpai in! Hinanle na namsau tawh migilote kung panin ka hinna ei hunkhie in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa aw, mihingte lah panin- na khut tawh- tam leitunga a hinkhuo vuah tanh a nei mite kung panin ei hunkhie in. Amate dinga na kholpieh nate tawh a gilpi uh kidim taheh. A tate un khamval nei ta uheh; amate in a nausente vua dingin kimkhat nuasie uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei ka hi leh dihna tawh na maitang ka en ding hi; ka khahlaw ciengin nang tawh ka kisutna mu-in ka lung a kim ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thahatna Topa aw, nangma kang it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa pen ka suongpi, ka kulpi le keima ei hunkhie pa ahi a, ka Pasien, ka kibuhna ka suongpi, ka lum, ka kihutdama ki, le ka munkip ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A phattah Topa ka hlan a, tuaci’n ka galte khut sung panin ei kihundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sina khauhuolte in kei ei vielcip hi; sietna tuihuolte in keima ei nawh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Misikhuo khauhuolte in keima ei kanbawm hi; sina thangte in zong kei ei dawntuo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka lungdon hunin Topa ka hlan a; huna ngenin ka Pasien kungah ka kiko hi. Ama in biehinnpi panin ka aw ei za a, ama kunga ka kikona in ama’ bil a va banto ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama a lungthah ziehin leitung kipumpei-in kivei hi; muol zung teng zong kinuhin a kiling gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama’ nahvang panin meikhu pusuoh to a, a kam panin a hulvam thei mei a pusuoh hi; ama tung panin mei-am kuongte pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vante niemsahin ama ang kumsuh hi; a keng nei-ah miel sapi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cherub khat tungah ama tuongin a leng hi; hui hlate tungah ama mallang tahin a leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kituom nadingin ama in a kimkotah khuomiel bawl a, a tungkhu dingin tui le meiivom sapite a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mai-a khuovah sung panin gielpite le mei-amte a kileh vapual a, meiilum a phukeh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in zong vante-ah vantosah a, tuale Sangpen Pa a awng vapo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in thaltangte kapin amate a thezah hi; ama in tun phesah a, amate a khenkhe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa aw, na hosietna le na nahkuo vang panin na husan in a semmang ziehin tuipi tawdopte kimu siengin, leitung bulpite kidawh sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in a sangna panin ei zamsuhin ei la hi; ama in tui thuhpi sung panin keima ei kaidawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in a thahat ka galpa kung pan le ei mudate kung panin keima ei hunkhie hi; azieh pen kei adingin amate a hat seng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate in ka tuosiet hunin kei ei dawntuo uhi; hizongle Topa pen kei ei panpi pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in mun tanzauna ah keima ei peipi hi; kei tungah ama lungkim ahi ziehin ama in kei ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima’ dihna dung zui-in Topa in thaman ei pie hi; ka khut siengthona dung zui-in ama in kei ei dinkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima in Topa’ lampite ka zui zo ta a, ka Pasien kung panin gitlona tawh ka piel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen ama’ thukip zosie keima mai-ah om a, ama’ thupiehte keima kung panin ka paimang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama mai-ah kawh ka baang sih a, khielna panin ka kikem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in ka dihna le ama’ muna-ah ka khutte a sienthona tawh kizui-in keima ei dinkia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thuman mite tungah thuman na lah a, kaw baanglote tungah na kaw baanlona na lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A siengthote tungah na siengthona na lah hi; a lungkawite tungah na letatna na lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang in a neilut mite na hunkhie a, hinanle nangma in mi kiphasahte na niemkhieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keima’ meivah ei tanpieh khu nangma na hi hi; Topa ka Pasien in ka khuomiel a vahsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangma hang tawh keima in galkap honpi ka nuoimat a, ka Pasien hang tawh keima in khuopi kul ka kan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tami Pasien- ama’ lampi bukim a, Topa’ kamciem a manna kilang hi. Ama a beel zosie adingin ama kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa cilo, Pasien koi ahei? I Pasien simlo suongpi koi ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thahatna tawh ka kawng ei gapieh a, ka lampi ei humbih pieh pa khu Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in ka kengte, sazuhpi’ keng bangsah a, ama in a sangna munah keima bihtahin eikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Galdo dan dingin ka khutte ei sinpieh a, tuaci’n ka bante in sumngo thal kuoi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na hutdamna lum kei nei pie zo a, na zietlam khut in kei nei panpi zo hi; nei panpina in kei ei thupisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nangma in ka nei-ah ka kalsuon nading mun tanzau nei pie a, tuale ka keng a kitawnkhaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Keima in ka galte delin amate ka nuaphah hi; amate sigam masangin ka nuakia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A thawkia zawh lo nadingun keima in amate ka satlia a, ka keng nei-ah a pua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma in gal sim nadingin thahatna tawh ka kawng nei gapieh a, ka nei-ah kei ei dote na siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nangma in ka galte na letaisah a, keima ei mudate ka susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Panpina ngenin a kiko vangun, amate a hundam ding koima a om sih hi; Topa tungah a kiko vangun, ama in amate a dawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Huipi mai-a leivui bangin amate ka satvui a, gawldunga buon bangin amate ka paimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nang in mite tawh ka kihauna pan keima nei hunkhie hi; nangma in minamte’ lutangin keima nei bawl hi; ka thei ngai lo mite in keima’ na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in ka thu a zah behun ka thu a mang pai uhi; gamdang mite hing pei-in keima ei maivil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Gamdang mite a lungkie vua, tuale mun muonhuoite panin a citunsa-in ang pei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Topa hing hi! Ka suongpi in thupha nga hinlen, ka hutdamna Pasien tawisangin om taheh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />ama pen phu ei lahpieh pa le ka nei-ah minamte ei koipieh Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ka galte kung panin kei ei hunkhie pa ahi hi; nangma in ka langte tungah kei nei tawisang tahpi hi; nang in mi tatsiete kung panin keima nei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Topa aw, tam thu ziehin minamte lahah kang phat ding a, na min phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama in a kumpipa tungah guolzawna lienpite pie-in, a sathau nu pa David le ama’ suonlehlahte tungah kumtawnin a itna kip a lah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vantungte in Pasien’ minthanna gengen a; vanpi in zong a khuta a nasepnate a tangkoko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A nini-in thu a gen vua, a zanzanin theina a pulah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thugenna om loin, kammal zong om lo hi; a aw uzong kiza lo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />hinanle a aw uh leitung muncin tengah kizel a, a kammal uh leimong dongah a tung hi. Ama in ni adingin vante-ah puonbuh khat lam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mopina innsung panin ang pusuoh mopa le, a taina lampi-ah lawptaha a tai mi thahat pa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanmongte panin ang suoh a, a mong khat dong kimvel hi; ama’ satna panin a kiphuol thei bangma a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ thukham bukim a, hlagau a thasuosah hi; Topa’ thukhennate a man hi a, mimawte pilsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ ngainakipte sieng a, lungsim nuomsah hi; Topa’ thupiehte siengtho a, mitte vahsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa zatahna pen sieng a, kumtawnin kip suoh hi; Topa’ ngaina kipte man a, a ni-in dih tuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kham le kham hoi tampite nangawn sangin tuate deihuoizaw hi; khuoizu le khuoibal zu a hlita dildel sangin hlumzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tham loin tuate ziehin na nasempa in thuhilna ka thuoh hi; tua thute zuina-ah thaman thupi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hinanle a khielna uh koi in mukhie thei ahei? Phuolsel khielnate panin keima ei siengsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mawnop teiteina panin na nasempa ei kem inlen, ka tungah tuate in ei uhsah sin. Tua ciengin kaw baang nawn loin, khielna lienpi panin ka sieng ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa ka suongpi le ka tanpa aw, ka kama ka thugente le nang adingin ka lungsim ngaisutnate a sanhuoi suohsah ta in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gimna ni ciengin Topa in nang hing dawng hinlen! Jacob Pasien’ min in nangma hing dal taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in mun siengtho panin huna hing puoh hinlen, Zion panin nangma panpina hing pie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in na biehna zosiete hing phawh hinlen, maipha tawh na meihal biehpiehnate hing sanpieh taheh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na lunggulnate hing pie hinlen, na gelna zosie hing tangtungsah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na guolzawna-ah kote kipah tahin awngin, ka Pasien uh’ min tawh kote zawna diel ei khaisah in. Topa in na ngetna zosie hing tangtun taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a sathau nu pa a panpi ding tu-in ka thei ta hi; ama in a zietlam khutah guolzawna lienpite tawh a vantung siengtho panin ama a dawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in lengte kisahtheipi-in, pawlkhat in sakolte a kisahtheipi vua, hinanle eite’ kisahtheipi pen ahile Topa i Pasien uh’ min ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A nawmsawmin amate a puamat ding vua, hizongle eite i hi leh thoto-in i dingtang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, kumpipa tungah guolzawna pie in; kote in kang hlat ciengun nangma in ei dawng in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, na hatna sungah kumpipa lungdam a, na panpina sungah nahpi-in a nuom hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’ lunggulte na pie zo a, a kama ang ngetnate na khia sih hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen thupha tampi tawh ama na dawntuo hi; nangma in ama’ lu tungah kham kumpi lukhu na khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in na kungah hinna ang ngen hi; nangma in ama tungah kumtawn hinna na pie hi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma’ panpina ziehin ama’ minthanna lien hi; nangma in ama tungah etlawmna le thupina na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in ama tungah thuphate na pie zing hi; na ompina lungnopna tawh ama na lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen kumpipa in Topa muong a, Sangpen Pa itna kip ziehin ama a kilawh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma’ khut in ka galte zosie mu ding a, nangma’ zietlam khut in ang mudate a mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma nang kilah ciengin meiphuol kuong bangin amate na bawl ding hi. A thangpaina tawh Topa in amate nawmval ding a, mei in amate katum ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma in leitung panin amau’ suon le hlahte, mihingte lah panin amau’ tate na susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in nangma tungah gitlo sawmin, a hoi lote ang bawl sawm uleh a lawcing sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma in amate na zausisah ding hi; nangma in na thaltang tawh amau’ maitang na dawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa aw, na hatna sungah nang hing kitawisang heh! Kote in na vanglietna la sa-in kang phat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pasien, ka Pasien, bang dinga kei nei nuasie ahei? Nei hu nadinga kang tauna panin bang dinga gamla om dawh na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, sunin kang kiko vangin nei dawng sih a, zanin kang kiko vangin tawldamna ka mu tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hi napi nang na siengtho a, Israel-te’ patawina tungah na to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate in nang ang muong uhi; amate in nang ang muong vua, nang in amate na honkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na kungah amate ang kiko vua, amate hutdam ahi ta uhi; . Amate in nang ang muong vua, amate a maizum sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinanle kei lungpuh ka hi lel a, mihing ka hi sih hi; kei pen midangte’ hosiet le mite’ simmaw ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ei mu zosie in kei ei zako uhi; amate in keima ei nephenin ei lulawsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Na vaite Topa ap in; ama kihunkhiesah in, Ama in a lungkimna pa hunkhie taheh!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hizongle nu gil sung pana ei ladawh nang na hi hi; ka nu ang sung nawitui tawh bihtahin nei na kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka suo-a kipan nang tungah kang kingam a, ka nu in ei pai lai-a kipanin ka Pasien na hi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hahsatna ang nai-in ei hu ding koima a op lo ziehin, keima tawh a kigamla-in om sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bawngtang tampi in kei ei imtawm vua, Bashan bawngtang hatte in kei ei kimkot uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a samat a ne nuom humpi hawh bangin, amate in a golpi-in a kam ei kahsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tui bangin ei kibuosuh a, ka gute kilawimang hi; ka lungtang pen khuoinun tawh kibang hi; ka awp sungah a zulmang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />beelphokeh bangin ka kam a gawta a, ka khagu-ah ka leiite a beh den vawt ta hi; nangma in sina leivui lahah keima nei siel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen uite in ei kimkot a, sietna bawl mi honkhat in kei ei kui-im uhi. Ka khut le ka kengte kizieltum sieng zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />ka gu zosie ka sim thei hi. Amate in ei dugaw et uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate in ka puonte a hawm vua, ka puonsilte hawm nadingin amate in ai a san uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, hing gamla op sin! Kei ei hupa aw, ei hu dingin hing mallang ta’n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Namsau panin ka hlagau ei hunkhie inlen, uite’ thahatna panin ka hinna ei hunkhie in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Humpi kam panin keima ei hon in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka sanggam numei le pasalte tungah na min ka gen ding hi; mi honpite kikhopna laikimah nangma kang phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa a zatah mite aw, ama phat un! Jacob’ suon mi zosie aw, ama minthangsah un. Israel’ tate zosie aw, ama zatah un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in a migenthei pa’ gentheina simmaw bawl loin, zong a huo vawt sih hi. ama in keima kung panin a mai a phuol sih a, ama kunga ka kiko ciengin ama in keima ei za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihonpi lahah kang phatna khu nang kung pana ang pei ahi hi; ama a zatah mite mai-ah ka thuciemna ka bawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mizawngte in an ne-in a lungkim ding uhi; ama a suite in Topa phat ding uhi. Na lungtangte uh hing den taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leimong zosie in phawhin Topa kungah a kile ding uhi; minam innkuonte zosie in ama mai-ah a bie ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Azieh pen uhna khu Topa -a’ hi a, ama in minamte tungah vai a hawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Hi hi, leitunga a kimu mi zosie in ama mai-ah a kun ding uhi. Kei ka hi leh ama adingin ka hing ding a, leivui lahah a peite zosie ama mai-ah a kun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Suonlehlahte in ama’ na a sem ding uhi; khangsawnte tungah Topa’ thu kigen ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />a suoh nai lote tungah ama’ sepsa hotkhietna thu tangko ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa khu ka tuucingpa ahi a, bangma ka kisam sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lo dawnna munah ei lumsah a; tuidam gei-ah ei pui hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />ka hla tha ei dimkia a, ama’ min adingin thuman lampi ah ei pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuomiel kuomthuh pen tawnin ka pei zongin sietna ka giing sih hi. Azieh pen nang in kei nei ompi a, na phawhbul le na ciengkhut in kei ei hlamuong sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka galte opna mun ka mai-ah an nei lui hi; ka lu sathau nei nupieh a; ka hai a dimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hoina le khuotuona in ka khantawnin ei zui valon ding a, Topa’ inn sungah kumtawnin ka teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung le a sunga om zosie hile, leitung le a tunga tengte hile, Topa -a’ ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen ama in tuipite tungah leitung phut a, gunte tungah kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa’ muol tungah koi kato ding ahei? A mun siengtho-ah koi ding ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khut siengtho le lungsim siengtho nei a, a manlo thu-ah a hinna uh piekhie loin, solna tawh a kiciem lo mite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tung panin amate in thupha a nga ding vua, a hutdamna a Pasien uh tung panin dihtanna a nga ding uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua bang mite pen ama a sui, Jacob Pasien’ maitang a sui mihonte ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tunkotte aw, na lu pongsah un! Tanglai kotte aw, minthang Kumpipa ang lut thei nadingin, kidomkang un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Minthang Kumpi koi ahei? A thahat le a vanglien Topa hi a, galsimna-ah a thahat Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tunkotte aw, na lu pongsah un! Tanglai kotte aw, minthang Kumpipa ang lut nadingin, kidomkang un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A minthang tami Kumpipa koi ahei? Vanglien Topa , minthang Kumpipa ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, na tungah ka hlagau kang lamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, nang kang muong hi; zumna ei thuohsah sin; ka tungah ka galte guolzo-in lungdamsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma ang lamente maizumsah sin; a thu om lopi-a zuouthu gente maizumsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, na lampi a thei dingin ei bawl in; na lampite ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thuman ah ei pui inlen ei hil in, azieh pen nang khu ka hutdamna Pasien na hi hi; sun thapai-in nangma kang lamen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa aw, na itna kip le na khuotuona hing phawhkia bo in, azieh pen tanglai-a kipanin tuate a omsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, ka khangno lai-a ka mawnate le ka khielnate ciemte sin; nangma’ itna kip tawh kizui-in na hoina vang tawh ei phawhkia in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa hoi-in thutang hi; tua ahi ziehin ama in maw nei mite lam hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a nei lut mite thuman lamah pui a, a nei lut mite ama’ lampi hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama’ thuciemna le a thupiehte a zuite adingin, Topa’ lampi zosie pen itna kip le citahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, ka khielna a gol seng ziehin, na min na khuolna tawh ka khielna ei maisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa a zatah amate koi ahi uh ahei? Ama in a teel ding uh lampi amate a hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate nuomsa-in a teng ding vua, a tate un leitang a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tawh kilawmtatna pen ama a zatah mite ading ahi a, ama in amate tungah a thuciemna a theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa lam ka mitsuon zing hi, azieh pen ama in lenthang panin ka kengte ei sutpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei lamah hing kihei inlen keima ei hepi in, azieh pen ka lung a zuong a, gimna ka thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka lunggimna hing damsah inlen, ka gentheinate panin ei ladawh ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka gentheina le ka buoinate ei ngaisutpieh inlen, ka mawna zosie ei maisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka galte bangza pha a, amate in ei mudana uh a natsiet lam ngaisun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw, ka hinna ei cing inlen, ei hunkhie in; nangma kang bel ziehin ei maizumsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma kang lamet ziehin citahna le thumanna in kei ei kem taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien aw, a hamsatna zosie panin Israel tankhie ta in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka dihna ei talang in, azieh pen citah tahin ka kalsuon a, lungkaa loin Topa ka muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa aw, ei ze-et inlen ei sin in. Ka lungtang le ka lungsim ei sittel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen ka masangah na itna kip om a, nangma tungah muonhuoi tahin ka gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kimanna a nei lote tawh toton loin, thusim neite tawh ka kithuo sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sietna bawl mihonte ka muda a, migilote tawh ka toton sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa aw, maw nei lona ka lahna-in ka khut ka sil a, na maitam kimvelah pei-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />lungdamkona la a gingin ka sa a, a silbawl lamdangte ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, na tenna innpi le nangma’ minthanna a opna mun ka ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hinna khu maw neite, sisan suohsahte le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />a zietlam khuta guhgol kidimte tawh ei phiettha vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka hi leh, citahna tawh ka kalsuon hi; ei tankhie inlen, hepi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leizangtam tungah ka ding hi; keima in mihon tampite lahah Topa ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa khu ka khuovah le ka hutdamna ahi hi; koi pen giing ding ka hei? Topa khu ka hinkhuo adingin ka mun muonhuoi ahi hi; koi pen giing ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka langte le ka galte ahi, sietna a bawl mite in ka sa netum nuomin ei galbawl ciengun, amate kisukha-in a pua sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galkap honkhat in phuol satin ei do nan ule ka lungsim a zau sih hi; kei ei langpangin gal a pien vangin ka lungmuong veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa kungah na khat ka ngen zo hi, tua ngenin ka sui ding khu: ka hin sung tungtawnin Topa’ inn sungah tengin, Topa’ hoina velvel a, ama’ biehinnpi sunga thu ka dawh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in hahsat hunin a buh sungah ei phuol ding hi; ama in a puonbuh khuna nei-ah kei ei humbih ding hi; ama in suongpi khat tungah keima ei sangkoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tu-in ka kimvela om ka galte tungah ka lutang kidomsang ding a, ama in lungdamin kikona tawh ama’ puonbuh sungah biehpiehnate ka pie ding hi; keima in Topa tungah la ngaite ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, ka kinah ko ciengin ei za in, ei hepi inlen ei dawng in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lungtang in, “Hing pei in, “A mai sui vai!” ei ci hi. Topa aw, na mai ka sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka kung panin na mai phuol sin. Na lungthah ziehin na nasempa ei nuangat sin, nang ei panpi pa na hi hi. Kei ei paimang loin ei nuasie sin, ka hutdamna Pasien aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu ka pa in ei nuasie leh, Topa in kei ei pom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, na lampi ei hil inlen, ka galte ziehin lam phei-ah ei peipi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka langte’ deina-ah ei ap sin, bangzieh ahei cile ka langkhatah teci zuoute a pang ding vua, tatsietna hu a sang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A hingte gam sungah Topa’ hoina a mu dingin kei ka ki-um hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa lamen in; thahat inlen, na lungsim hangsah in, Topa lamen in!
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nang kang hlan hi; ka suongpi aw, ei za loin om sin, azieh pen kei tungah hing sip dide mawh lacin, Leihawm-a peisuhte tawh ka kibang ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mun Siengtho pen lamah ka khutte lamto-in, panpina ngenin na kungah kang kiko ciengin ka thumna ei za in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migilote le sietna a bawl mite tawh, ei kaikhie ton sin, amate in a vengte tawh kilemna thu a gen vangun, a lungtang sung vuah mi huotna vive a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ sepna le amau’ gamtat sietna dung zui-in amate thuhkia in; a khuta a sepna utawh kituohin amate thuhkia in; a nga ding vua kilawm thaman amate ngasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ nasepna le ama’ khut tawh a sil bawlte a thupi ngaisut lo ziehun, ama in amate susie ding a, a lamkia nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in ka thumna ei zah zo ziehin Topa in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa khu ka hatna le ka lum ahi a, ka lungsim in ama a muong hi; tuaci’n keima ei kihu-in ka lung nuom mama a, ka lasahna tawh ama tungah lungdamna ka ko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa khu a mite’ thahatna ahi hi; ama pen a sathau nu pa dingin a bih kibuhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, na mite hundam inlen, na gouluote thupha pie in; amate a cingpa hi inlen, kumtawnin amate pui zing in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Van mite aw, Topa -a’ ci un, minthanna le thahatna khu Topa -a’ ci un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama ’ min thupina khu Topa -a’ ci unlen, a siengtho kizepna tawh Topa bie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipite tungah Topa’ awging a om hi; minthang Pasien khu vanto bang a, tui hatte tungah Topa a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa’ awging khu a vanglien ahi hi; Topa’ awging khu thupina tawh a kidim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ awging in taamtah singte a kuoitan hi; Topa’ in Lebanon taamtah singte zong a kuoitan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in Lebanon le Sirion-te, bawngno le gamsielno bangin kitomsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa’ awging meikuong bangin a taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ awging in gamlah a lawhthing hi; Topa’ awging in Kadesh gamlah zong a lawhthing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa’ awging in gangpi singte a vingvei a, gammang tulah hawhkhie-in pawn gawta suohsah hi; a biehinn sunga om zosie in, “Minthanna!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuikhang tungah Topa a to hi; tawntung kumpi-in Topa a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in a mite tungah thahatna pie taheh! Topa in a mite nopna thupha pie taheh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma kang patawi ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile nang in keima nei phongto a, keima tungah ka galte na lungdamsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, na kungah panpi ngenin kang kiko a, tuale nangma in kei nei damsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, Misikhuo panin ka hlagau na peipito a, Leihawm -a peisuhsate lah panin nei hingsah kia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No a misiengthote aw, Topa tungah phatna la sa unlen, ama’ min siengtho tungah lungdamna ko un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen ama’ lungthahna khu bano khat sung beh ahi bo hi; ama’ angvanna ahile khantawn muon ding ahi hi. Zanlai-in dana ang gieh pah kha thei ding a, ahi vangin zingmawng tawh nopna ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima ka hi leh, ka cithei lai-in, “Ka kiling ngai sih ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, nei angvanna tawh a kip muol bangin keima nei phutdet hi; nang in na mai na phuol a, kei ka lung a mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, na tungah kang kiko a, Topa tungah thumna kang nei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Leihawm sungah peisuh leng, keima’ sina ah bang metna om ahei? Leivui in nang ang phat diei mah? Na muonhuoina a gen ding amah”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa aw, ei za inlen, keima ei hepi in! Topa aw, keima ei hupa hing hi ta’n!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma in ka da ka kaanate lamna-in nei heipieh zo hi; nangma in ka la-ip puonpi nei sutpieh zo ta a, lungdamna puon nei silsah hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuaci’n ka hlagau dai op loin, nangma ang patawi ding hi. Keima’ Pasien Topa aw, lungdamna kang ko zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nang kang bel hi; kei ei maizumsah ngai sin; nangma’ dihna sungah kei ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na bil kei lam ei ngat in; mallangin ei hunkhie in. Kei adingin ka kibuhna suongpi le ei hun ding kulpi det khat hing hi ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma ka suongpi le ka kulpi tahtah na hi hi; na min na khuolna tawh ei pui inlen lam ei lah in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />nangma ka kibuhna na hi ziehin ei kisiena lenthang pan ei sut in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma’ khut sungah ka hlagau kang ap hi; a muonhuoi Topa Pasien aw, nangma in kei nei tankhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in bangma a manlo milim a thupi ngaisut mite na muda a, ahi vangin keima in Topa ka muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na itna kip sungah lungdamin ka kipah ding hi, azieh pen nangma in ka gentheina nei mu zo hi; ka hahsatnate-ah zong nei don a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ka galte’ khut sungah keima nei pie sih hi; nangma in mun tanzauna-ah ka kengte nei koipieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, kei ei hepi in, azieh pen ka genthei seng ta hi. Dana ziehin ka mit a miel a, ka lungsim le ka pumpi a gim mama ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in dana tawh hinkhuo ka mang a, khuisahna tawh ka kumte ka zang hi; ka gentheina ziehin ka tha a kiem a, ka gu ka tang teng a ngam gawp ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka galte’ simmaw le ka innvengte cizatin ka om a, ka meltheite’ gimnei mi ka hi ta hi; lampi a ei mute ka kung panin a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A si mi khat bangin ei kiphawh ta sih hi; kei pen beelkeh khat tawh ka kibang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in mi tampite’ kidaphona ka za a, ka kimvel zosie-ah zauna vive a om hi! Ka langkhatah amate in thu vaihawmin ka hinna a lah sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hizongnanle Topa aw, keima in nang kang muong hi; keima in, “Nang ka Pasien na hi hi,” kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na khut sungah ka nite a om hi; ka galte le kei ei bawlsiete’ khut panin ei hun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nasempa tungah na mai hing tangsah in; na itna kip sungah keima ei hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, ei maizumsah sin, azieh pen keima in nang kang hlan hi; migilote maizumsah in; gen ding thei loin Misikhuo ah amate peisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kiphatsahna le mi simmawna tawh ki-uongsahin midihte a gensie, zuou phuo kam le muate sipsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangma ang zatah mite dinga na kholpieh na hoite, nangma ang beel mite dinga mi zosie muna-ah na seppiehsa nate kicing valua sam ei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mite’ sawmsimna panin nangma in na hlim nei-ah amate na phuol hi; nangma in kiselna leiite panin na opna innhlim ah amate bih tahin na kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Galte in khuopi a im bangin keima ei ki-im hun lai-in, ama in lamdang tahin kei tungah a itna kip ei lah zo ahi ziehin, Topa in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Keima in patauna tawh, “Nangma’ muna panin a gamlapi-ah kei ei kinotmang hi,” ka ci zo ta hi. Ahi vangin nangma kungah panpi ngenin kang kiko ciengin, nangma in ka thumnate nei zahpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />No misiengthote aw, Topa it un. Topa in mi muonhuoite kem a, hinanle kiliensah taha gamtate nahpitahin thuhkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa a lamen mite aw, kithahatsah unlen, na lungsim uh hangsah un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A khielna kimaisah a, a mawna kiselpieh mite mi hampha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in mawna a khuhsah lo mite, a lungsim sungah solna a om lo mite khu mi hampha ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mawna pulah loin ka dai op sungin, sunthapai ka tautauna lamin ka pumpi a thanem gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sun le zanin kei tungah na khut a gih ziehin, khal nisa in ei kah bangin ka tha ka zung teng gawta sieng vawt hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n nangma kungah ka mawna kang pulah a, ka khielna ka im sih hi; “ Topa kungah ka khielnate ka pulah ding hi,” ka ci a, tuale nangma in ka maw ka khielna teng nei maisah hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ziehin thuman mi zosiete in lungkham hun sungin na kungah thu ngen uheh; tua hile tuikhang liente in amate a ban sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang pen kei adingin ka kibuhna mun na hi hi; nang in buoina panin kei nei kem hi; hutkhiet lungdamna kikonate tawh kei nei kimkot hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in thu kang hil ding a, na pei nading lampi kang hil ding hi; ka mit tawh hing enin kang kikuppi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Theitelna nei lo sakol le laa bangin om sin, tuate a zuol nadingin kamkaih vaw kul a, tua hi sihle na gei-ah ang om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilote in gimna tampi a thuoh vua, ahi vangin Topa a muong mite ahile itna kip in amate a kuikip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Midihte aw, Topa sungah kipahin lungdam unlen, lungsim man mi zosie aw, lungdamin awng un.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No mi dihte aw, Topa sungah lungdam un. Phatna pen a thutang mite bawl dinga kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lyre khausai lasahna tawh Topa phat un; harp zam sawm tumna tawh ama tungah la ngai sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama tungah la tha sa un; siem tahin khausaite tum unlen, nahpitahin awng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa’ kammal man a, ama’ silbawl zosie muonhuoi taha kibawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in thuman le thutang dei hi; Topa’ itna kip tawh leitung kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa’ kammal tawh vantungte kibawl a, a kam pana a naahu tawh vantung nate kibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in tuipi tuite thawl sunga thun bangin mun khatah gawm a, tui thuhpite a kholna munah koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leitung zosie in Topa zatah uheh; leitunga teng zosie in ama zatahin ding uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama ham a, a pieng pai hi; ama in thupie a, tua khu kipsuoh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte’ thukuppinate, Topa in bangma lo a suohsah hi; ama in mite’ lungtupte zong kisungpelsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa’ thukuppina khu kumtawnin a kip a, a lungsim ngaisutnate zong khang tawntungin kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa pen Pasien-a a nei minam, ama in ama’ gouluo dinga a teel mite thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa in vantung panin ei ensuh hi; ama in mihing zosie ei mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in a kumpi tona panin leitunga teng mite zosie vil hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />amau’ lungtang zosie a bawlpa in a gamtatnate uh en gige hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpi khat a galkap tampite in suohtasah zo lo hi; ama’ thahatna tawh galhang pa kihunkhie zo tuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Galzaw nadinga sakol galkapte muonna pen a mawhna hi a, amau’ hatna tawh a hon zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa’ mit in ama a zatahte le a itna kip a lamen mite mitsuon gige a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />ama in sina panin amau’ hlagau hunkhie-in, kielpi hun sungin amate a hinsuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />I hlagau in Topa a lamen hi; ama pen ei hupa le i lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A min siengtho i muon ziehin ama sungah i kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa aw, na tungah ka kinep ma bangun, nangma in kote tungah na itna kip hing omsah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in hun zosie-ah Topa ka phat ding hi; keima in ka kam tawh ama phatna ka gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa sungah ka hlagau a kisa thei hi; a kiniemkhieh mite in za-in lungdam uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Keima tawh Topa liensah un, eite in ama’ min tawisang ton va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in Topa ka sui hi, ama in ei dawng a, ka zau na zosie panin kei ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama en unlen, na mai tangsah un; tuaci’n na mai uh a zum ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam mi hepihuoi pa kiko a, tuale Topa in a za hi, a gentheina zosie panin ama a hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama a zatah mite’ kimvelah Topa’ vantungmi in giephuol satin amate a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa’ hoina ciem unlen, thei ta un; ama a beel mite thupha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />No mi siengthote aw, Topa zatah un, azieh pen ama a zatahte in tasapna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Humpi khanglaite in tasap le gilkiel thuoh nan uleh, Topa a sui mite ahile sil hoi bangma a kitasam sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tate aw, hing pei unlen, hing ngai un; keima in note Topa zatahna kang hil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sil hoite mu thei nadingin, koi pen in hinna dei-in, koi pen in damsawtna lunggul ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sietna panin na leii kemcing unlen, zuouthu genna panin na nephu kemcing un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sietna panin kihem unlen, sil hoi sem un; kilemna sui unlen, na phah dongun del un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa’ mit in midihte en a, a kikona lam vuah a bil ngat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leitung pan a kiphawna uh a phietmai dingin, Topa’ maitang in sietna a bawl mite langpang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Panpina ngen dingin midihte a kiko ciengin Topa in za a, a gentheina zosie uh panin amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lungsim kitamzante kungah Topa nai om a, ama in lungsim kitamzante a hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Midihte’ thuohna a tam vangin, tua teng zosie panin Topa in amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in amau’ gu zosie kem hi; tuate khat beh zong a tawng sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sietna in migilote sina tun a, mi dihte a mudate kimawsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in a nasemte’ hinna tanh ding a, ama a beel mite koima kimawsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, kei ei demte, nang zong dem in; ka langa kei ei dote nang in zong do in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lum le phaw tawi-in ei hu dingin hing thoto in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Teipi le teikhaw dawh inlen, kei ei delte lam ngat in; nang in ka hlagau kungah, “Kei na hutdamna ka hi hi,” hing ci in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tha dinga kei ei suite maizumsah inlen mindaisah in. Keima siet nading a sawmte nuakiasah inlen, lungdong sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hui in a tawmang ansite tawh kibang uh hinlen, Topa’ vangtungmi in amate delmang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lampi uh mielin nalsah inlen, Topa’ vantungmi in amate delsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in thu om lopi-in a lenthang utawh kei ei sie uhi; a thu om lopi-in amate in ka si nading dum a to uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thei lo kalun a tung vuah sietna tungsah in. Amau’ siedap lenthang ma-ah amate awhsah in; a kisiet nadingun tua sungah amate puasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin Topa sungah ka hlagau a kipah ding a, ama’ hutkhietna sungah nuom a sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka gu ka tang teng zosie in, “ Topa aw, nang tawh a kibang koi a om ahei? Nang in amate dinga a thahat mite kung panin mi thanemte na hunkhie a, nang in amate a bawlsie mite panin a thanem le a tasamte na hunkhie hi,” a ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zuouthu gen tecite ang khang hi; amate in ka thei lo thute ei dong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in ka hoinate sietna tawh ei thuhkia hi; ka hlagau genthei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka hi leh, a cinat ciengun la-ip puon ka sil hi; an tanna tawh kei le kei ka kigenthei bawl hi. Ka kangtung-ah lu kunin thu ka ngen a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka lawm ka guol le ka sanggam khat a da bangin ka da hi; a nu zieha a kap mipa bangin kap kawmin ka vah kawi a, da le mau-in ka kunsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka pua ziehin amate nuomin a kikhawm uhi; kei ei langpang dingin amate a kikhawm uhi; ka thei ngai lo mi tatsiete in khawl hun nei loin ei gensiesie uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />amate in Pasien zatah loin ei koko vua, a ha uh ei gawisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, bang tanvei ei gum et ding na hi ahei? Ei suhgawpna panun ei hunkhie inlen, humpite kung panin ka hinna ei hun in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ciengin mihon tampite lahah lungdamna kang ko ding hi; keima in mihonpite lahah nangma kang phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka tungah a thuman lo ka galte lungdamsah sin len, thu om lopi-a ei mudate, a mit-heh utawh kihosah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in kilemna a gen tahzawh sangun, gam sunga a om muongte tungah zuouthu gen ding beh a sawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in kei ei langpangin a kam a golkeh uhi; amate in, “Ha, ha, i mit tawh mu zo tai ei,” a cisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa aw, nang, mu zo ta teh; dai op mawh sin! Topa aw, ka kung panin gamla op sin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka Topa ka Pasien aw, ka thu le ka kidalna dingin hing khanglo inlen, hing kisatsuo tawm in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, na thumanna tawh kituohin kei dih ei tangsah inlen, kei tungah amate lungdamsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau le amau kiho-in, “Aha, i lungtup tung ei,” kicisah sin. Amate in, “Tam pa nawmval zo tai,” cisah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Keima’ tuosietna-ah a lungdam mite zosie, maizumsah inlen, amkhamsah gawp in; nangma in kei tunga a kiliensahte zumna le mindaina silsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka dihtanna a talang nuomte lungdam kipahin awng uh hinlen, “A nasempa’ citheina-ah a lungkim Topa lien hi, cicisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin sunthapai-in ka kam in na dihna le nangma phatna a gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khielna in a lungsim tawng vuah thu a gen hi; a maitang vuah Pasien zatahna mawngmawng a om vet sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen a khielna uh kimu loin, ei kimuda sih va, ci-in a ngaisun vua, tuaci’n amau le amau a kimawhphat tawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kam vua a thugente uh pen sietna le mi solna vive ahi hi; pil gamtat ding le sil hoi sep ding amate a khawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lupna tunga a lup kawmun sietna bawl ding a sawm uhi; hoi lona lamah amate kibultawm uhi; amate in sietna a niel sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, na itna kip in vantung dong ban a, na muonhuoina in meiipite dong ban hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na dihna muolpite tawh kibang a, na thukhennate tuithuhpi tawh kibang hi; nang in mihingte le ganhingte na hundam hi, Topa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien aw, na itna kip bangza-in manpha ahei! Nangma’ hla hlim nei-ah mi zosie a kibu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma’ inn sungah amate in kiningcing tahin pawi a bawl vua, na nopsahna gun panin amate dawn ding na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma tawh hinna tuinah a omton hi; kote in na khuovah sungah khuovah ka mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang ang thei mite tungah na itna kip zomsuoh inlen, lungsim man mite tungah na hutdamna hing zom in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte’ keng in ei tuonsah sinlen, migilote’ khut in ei notmangsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khumnah sietna a bawlte cimaw-in a kun uhi; amate tuolsena-in kinei-in a tho zo nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Migilote ziehin kilunggimsah sin; a man lo-a a gamtate eng vawt sin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen amate lopa bangin vul pai ding a, lohingte bangin vulnang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa muong inlen, sil hoi sem in; tua hile gam sungah tengin, bihtahin na om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa sungah lungkim in, tua hile ama in na lunggul teng ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa tungah na vai teng ap in; ama muong in, tua hile ama in ang sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in khuovah bangin na dihna tangsah ding a, nangma’ thutanna sun nitang bangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa mai-ah dai dide inlen, lungduoitahin ngah in; a sepna a daupeite tung le sietna bawlte tungah kilunggimsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungthahna ki-ip inlen, thangpaina nuasie in. Kilunggimsah sin- tua in sietna behah ang pui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen migilote kisumaimang ding a, hizongle Topa a lamen mite in gam a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hinanle bano khat sungin migilote om nawn lo ding hi; a opna mun uh na suisui vangin tuanah a om nawn sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hionanle a lungnemte in gam a luo ding vua, a kicing hauna sungah amate a nuomsa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Migilote in midihte tungah sietna bawl sawmin a ha gawi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ahi vangin Topa in amau’ ni a tun ding a mu ziehin amate nuisan lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mizawngte le mi tasamte a nuoinet ding le a mantaha gamtate a that dingin migilote in namsau dawhin a thal uh a kuoi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a namsau in amau’ lungtang ma sun ding a, amau’ thalte zong kihliehtawng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Migilote hau-in tampi a nei sangun midihte in halno khat beh a nei uh hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen migilote’ baan kihliehtawng ding a, hinanle Topa in midihte a panpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in kaw baang lote’ nite thei a, kumtawnin a gamh uh kip den hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />hun siet ciengin amate kimaizumsah lo ding a, kiel hun ciengin zong amate in kicingtahin a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hinanle migilote kisie a, Topa’ galte ahile lohing etlawm tawh kibangin, meikhu bangin a mangthai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migilote in leitawi a la vua, a sangkia sih uhi, hizongle midihte ahile a kiphal vua, a pie den uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />azieh pen Topa’ thupha piehte in gam a luo ding vua, ahi vangin ama’ samsiet mite ahile kisumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I gamtatna ah Topa a lungkim ciengin i kalsuonnate ama in kipsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />eite i pua kha zongin i bungbutuh sih ding uhi, azieh pen Topa in eite i khutin ei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Naupang ka hi ngai a, tu-in a vuoi ka hi ta hi, hinanle midihte kinuasie-in, a tate khutdaw ngen ci bang ka mu ngai nai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate in kiphal tahin a pie ngitnget vua, mite zong a leitawisah uhi, tuale a tate thupha nga a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sietna panin kihem unlen, sil pha bawl un; tuaci’n kumtawnin note na teng suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in thutang dei hi; ama in a muon mite a nuasie sih ding hi. Midihte kikemcing zing ding a, hinanle migilote kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Midihte in gam luo ding a, kumtawnin tua sungah a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Midihte’ kam in pilna thu gen a, a leii un thutang a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A lungsim sung vuah Pasien’ thukham a om hi; amau’ kengte ahile a kitawnkhaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Migilote in midihte encihin, amate tha dingin a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa in a vanglietna sung vuah amate nuasie lo ding a, thu sit dingin a kipeipi ciengin amate mawna thuohsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa lamen inlen, ama’ lampi zui in, tua hile ama in gam luo dingin nangma ang tawisang ding hi; nangma in migilote’ sietna na en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Lebanon taamtah sing banga a sang mama, mi bawlsie migilote keima in ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate kungah ka va suohkia leh amate na om nawn lo hi; amate ka suisui vangin a kimu zo nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Kaw baang lote ciemte in, mi thumante en in, azieh pen kilemna a deite adingin suonlehlah a om ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Hinanle thupalsat mite, kisusie ton ding hi; migilote’ suonlehlahte kihemkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Midihte’ hutdamna khu Topa tung pan ahi hi; ama pen hahsat hun cienga amau’ kibuhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Topa in amate panpi-in a suohtasah a, amate in Topa a bel ziehun ama in migilote kung panin amate hunkhie-in a suohtasah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, a lungthahsa-in kei thu ei hil sinlen, na thangpai cieng zong thu ei hil sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen ka sungah na thaltangte ang tum a, ka tungah na khutte ang tu zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lungthah ziehin ka ci ka sa a dam thei sih hi; ka mawna ziehin ka gu ka tangte a khau thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen keima’ khielnate in ka luzang ei vuanelh ta hi; keima adingin tuate pen a gih mama van tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka motlawm ziehin ka liemnate naikulin uithan hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nahpitahin ei kikun sahin, ei kikhupbawh sah hi; da le kapin sunthapai-in ka vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen ka kawng zang teng meikah tawh kidim sieng a, ka ci ka sa sungah damna kici a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nahpitahin ei kizo gawpin ka tha a tawpmang ta hi; ka lung a gim ziehin thumin ka tautau hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, nang in ka dei zosie na thei hi; ka khuisahnate ahile na kung pan phuolsel ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungtang a kisai a, ka thahatna tawp zo hi; ka mit in zong khuo a mu thei ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka genthei thuohna ziehin ka lawm ka guolte a kidangkoi vua, ka innvengte zong gamlapi-ah a om uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei ei tha sawmte in thang ei sie uhi; ka nat nading a suite in siet nading thu beh genin, sunthapai-in mi sol ding beh lungngai-in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle kei ka hi leh bilbing ka bang a, khuo ka za sih hi; a ham thei lote bangin ham loin ka om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A tahtahin ci lei kei pen bil khuo za lo le, a kam pana a thuhkia ngai lo mipa tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, keima in nang kang ngah hi; Topa ka Pasien aw, kei ei dawng pa nang na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen, “Ka kitawnkhaw ciengin, kei tunga thangpha mite, kei ziehin lungdamsah sin,” ci thu beh kang ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kei a pua ding ka hi ta a, ka natna a kam thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in ka khielna ka pulah hi; ka mawna ziehin ka da mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu om lopi-in ka galte a thahat mama vua, a man lopi-a ei mudate a tam mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A hoi gamta ka hi ziehin hoina pen sietna tawh ei thuhte ka galte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa aw, kei ei nuasie sin; ka Pasien aw, ka kung panin gamla op vawt sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka hutdamna Topa aw, ei hu dingin hing kinaw ta’n.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka leii tawh ka maw lo nadingin ka gamtatnate ka kikem ding hi; keima’ opna munah migilote a om laise kamtuomna tawh ka kam ka hum ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ham loin ka om khinkhian hi; ka dai opna khu a mawhna a suoh hi; ka lungkhamna khang semsem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a sungah ka lungtang sa vapom hi. Ka ngaisutsut ciengin ka lung a so hi; tuaci’n keima in ka kam tawh ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, ka hinkhuo tawp hun ding, a kise za ka hun ka nite ei theisah in; ka hinkhuo a tawp pah ding ahi lam zong ei theisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang in ka hinkhuo khutphang cie behin na bawl a, nangma’ muna-ah ka khankum bangma tan ahi vawt sih hi. A tahtahin mihing vannuoi naahu bang beh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tahtahin mi zosie hlim banga a vah kawikawi ahi hi. A tahtahin amate bangma lo adingin a buoi uhi; koi pen’ nga ding ci thei lopi-in nei le lam a kholvum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Tuale tu-in, Topa aw, kei bang pen ngah ka hei? Nangma sungah ka lametna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima’ khielna zosie panin ei hunkhie in. Mi mawte’ simmaw dingin kei ei bawl sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tam banga ei bawl nang na hi ziehin, kam keh loin ka dai op hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima tung panin nei vuohna ladawh in; na khuttum tawh nei tup ziehin ka tha a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Mihingte a mawna ziehun dan pie-in thu na hil a, nang in amau’ thupisah nate nget’ neh bangin na netum hi; a tahtahin mihing zosie pen naahu khat beh hi lel uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“ Topa aw, ka thungetna ei za inlen, ka kikona na bil ei daw in; ka hlitui luonna ei thudon in. Azieh pen ka pu ka pate bangin, kei zong bakhat sung zin le pemta bang ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima si-in ka op nawn lo masang, ka nuikia thei nadingin keima kung panin na mai heimang in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungduoitahin Topa ka ngah hi; kei lam hing kinga-in ka kikona ei za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in sietna dum sung le buonnawi lah panin ei kaidawhin, suongpi tungah ka keng ei koipieh a, ka kalsuonnate kipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in ka kam sungah i Pasien phatna la tha khat ei koipieh hi. Mi tampi in mu-in a zatah ding vua, amate in Topa a muong ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A muonna uh Topa hisah a, mi kiphasahte lamah kihei loin, pasien man lote lamah a piel lote thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, na sepna lamdangte le kote dinga na ngaisutnate tampitah na phasah zo hi; nang pen koima dang tawh tekah thei ding na hi sih hi. Tam thute tangko-in gen ding hileng sim zawh loin a tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang in biehpiehna le silpieh na lunggul sih a, ahi vangin nang in ka bil nei honpieh zo hi. Nang in meihal biehna le mawna zieha biehna na kal sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in, “Tanah ka om hi; laiziel bupi sungah ka thu kigiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in na deina banga sep ding nuom ka sa hi, ka Pasien aw; ka lungtang sungah na thukham a om hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in mihon tampite lahah hutkhiet lungdamna thu ka gen zo ta hi; en in, Topa aw, na thei bangin keima in ka nephute ka kham zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Na hutdamna dinga nei panpina keima in ka lungtang sungah ka phuolsel sih a, keima in na muonhuoina le na hutdamna thu ka genkhie zo hi; Mihonpi panin na itna kip le na muonhuoina ka imcip sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, ka kung panin na khuotuona humcip sin; na itna kip le na muonhuoina in keima ei kembih den taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen sim zawh lo sietnate in keima ei kimkot hi; khuo ka mu thei lo ding za dongin ka khielnate in kei ei nuaphah zo hi; ka samzam sangin a tamzaw vua, ka lungsim a tawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa aw, nei hut ding hing lungkim in; Topa aw, kei ei hu meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tha dinga kei ei sui kawikawi zosie maizumsah inlen, buoisah in; ka siet nading a dei mite nuakia sah inlen minsiesah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima tungah, “Aha, Aha!,” ei cite maizumin cizalia sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang ang sui zosie, nang sungah lungdam kipah hinlen; na hutdamna a dei mite in, Topa lien hi!” ciden ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei ka hi leh zawngin ka cimaw a, hinanle Topa in kei ei phawh den hi. Nang ei panpi pa le ei hunkhie pa na hi hi; hing kiheh sin, ka Pasien aw.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mizawng a khuolte thupha nga mi ahi hi; lungkham hun ciengin Topa in amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in amate dalin a hingsah ding hi; amate pen gam sungah thupha nga mi kici ding hi. Nang in a galte deina bangin amate na pie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A cinatna a lup muntung vuah Topa in amate khoi ding hi; nangma in amau’ cinat hun sungin a damlona zosie uh na damsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kei dingin hi leh, “ Topa aw, ei hepi inlen, ei damsah in; bangzieh ahei cile nang tungah kang mawzo hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei bang hun ciengin si-in, ka min a mangthai diei, ci thu thangsietna tawh ka galte in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei ei en dinga ang pei ciengun, thu mawhna vive a gen vua, a lungsim sung vuah sietna kaikhawmin, a peikhiet ciengun tuate a genthaang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei ei muda zosiete in keima’ thu a kihodap uhi; amate in kei adingin a sie penpen ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka lupna pana thokia zo lo dingin si theina natna in ei mancip hi, ci-in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka muon ka lawm it pa, keima’ an a ne pa nangawnin a aaketul tawh keima ei peh kawi viel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, amate ka thuh thei nadingin, keima ei hepi inlen, ei phongto in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka galpa in kei ei zaw lo ziehin, kei tungah nang lungkim lam tami thu tawh ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka citah ziehin nang in kei nei panpi a, nangma’ opna munah kumtawna om dingin nei koi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Israel Pasien Topa in kumtawn pan kumtawn dongin thupha nga taheh. Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sakhi in luitui luong silsel a lunggul bangin ka hlagau in nang ang lunggul hi, Pasien aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hlagau in tuidu dangta bangin a hingzing Pasien ang hlangai hi. Bangcih cieng hing pei-in Pasien’ maitang mu ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mite in ka kungah, “Na Pasien hei-a om ahei,” ei ci den ciengun, sun le zanin ka hlitui an-in ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima in ka lungsim ka sungkhie a, mi honpi tawh zawh tonin, kipahin awngin nopna late a sa pawibawl mihonpite tawh Pasien’ inn ah amate ka pui zie teng ka phawhkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, bang zieha lungkham a, bang zieha ka sunga buoi na hei? Pasien sungah lametna nei in; azieh pen keima in ei panpi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />le ka Pasien ahi, ama ka phatkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuithuhpi in na tuizeu hawh sungah tui thuhpi hlan hi; na tuihuolte le tuihuolpite in kei ei vuamang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sunin Topa in a itna kip sawl a, zanin a la tawh ei ompi hi, ka hinna Pasien tungah thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka suongpi ka Pasien kungah, “Bang dingin kei ei mangngil na hei? Ka galte in ei gawt ziehin bang dingin da le kapin vah kawikawi ding ka hei?” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka pumpi tungah sina ding liemna nei bangin, ka galte in ei tawhin ka kungah, “Na Pasien hei-a om ahei?” ei ci den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, bang dinga lungkham a, bang dinga ka sunga buoi na hei? Pasien tungah lametna nei in; bangzieh ahei cile keima in ei panpi ka Pasien ka phatkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka dihna hing kilangsah inlen, Pasien zatah lote tawh ka thu-ah keima ei panpi in; mi solte le mi thuman lote kung panin kei ei hunkhie in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nang ka kibuhna Pasien na hi hi; nang in bang dinga kei nei taisan dawh ahei? Galte bawlsietna ziehin bang dingin kap kawmin vah ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, na khuovah le na thuman hing sawl in; tuate in ei puisah in; tuate in na muol siengtho le na tenna munah ei peipisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin Pasien’ maitam ahi a, nop ka sah mamana Pasien kungah ahi zongin ka pei ding hi; keima in harp lasahna tawh nangma kang phat ding hi, aw, Pasien, ka Pasien aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, bang dingin kilungkhamsahin, ka sungah bang dingin buoi den mielmuol na hei? Pasien sungah lametna nei in; bangzieh ahei cile keima in ei panpi ka Pasien ka phatkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, tanglai amahaw’ hin lai-a na silbawlsate, ka pu ka pate in ei gen vua, ka bil utawh ka za zo uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in na khut tawh minamte na notmang a, hizongle nangma in amate na tengsah hi; Nang in mite na bawlsie a, hinanle amate na suohtasah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />azieh pen a namsau beh utawh amate in gam a lah uh ahi sih a, a baan thahat beh un zong amate guolzawna pie lo hi; na zietlam khut, le na baan le na maitang khuovah hang hizaw hi, bang ding ahei cile amate sungah nang na lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang ka Kumpipa le ka Pasien na hi hi; nang in a guolzaw nadingin Jacob thu na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma ziehin ka galte ka sawnpua uhi; nangma’ min ziehin ei do mite ka tuoncil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen ka thalpi ka muong sih a, ka namsau in zong ei hun zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin ka galte panin nang in nei hun a, ko ei muda mite na amtawngsah gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien sung ah ka ki-angtangsah zing uhi, kumtawnin kote in na min ka phat den ding uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle nang in ko ei nuolin nei thusim ta sih a, ka galkap honte tawh zong na kuonton sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka galte kung panin nei nuakiasah a, ka galte un ka neisate a la ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nang in a kigo ding tuu bangin kei nei bawl a, minam dangte lahah nei thethaang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang in tawmno khat tawh na mite na zua zo a, nang in amau’ man ding na sang nget sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang in ka vengte’ zako, ka kim ka pamte’ simmaw le nuisat dingin nei bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Minamte lahah a sie lam thugentena, mite lahah nuizat nopna-in kote nei bawl zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sunthapai-in ka mai-ah mindaina om a, kei ei tawhte le ei hosie mite’ thugen ziehin, ka galte le phula mite’ mai-ah zumna in ka maitang a tuom mang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka tung vuah tam thu zosie hing tung nanle kote in nang kang mangngil sih vua, na thuciemna ka palsat sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungsim uh kinua hei loin, ka kalsuonna uzong nangma’ lampi panin a piel tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hinanle nangma in ngie-te opna munah nei balnen a, khuomiel thuhpi tawh kei nei tuommang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka Pasien uh’ min mangngilin pasien dang tungah ka khutte uh a zah zo hi mawh uleng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pasien in tam thu mu loin a om mawh ding amah? Bangzieh ahei cile ama in lungsima phuolselte a thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangma ziehin sunthapai-in kote ei kithat a, a kigo ding tuu bangin ei kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa aw, bang dinga kimu na hei? Hing tho in, khanglo inlen, keima ei nuasie zing sin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Bang dinga na mai na phuol ahei? Bang dinga ka gentheina ule ei kibawlsietnate na mangngil ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile leivui lahah ka pua uhi; ka pumpi uh tuol ah a lum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Hing thoto inlen kote ei hu in. Nangma’ itna kip na khuolna tawh kote ei tankhie in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuhoi khat tawh ka lungtang ang dimlet hi; kumpipa kungah ka latengte ka va sut ta hi; ka leii lai-at siempa laikung tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mite lahah nang na hoi pen hi; na nephu tungah hepina kibuosuh hi; tua ahi ziehin Pasien in kumtawnin nang thupha ang pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A thahat mipa aw, na phei ah a vangnei le a thupi na namsau kuo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thutah ading le thuman humbih nadingin na thupina tawh guolzo tahin tuong in; na zietlam khut in a dipkuot huoi nasepte kihilsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thaltangte hiem mama a, tua khu kumpipa galte’ lungtangah tu-in, na nei-ah mite a pua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien aw, kumtawnin na kumpi topha kip den hi. Na kumpi ciengkhut zong thumanna ciengkhut ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />nang in thudih na dei a, gitlona na muda hi. Tua ziehin Pasien ahi, na Pasien in lungdamna sathau hing nu-in, na khanguolte tungah ang sangkhan zo ta hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />na puontuolpite myrrh, aloe le thalsing namtuite’ gim a nam hi. Saiha tawh kibawl kumpi innpi panin khausai lasahnate in nangma ang kipahsah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />na numei thupite lahah kumpite’ tanute a om uhi; nangma’ zietlamah Ophir kham tawh a kizem kumpi nu a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tanu aw, za in, ngai sunin na bil ei ngat in; na mite le na pa’ inn mangngil inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />nang melhoi na hi ziehin kumpipa in ang deigaw ding hi. ama na topa ahi ziehin ama mai-ah kun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihau pente ahi Tyre mite in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nei le lam namcin tawh letsongte tawi-in na maipha ang sui ding uhi. Ama’ innkhan sungah kham tawh kigan puontuolte tawh kumpipa’ tanu kizem hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />mel tuomtuom a nei puontuolpi silin kumpi kungah tua nu kipeipi hi; ama’ nua-ah ngahnu siengthote le a lawm a guolte in a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kipahna le lungdamna tawh amate kizawpi a, kumpipa’ inn sungah a lut uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kumpipa aw, na pu na pate’ tangin tapate na nei ding hi; nang in leitung mun zosie-ah amate, gam-uhte na suohsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in a khang khangin na min ka kiphawhsah zing ding hi; tua ahi ziehin mite in a tawntungin nangma ang phat den ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien pen i kibuhna le i thahatna hi a, lungkham hun a ei hu paipai pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ziehin leitung kikhelin tuipi laikimah muolte kilawh hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />a tuite hawh vapo-in phuon valuh a, a tuihuol ziehin muolte kiling nanleh, i zau sih ding uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gunpi khat om a, a luituite in Pasien’ khuopi ahi Sangpen Pa’ tenna khuopi siengtho a lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua khuopi laikimah Pasien a om hi; tua khu a kilawh sih ding hi. Pasien in zingmawng phalvahin ama a panpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minamte so gawpin kumpi gamte kiling hi; ama in a aw gingsah a, leitung tui a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vanglien Topa eite tawh ang omton hi; Jacob Pasien khu eite’ kibuhna ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hing pei unlen, Topa’ sepnate hing en un; ama in leitung zosie gamkhing a suosahna hing en un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in leimong dongah gal a vengsah hi; ama in thalpi kuoitanin teipi a susie hi; ama in kidalna lumte mei tawh a haltum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Om hihiet unlen, Pasien ka hi lam thei un! Minamte lahah keima ei kitawisang a, leitungah zong keima ei kitawisang hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vanglien Topa eite tawh ang omton hi; Jacob Pasien khu i kibuhna uh ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No mi zosiete aw, na khut uh beng unlen, Pasien tungah a gingtahin kipahna late sa-in awng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen Sangpen Pa Topa giinhuoi mama a, leitung buppi a uh kumpi lien khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in i nei-ah mite ei koipieh a, i keng nei-ah minamte ei zosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in eite ading gouluo ei teelpieh a, ama in a it Jacob’ angtanpi zong ama’ guot ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Awhna tawh Pasien peito a, pengkul aw tawh Topa peito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien tungah phatna late sa un, phatna late sa un; i Kumpipa tungah phatna late sa un, phatna late sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien khu leitung buppi’ kumpi ahi hi; late tawh phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen minamte tungah Pasien khu kumpi ahi hi; ama’ kumpi topha siengtho tungah Pasien a to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abraham Pasien’ mite bangin mite’ uliente zong a kisutuo uhi. Azieh pen leitung lumte khu Pasien-a’ ahi hi; a sangpi-in ama kipatawi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa lien a, i Pasien’ khuopi sungah nahpitaha phat ding ahi hi. Ama’ muol siengtho pen
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />sangin etlawm a, tua khu Kumpi lien’ khuopi, leilu lama om Zion Muol ahi a, leitung buppi’ lungdam kipahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ kulpi sungah Pasien om a, a muonhuoi hunpa ahi lam ama le ama a kilah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin kumpite a kikhawm vua, amate a kuonto uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in tuami a mu behun lamdang a sa mama uhi; amate patau dipkuo-in a taimang sieng uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />nau suoh dinga kisa takei natna in a tut numei bangin, khum sungah amate citunin a om vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tarshish tembawte a susie nisuona lam huipi bang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I zahsa bangin eite in, Vanglien Topa’ khuopi, Pasien in kumtawna a phukipsa Pasien khuopi sungah i mu ta uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien aw, kote in na biehinnpi laikim ah na itna kip ka lungngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien aw, na min in leimong a zel bangin, nang ang kiphatna in zong a zel hi. Na zietlam khut guolzawna tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na thukhennate ziehin Zion Muol lungdam hinlen, Judah khuopite zong kipah uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion kimkotah pei unlen, a tausang phaza va sim ta un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />a kulpite hoitahin ngaisun un; a khuopi kulte va nawh ta un, tua hile khangsawnte kungah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tami Pasien ahi a, kumtawn eite’ Pasien ahi hi, ci-in na gen thei ta ding uhi. Ama pen a tawntungin eite’ lam lahpa hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi zosie in tam thu za un; leitunga milien
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mineu, mihau le mizawng zosie aw, ngai un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kam in pilna thu a gen ding hi; Ka lungsim sunga ka thungaisut thu in ei theitelsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Paunah khat ka bil ka ngat ding hi; Harp lasahna tawh ka thu hahsate ka gencien ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hahsat hun, ei bawlsiete’ khielna in ei kimkot hun ciengin bang dinga zau ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A neisa uh muongin a hauvumna uh kisahtheipi uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tahtahin koima in a hinna sum tawh tan zo lo a, Pasien kungah a hinna man ding a pie zo koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile hinna tatna ding man tam mama a, tua in hankhuh mu ngai loin hin denden nadingin kicing zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mipilte i et ciengin, amate zong a si uhi; mimawte le mingolte zong a si ton vua, amate in a neisa zosie uh midangte a nuasie pieh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in leitangte amau’ min a puohsah vangun, a hankhuh uh pen a tenna uh mun hi den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nopsahna-ah mihingte kip suoh thei lo hi; amate pen a mangthai ganhingte tawh a kibang ahi lel bo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua bang pen a mottat mite’ tuokhah ding thu ahi a, amau’ ngasa tawh a lungkimte’ tawpna khu tam bang ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Misikhuo adingin tuu bangin amate kise zo hi; Sina pen amate a cingpa hi ding hi; amate hankhuh-ah a kumsuh suoh uhi; amate a meel uh siemang ding a, Misikhuo a inn uh hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle Misikhuo vanglietna panin Pasien in ka hlagau ei tanh ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama in keima ei sang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi kimkhat hau-in a inn sung vuah a nei le lamte uh a pun ciengin zau sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen amate a si ciengun bangma a keng sih ding uhi; a hauna un amate a nuazui sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amate a hin sungin a nuomsa-in kingaisunin, nangma adingin na na hoi sep ciengin ang kiphat vangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />khuovah a mu ngai nawn lo dingin a pu a pate kung ma-ah amate a pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amau’ nopsahna ah mihingte kip suoh thei lo hi; amate pen a mangthai ganhingte tawh a kibang lel uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien in nisuo-a kipanin nitum dongin leitung zosie khawmin thu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hoina kicinna Zion panin Pasien ang taang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I Pasien uh ang pei a, a sip dide sih hi, ama mai-ah mi halvam thei meikuong om a, ama kimvelah hui husiepi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a mite thu a khen thei nadingin tunglam vante le leitung hlan hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Biehpiehna tawh kei tunga thuciemna a bawl, ka kungah ka mi citahte hing khawm un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien mama thukhenpa ahi ziehin, vantung in ama’ dihna a pholah hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mite aw, za un, keima in thu kang gen ding hi, Israel aw, na langkhatah keima teci ka pang ding hi. Kei pen Pasien ka hi a, noma’ Pasien ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kang phawsietna uh pen na biehpiehna zieh ahi sih hi; na meihal biehna zong ka mai-ah a om den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Keima in na inn panin bawngtang ahi a, na ganbuh panin keelte ahi zongin ka sang sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile gamlah a ganhingte zosie keima-a’ ahi a, muol tul tampite tunga a om ganhingte zong keima-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hui lahah vate zosie ka thei a, gamlaha a gamta zosie keima-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ka gil a kiel leh nang kang gen sih ding hi, azieh pen leitung le a sunga om zosie keima-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in bawngtang sa ne-in, keelte’ sisan ka dawn amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko biehpiehna pie un, tuale Sangpen Pa tungah na kiciemna tangtun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hahsat hun ciengin keima ei hlan un; keima in kang hunkhie ding a, nangma in kei nei minthangsah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in migilote tungah thu gen a: “Ka thukhamte na gen nading ule na nephu utawh ka thuciemna na gen nadingun, note in thuneina bang nei na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile note in khalna na mu da vua, na nua lam vuah khalna na paimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Guta khat na mu ciengun lawm le guolin na bawl pai vua, a pahtat mite tawh na kigop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sietna lamah na kam na pie vua, na leii un zuouthu a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />To-in na sanggampa langpangin thu na gen uhi; note in na nu sungkuon na laizomte mama’ minsiet nading na gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tam tengpi na bawl zo ta vua, bangma ka ham sih hi; kei pen noma tawh a kibangin nei ngaisun uhi. Hinanle tu-in kang phawhsie vua, tuale keima in na mai vuah na mawna uh kang lui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Tua ciengin Pasien a mangngil note aw, tami thu na ciemte ta un. Tua hi sihle keima in note kang bottel ding a, ang hunkhie ding koima a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Biehpieh nadinga lungdamkona ang peipi mi in kei ei patawi ahi hi; keima in dihna lampi a zuite tungah Pasien’ hutdamna ka lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, na itna kip dung zui-in keima ei lainat in; a kicing na lainatna dung zui-in ka khielnate ei phietpieh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka khielna panin ei silsieng kilkel inlen, ka mawna panin ei siengsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen ka khielnate ka thei a, ka mai-ah ka mawna a om zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang, nang tung behah kang maw zo ta a, nangma’ muna-ah a sie ka gamta zo ta hi, tuaci’n na thukhenna ah nang na dih a, thu na khen ciengin gen na baang sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tahtahin kei a khielsa-in ka suoh a, ka nu in ei pai cil a kipanin mawnei ka hi tabo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na sunglam mi ah thuman na dei hi; tua ziehin ka lungsim tawngah pilna ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hyssop tawh ei nawt sieng lacin kei ka sieng ta ding hi; ei sil sieng lacin vua sangin ka ngozaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungdamna le kipahna thu ei zasah in; na hlietawngsa gu le tangte hing lungdamsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka mawnate panin na mai hing phuol inlen, ka khielnate zosie ei phietmangpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka sungah lungsim siengtho hing siem inlen, keima sungah lungsim tha le lungsim dih ei guon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma’ opna panin kei ei paimang sinlen, keima kung panin na hlagau siengtho ladawh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na hutdamna ziehin lungnopna ei piekia inlen, lungsim thanopna tawh keima ei panpi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in mikhielte na lampi ka hil ding a, nang lamah mawneite ang kiheikia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien, keima’ hundampa Pasien aw, sisan suo nading panin keima ei hunkhie in, tua hile ka leii in ngaitahin nei hutdamna la a sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa aw, ka nephu ei kah pieh in, tua hile ka kam in nangma phatna a pholah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile biehpiehna-ah na lungkim sih a, meihal biehna hing pie leng zong na lungdam tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien’ san thei biehpiehna pen a kitamzan lungsim ahi hi; Pasien aw, nangma in a kitamzan le a kisiakia lungsim na simmaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hoi na sah bangin Zion tungah a pha bawl in; Jerusalem kulpite lamkia in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tuaci’n a man biehpiehnate ahi, meihal biehnate le meihal biehna bup ah na lung a kim ding hi; tua ciengin na maitam tungah bawngtangte ang kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi thahatpa aw, Pasien’ mite suhsietna ah bang dingin kisiel na hei? Sunthapai-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nang in siet nading na ngaisunsun hi. Zuou nasempa aw, na leii zong mulmetna namhiem bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hoina sangin sietna na deizaw a, thuman gen ding sangin zuouthu gen nuom na sazaw hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zuou thei leii aw, nang in mi valtum thei ding kammal zosie na dei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in kumtawnin nangma ang satguoi ding hi; ama in na buh panin hing zamin ang ehmal ding hi; ama in a hingte’ gam panin ang phungbaw ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midihte in nang hing mu-in a zau ding vua, sietna a bawl mite nuisanin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Pasien a bel lo, a kicing a haunate a muong, nei le lamte a bel mipa en vawi un,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin kei ka hi leh Pasien’ inn sungah olive singkung hing silsel tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na bawlsa nate ziehin lungdam kang ko zing ding hi. Tam pen thuhoi ahi ziehin thuman mite opna-ah nangma’ min ka pholah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mimawte in a lungsim sung vuah Pasien om sih,” a ci uhi. Amate a kisie gawp vua, sil kidahhuoite a sem uhi; a hoi-a a gamta mawng koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A pil le Pasien sui mi khat beh a om ei ci a mu dingin, Pasien in vantung panin mihingte ei ensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate a unpi-in a puamang vua, a kibangin a letat kim uhi; sil hoi a bawl koima a om sih a, khat beh om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien tunga thu a ngen lo, an neh banga ka mite a netum, sietna a bawl mite in theitelna a nei sih uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangma cih huna tua bang zauna a om ngai lo, zauna lienpi sungah amate a om ding uhi. Azieh pen Pasien mi lote’ gu le tangte Pasien in a thethang ding hi; Pasien in amate nuol zo ahi ziehin amate maizumin kikoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zion panin Israel-te ading hutkhietna hing tung taleh izaw! Pasien in ama’ mite nopsahna a piehkia ciengin Jacob a lungdam ding hi; Israel zong a kipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, na min tawh ei hundam inlen, na thahatna tawh ka dihna talang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka thungetna ei za in; ka kama ka thugente ei ngaipieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen kei ei do dingin mi kiphasahte ang kipan vua, mi hepi thei lote in tha dingin ei sui uhi; amate in a masang vuah Pasien a koi sih uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien pen ei panpi pa tahtah ahi a, Topa ka hinna a tudet pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in a gitlona uh ziehin ka galte a thuhkia ding hi. Na thumanna sungah amate sumaimang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nopthu-a biehna tawh na tungah biehpiehna kang lui ding hi; Topa aw, na min ka phat ding hi, azieh pen tua khu a hoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in hahsatna zosie panin ei hunkhie a, ka mit in guolzawna tawh ka galte a en hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka thungetna ei ngai in; kang thumna panin kiphuol sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ei ngaipieh inlen,ei dawng in; ka mi mawsahna ziehin ka buoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Galte’ awging le migilote’ ei gentheisahna ziehin ka buoi hi. Azieh pen amate in kei tungah buoina ang tun vua, lungthahna tawh ei gal bawl ding amate in nuom a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sungah ka lungtang a na a, ka tungah si ding zaunate ang tung zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tungah zauna le linna ang tung a, zausina in ei vuanelh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Vakhu bangin hla nei leng maw! Ka kilen dawh ding a, ka kikhawl hit hiet ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />gamlapi-ah ka vahthap tahtah ding hi; gampalah-ah ka kigie ding hi; Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in hui husiepi pan le pingpeite panin ka kibuh nading ka naw sui ding hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, a kamham uh buoisah inlen, tawhnawi in; azieh pen khuopi sungah kheltatna le kiselna ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A sun a zanin kulpite tungah amate a kuolva kawikawi vua, tua sungah tatkhielna le buoina a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tua khuopi laikimah zong sietna a om hi; a vanzuana mun panin bawlsietna le solnate kihemkhie lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei ei tawhte khu ka galte ahi sih a, hi leh ka thuoh zo ding hi; kiphatsahna tawh ei bawlsie pen ka galte ahi sih hi- Hi leh amate kung panin ka kiphuol thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hinanle ka kikimpi, ka kigoppi, ka melthei mama ka guolpa, nangma na hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />nangma tawh nuomtahin i kipawl ngai a, Pasien’ inn sungah mihonpi tawh i peiton ngai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate tungah sina tungsah in; amate, Misikhuo-ah a hingin peisah suh in; azieh pen a inn sung ule a lungtang vuah sietna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle keima in Topa ka hlan a, Topa in ei hundam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nitah, zingmawng, le sunlai-in ka buoina thu genin ka tau vangut a, tuale ama in ka aw ei za ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in ka galdona panin liemna nei loin ei tankhie ding hi, bangzieh ahei cile kei ei do dinga a kiguol mi a tam mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tangtawng pana kumpi-a kikoi Pasien in, Selah za ding a, tuale amate a sunem ding hi, azieh pen amate kikhel loin, Pasien a giing sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka kithuopi pa in a guolpa tungah ama’ khut ngam a, ama in keima tawh a bawl thuciemna a palsat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thawbat sangin kamham nalzaw a, ahi vangin a lungtang ah gal bawlna a om hi; a kamham pen sathau sangin zolzaw a, hinanle tuate pen namsau dawhsa bang ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa tungah na vangih suon in, ama in ang puohpi ding hi; ama in midihte kilingsah ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hinanle Pasien aw, nang in dumthuh pen sungah amate na sepsuh ding hi; sisan luongsahte le mi solte ahile amau’ hin ding za alang zong a hing sih ding uhi. Ahi vangin keima in nang kang muong ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, mite in ei totcil ziehin kei ei hepi in; sunthapai-in amate in kei ei genthei bawl uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />mi tampi in ei do ziehin sunthapai-in ka galte in ei tuoncil uhi. Sangpen Pa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />kei ka zau ciengin, nangma kang muong hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />keima in a thu ka phat Pasien muongin ka zau sih hi; mihingte in kei bang ei law thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sunthapai-in amate in ka nat nading a sui uhi; a ngaisutna zosie uh ka siet nading vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in kisel nading thu bawlin ei buhdap uhi; amate in ka kalsuonnate ei encih uhi. Ka hinna a lah ding a kinep bangun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaci’n a khielna ziehun amate thuh in; thangpaina tawh tua mite paimang dawh ta’n Pasien aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang in ka da ka kaanate na ciemte zo ta a, nangma in na thawl sungah ka hlituite na thun hi. Na ciemtena laibu sungah tuate om hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin, keima kang kiko ni ciengin ka galte a nuakia ding uhi. Pasien keima-a’ ahi lam keima in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thu ka phat Pasien sungah, a thu ka phat Topa sungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien ka muong hi; kei ka zau sih hi. Mi maimai in kei bang ei law thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma tunga ka kiciemnate ka zui kul hi; keima in na tungah lungdamko biehnate kang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen nang in sina panin ka hlagau na hunkhie zo a, Pasien’ mai hinna khuovah sungah keima ka pei thei nadingin ka kitawnkhaw nading panin kei nei hunkhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei ei khuotuo in Pasien aw, ka hlagau in nang ang belh ziehin kei ei khuotuo in; sietna huipi a ven dongin, na hla lim nei kang bel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sangpen Pasien tungah, kei adinga a tupna a tangtungsah Pasien tungah ka kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in van panin hing sawlin keima ei hundam ding a, keima ei tuoncil mite maizumsah ding hi. Selah Pasien in a itna kip le a muonhuoina ang sawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Huoihamna tawh mi sa a ne humpite lahah ka lum hit hiet a, a ha uh tei le thaltang tawh kibang a, a leii uh zong namsau hiemte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien aw, vante tungah kitawisang in. Leitung zosie tungah na minthangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in ka ketot ah thang a sie uhi; ka hlagau a kunsuh hi. Amate in ka lampi-ah dum a to vua, hinanle tuami sungah amate ma a kie uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lung a kip hi, Pasien aw, ka lung a kip hi. La ka sa ding a, ka gingsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hla aw, khanglo in! Harp le lyre aw khanglo un! Keima in phalvah ka phong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw mite lahah nang lungdam kang ko ding hi; minamte lahah nangma phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen na itna kip vantung za-in a sang hi; nangma’ muonhuoina in meiilumte a banto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien aw, vante tungah kitawisang in. Leitung mun zosie-ah na minthangsah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />No pasien-te aw, a manin vai na hawm uh amah? Note in mite tungah a dihin thu na khen uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na khen sih uhi, na lungtang vuah gitlona bawl ding na sawm uhi; na khutte un leitunga tatsietna teng a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Migilote pen a nu gil sung panin a lampiel zo tham uhi; amate in a suo cil vua kipan khielna a bawl vua, zuouthu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Gul bangin gu a nei vua, amate in gulsum bilbing bangin a bil a hum uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaci’n amate in a hlimte’ aw ahi a, a zolsiemte’ aw ahi zongin a za sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien aw, a kam sung vua om a hate uh sutawng in; humpi khanglai’ hapa bawpieh in, Topa aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuiluong bangin amate maimangsah in; lopa bangin amate kituoncilin gawtasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate a nai lahah a zulmang tawhtol le, a hun cing lo-a a suoh, ni mu nai ngai lo nausen bangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na beelsuonte in tua lingkung kuong sa a sah masang, ama in a kuonglai ahi a, a hing lai ahi zongin, a mallangzaw-in phietmang taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Phulahna a mu ciengun midihte lungdam ding uhi; amate in migilote’ sisan sungah a keng a sil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mite in, “Midihte adingin thaman om tahtah hi; leitungah thu a khen Pasien om tahtah hi,” ci ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, ka galte kung panin ei hunkhie in; ka langa dingte kung panin keima ei dal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Sietna a bawl mite panin keima ei hunkhie in; sisan luongsah nuom mite panin keima ei hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tu nangawnin amate in tha dingin ei buhdap uhi; keima langkhatah mi thahatte in kisel nading a kuontaw uhi. Azieh pen Topa aw, ka tawnkhielna le ka mawna zieh hi lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ka khielna zieh zong hi lopi-in, amate tai-in a va kithawi ta uhi. Kei ei hu dingin hing tho in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang, Vanglien Topa Pasien, Israel’ Pasien na hi hi. Minam zosiete dan pie dingin hing tho in; solna tawh sietna bawl sawm mite koima hingkhawi sin. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nitah sielin amate a kilekia vua, ui bangin hamin, khuo sung tengah vahdap vakhuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kam utawh tuanah nahpi tahin a hawh vua, amate in a nephu utawh kamkhel nono a gen uhi. Azieh pen, “Koi in ei za ahei?” ci-in amate in a ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nang in amate na nuisan lel hi; nang in minamte zosie na zapi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka thahatna aw, nang kang ngah ding hi; azieh pen Pasien aw, nangma ka kulpi na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka Pasien in ama’ itna kip tawh keima ei na dawn ding hi; ka Pasien in guolzawna tawh ka galte ei ensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate that sin, na tha leh ka mite in mangngil kha ding uhi; nangma in na thahatna tawh amate vahvaisah inlen, amate niemsah in, ka lum uh ahi, Topa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a kam utawh a mawna uh, a nephu utawh a hamna ziehun, a kisahtheina sung vuah amate awhsah in. Azieh pen amau’ gen samsietna le zuouthu ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />thangpaina tawh amate netum inlen, a tawp sieng dongun amate netum in. Tuaci’n Pasien in Jacob tunga a uhna thu leimong dongah kithei ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nitah sielin amate kilekia-in ui bangin a ham vua, khuo sung tengah vahdap vakhuan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An sui-in a vah kawikawi vua, kham a nga zo sih uleh mi teng a ngih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hinanle keima in na thahatna la-in ka sa ding a, zingmawngin na itna kip phatna la ngai tahin ka sa ding hi. Azieh pen kei adingin nang kulpi na hi a, ka genthei cienga ka kibuhna na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thahatna aw, nangma phatna late ka sa ding hi, azieh pen Pasien aw, ka kulpi na hi a, itna kip ei lah Pasien na hi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, kote nei nuol zo a, ka kidalnate uh na satguoi zo hi; nang na lungthah zo ta hi; tu-in ka ngaingai uh ei bangsahkia in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in gam sung na kilingsah hi; nangma in leitang na pawhkehsah hi; kiling gawp ta ahi ziehin a keena munte hing matkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in na mite hahsatna na thuohsah zo a, nang in ei hawilensah lenggazu kote nei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thalkapna panin kihem a, amate a kikaikhop nadingun nang ang zatah mite adingin nang in diellap khat na khai zo hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na it mite a suotah thei nadingin, na khut zietlam tawh guolzawna pie inlen, kohaw’ ang ngetna ei dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ mun siengtho sungah Pasien in a kamciem zo hi: “Lungdam kipahna tawh Shechem ka phalsuo ding a, Succoth kuom ka sekhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead gam keima-a’ hi a, tuale Manasseh zong keima-a’ ma ahi hi. Ephraim gam pen ka sia lukhu hi a, Judah gam pen ka kumpi ciengkhut ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab gam pen ka kisilna kuong ahi hi; keima in Edom tungah ka kedap ka vih phei hi; Philistia gam tungah guolzo-in ka awng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Koi in kulpi tawh a ki-im khuopi-ah ei peipi ding ahei? Koi in Edom gamah kote ei pui ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma in kote ei nuol ta hi lo na mah? Pasien aw, ka galkapte tawh nang kuonkhie sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw, gal ka do nadingun huna ei pie in. Azieh pen mihing huna khu a mawhna ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Eite in Pasien tawh hangsan tahin i sem ding uhi; i galte ei totcilpieh ding pa khu ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka kikona ei za in; ka thungetna ei ngaipieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lung a gim ciengin leimong panin nang kang hlan hi. Kei sanga a sangzaw suongpi kungah kei ei pui in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile nang, ka kibuhna na hi a, galte langkhatah a muonhuoi tausang na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na puonbuh sungah kumtawnin ei tengsah inlen, na hlate’ hutna hlim nei-ah kibuhna ei musah in. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien aw, nang in ka thuciemte na za zo hi; nangma’ min ang zatah mite’ luo ding gougil kei nei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa hing khansausah in; ama’ khankum zong khang zosie adingin kip zing taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama Pasien’ mai-ah kumtawn kumpi hi taheh; itna kip le muonhuoina in ama kembih taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuaci’n nisimin ka thuciemna kang pieh ma bangin, a tawntungin na min phatna late ka sasa ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Azieh pen ka hlagau in dai dide-in Pasien beh ngah hi; ama kung panin ka hutdamna ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama beh ka suongpi, ei kihutdamna le ka kulpi ahi hi; kei ka kilawh ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Note zosie in mi khat bang tanvei do-in, palpua le thaw-awn tawh a kibang no ang lel mi khat bang tanvei susie ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ gelna ahile, mi thupi khat khiehsuh ding beh ahi hi. amate in zuouthu gen nuom a sa uhi. Amate in a kampi utawh mi a phat vangun, a sungtawng vuah mi a samsie uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka hlagau in dai dide-in Pasien beh a ngah hi, azieh pen ka lametna ama kung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama beh ka suongpi le ka hutdamna, ka kulpi ahi hi; kei ka kilawh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien tungah ka hutkhietna le ka minphatna a kinga hi; ama pen ka suongpi muonhuoi, ka kibuhna Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite aw, ama muong zing un; na lungtang uh ama mai-ah sung un. Pasien pen eite adinga i kibuhna ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Dinmun niem mite ahile husan khat beh ahi vua, dinmun sangte zong khu kisolna ahi bo hi; tawi a kikhai ciengin a lep zo sih uhi; a kigawmun naahu khat sangin amate a zangzaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pauhat thu tawh ngana pen muonin nei sih unlen, guhtatna-ah zong kimot muon sih un; Na hauna uh a khan leh tuate tungah na lungtang koi sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Khatvei Pasien in gen zo hi: tami pen nivei ka zahna ahi hi: vanglietna pen Pasien-a’ ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa aw, itna kip nangma-a’ ahi hi. Azieh pen nangma in a sepna utawh kituohin amate na thuhkia hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, nang ka Pasien na hi hi, ke’n nangma kang sui a, ka hlagau in ang hlangai hi; tui op lona gamgawta le gimna gam sunga om bangin, ka tahsa in nangma ang ngai vangut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaci’n na vanglietna le na minthanna a mu dingin keima in mun siengtho sungah nangma kang en zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hinna sangin na itna kip a hoi zawh ziehin, ka nephute in nangma ang phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n ka hin sung tungtawnin nang kang phat ding a, keima in ka khutte lamto-in nangma kang hlan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lupna tungah nang kang ngaisun a, zanthapai-in ka lung ngaingai ciengin pawi antui pente bangin ka hlagau a lungtai a, ka kam in kipahna nephute tawh nangma ang phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Azieh pen kei ei panpi nangma na hi ziehin, keima in na hla hlim nei-ah kipah tahin la ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hlagau in nang ang bel a, na zietlam khut in ei tudet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hinanle ka hinna susie dinga ei suite, lei thuhpi sungah peisuh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Namsau’ hatna sungah amate kipie ding a, ngiete’ an a suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle Pasien sungah kumpipa lungdam ding a, ama tawh a kiciem zosie lungdam kipah ding uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile zuou gen kamte kihubing ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka phunna aw ei za in; galte zauna panin ka hinna ei kem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Migilote’ sawmdapnate, sietna bawlte’ vaihawmna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />namsau tat banga a leii uh a tat mite, thaltang banga thu hoilo tawh mi a dawite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />a buhdapna panun genbaang lo mi kapte panin keima ei lie in; amate in zau vawt loin thakhatin a kap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thusie ngaisutnate uh amate in a tudet uhi; a thang dapsie ding thu a gen vua, “Koi in eite ei mu ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite’ mawna koi in kantel zo ding ahei? Kupil tahin i dapgel zo uhi,” ci-in a ngaisun uhi. Bangzieh ahei cile mihing lungtang le lungsim thuh mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hinanle Pasien in amate a thaltang tawh a kap ding hi; amate thakhatin liem gawp ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A leii ziehun ama in amahaw sietna thuohsah ding hi; amahaw a mu kha zosie in zau-in ling ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ciengin mi zosie a zau ding uhi; amate in Pasien’ piensah thute a gen ding vua, ama’ sepsa thute a ngaisunsun ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midihte in Topa sungah lungdamin ama bel ta uheh. Lungsim mante zosie in ama phat taheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, Zion ah nangma phat ding a kilawm hi; na kungah kiciemnate ang kibawl ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />nang, thungetna a dawng pa aw! Na kungah mi zosie ang pei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gamtatkhielnate in ei thuzaw ciengin, nang in ka khielnate uh nei maisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na huong sungah tengin, na kung ang nai dinga na teelsa mite thupha nga ahi uhi. Na biehinn siengtho, na inn sunga hoina tawh kote ka lungkim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kote kihutdamna Pasien aw, na sil lamdang sepnate le nangma’ hutkhietna tawh kote nei dawng hi; nang pen tuipi a gamla pente le leimong dongah mi zosie’ kinepna na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma’ thahatna tawh muolpite na phutdet hi; nangma in vanglietna tawh na kawng na gah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang in tuipi gingte, tuihuol gingte le mipi gamlumnate na daisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leimong pen-a teng mite in na sepna limte a giing uhi; nangma in nisuona le nitumna kikala om mite lungdam kipahin na awngsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang in leitung vilin tui na buoh a, leitung nahpitahin a hoina na belap hi; Pasien’ gunpi zong tui tawh a kidim hi; nangma in mite an na sih a, nang in tua bang dinga na bawlkhol ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tangkuongte ah tui niengtahin na buoh a, leivumte na zalhmai a, guotui tawh tuate nipsahin, ankungte thupha na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma’ hauna tawh cithei kum na hisah hi; na leeng peina tengah sathau a taah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Senel gam gan cinna munte lonona tawh kidimin, muoltang teng zong lungdamna tawh na tuom a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />lonona munte zong tuuhon tawh kizemin, kuomte zong an tawh kidim hi, amate lungdamin awngin la a sa ton uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung mi zosie aw, Pasien tungah kipahna aw gingsah un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama’ minthanna la-in sa un; ama tungah patawina thupitah pie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien kungah, “Na silbawlte zauhuoi-in lamdang sam e! Na vang lien mama ahi ziehin, na mai-ah na galte a meikhup uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung mi zosie in nangma ang bie uhi; amate in nangma phatna la a sa vua, na min phatna la a sa uhi,” ci un. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hing pei unlen, Pasien’ sepsate hing en un: Mite lahah a nasepnate lamdang mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in tuipi pen leigaw a suohsah hi; amate a keng utawh tua tuipi na galkai uhi. Khumtah ama sungah eihaw i kipah vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in a thahatna tawh kumtawnin uh a, ama in mit tawh minamte a vil zing hi, a ledo mite ahi uleh kitawisang da ta uheh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite aw, i Pasien phat un, ama phatna ging kizasah un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ama in a hingte lahah eite ei kem a tuale i kengte uh a kitawnkhaw sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien aw, nang in kote nei sittel hi; mei tawh ngun a kisit bangin kote nei encien zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lenthang sungah kote nei peipi hi; nangma in ka elzang vuah vangih nei suon hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ka lutung vuah mite na tuongsah hi; kote in mei le tui ka nawh uhi; hizongle nang in mun tanzau ah kote nei peipi zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Meihal biehna tawh na inn sungah kang pei ding hi; nangma tungah ka kiciemnate kang pie ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />tuate pen ka lungkham cienga, ka nephu tawh ka thugente le ka kam tawh ka kamciem thute ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in nangma tungah ganhing thau tawh meihal biehnate, tuutang biehpiehna khute tawh biehna ka lui ding hi; Keima in bawngtangte le keelte tawh biehpiehna ka bawl ding hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien a zatah zosie aw, hing pei unlen ei za un, ama in keima dinga a silbawlte kang gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama kungah nahpi tahin ka kiko a, tuale keima in ka leii tawh ama ka patawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka lungtang sungah gitlona a kem hi leng, Topa in ka thugen ei ngaipieh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hizongle Pasien in ka thugen ei ngaipieh tahpi hi; ka thungetna kammalte ama in ei zahpieh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka thungetna ei nuol loin, keima kung panin a itna kip hemkhie lo ahi ziehin, Pasien in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien in eite ei hepi-in thupha ei pie hinlen, tuale ama in eite tungah a mai hing tangsah taheh. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua hile, leitungah na lampi kithei ding a, minam zosie lahah a vanglien na hutdamna kithei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien aw, mite in nangma hing phat hinlen, mi zosiete in nangma hing patawi ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minamte in lungdam kipahin la sa uheh, azieh pen nang in dihtahin mite thu na khenpieh a, tuale nangma in leitungah minamte lam na lah hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien aw, mite in nangma hing phat taheh; mi zosie in nangma hing patawi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Leitang in ga tampi pie zo hi; Pasien, eite’ Pasien in thupha ei pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien in eite thupha ei pie suoh taheh; leimong donga mi zosie in ama zatah uheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien hing tho hinlen, a galte kithethangsah taheh; a masangah ama muda mite taimang ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu a kimutmang bangin tua bangin amate mutmang ta’n; mei mai-ah khuoinun a zun bangin migilote zong Pasien mai-ah mangthai ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahi vangin midihte lungdam ta uheh; Pasien mai-ah amate lungdamin kitom vazawh uheh; amate in lungdam kipahna tawh pawi bawl uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pasien tungah la sa un, ama’ min phatna la sa un; meiite tunga tuong pa la khat tap un, ama’ min Topa ahi hi, ama mai-ah lungdamin kitom un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pa nei lote’ pa le meigongte a huoi pa ama’ tenna siengtho-a om Pasien ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pasien in a cimaw mite ten nading inn le lo guon hi; ama in thongkie mite nopsahna munah a pui hi, ahi vangin mi ledote ahile pawn gawta-ah a teng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien aw, na mite’ mai-a na kuonkhiet cieng, senel gam nawhin na pei ciengin, Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sinai Pasien ahi Pasien’ opna, Israel Pasien ahi Pasien’ opna munah, leitung kiling gawp a, vantungte in guo a zusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma in a kicingin guo na zusah a, nangma in gamcin teng na tapnom hi; na gouluo mite basamin a vulgawp uh ciengin nangma in amate na nosuosah kia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />na tuunote in tua munah a ten nading a mu uhi; Pasien aw, na hoina tawh mi cimawte’ kisapna na sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in thu pie hi; lungdamna thu puoh mihonte a tam mama hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Galkapte’ kumpite, amate tai uhi, amate tai uhi!” a ci uhi. Inn a om numeite in galvan kilate a hawm vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />amate tuukui lah po-ah teng nan ule tua vante pen- ngun tawh kizut vakhu hlakuite ahi a, a hlamulte kham citah tawh kizut ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vanglienpa in kumpite, khumtah ah a thezah ciengin, Zalmon muol tungah vua a kie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Muol lienpi, Bashan muol aw; dawnzum tampi a nei muol, Bashan muol aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dawnzum tampitah a nei muol aw, Pasien in a tenna dinga a deigaw muolpi, Topa ten den nading mun, bang dingin note in thangsietna tawh na et uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sakol leeng muonhuoi tul sawmni, galkap a tultulte tawh Sinai muol pan siengtho munah Topa ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Muolsang tungah na kato a, na galmatte na zawpi diudeu a, nang in mite tung le tua munah Topa a ten thei nading a ledo mite tung nangawn panin letsongte na sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nisiel a i vangih uh ei puohpi Topa in minthanna nga taheh; Pasien pen i kihutdamna ahi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Eihaw’ Pasien pen hutdamna Pasien ahi a, sina pan suohtahna pen Topa Pasien-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Pasien in a galte’ lutangte, a khielna uh lam a zui samsau mite’ lukhute a suguoi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in amate, “Bashan panin ka peipi kia ding a, amate tuipi thuhte panin ka peipikia ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />tuaci’n note in sisan sungah na keng na sil ding uhi, tua khu galte’ tung panin na uite un lie ding a nei thei nading uh ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pasien aw, kingtaha nang hon pei uh kimu a, a siengtho mun-ah ka Kumpipa, ka Pasien kingtaha nang pei uh kimu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />lasate a mai-ah, tumging tumte a nua lamah, a laikimah numei tawmtumte in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />“Mihon kikhopna sungah Pasien phat unlen, no Israel suonte aw, Topa patawi un!” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate lahah mi citawm pen ahi Benjamin-te makai-in, amate zomah Judah uliente, Jebulun uliente, Naphtali uliente le a mipite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Pasien aw, na vanglietna hlan in; kote dinga na bawlsa bangin, na thahatna hing lah in, Pasien aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jerusalem-a om na biehinnpi ziehin kumpite in na kungah letsongte ang puoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pumpeng lahah a teng gamsate, bawngtang honte le mipite’ bawngnote phawhsie gawp in. Sieh le kaih a lunggulte tuoncil in; galsim nuom a sa mite kithezah sah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Egypt panin sumngo kipuohsah in; Pasien tungah Ethiopia in a khutte zahsah meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leitung kumpi gamte aw, Pasien tungah la sa un; Topa tungah phatna la sa un. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vantungte, tanglai vantungte a tuongpa aw, ngai in, ama in vanglien tahin ama’ aw, a ngai mama ama’ aw gingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pasien tungah vanglietna pie un, Israel tungah ama’ thupina om hi; ama’ vanglietna pen vantungah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />A siengtho muna om Pasien, Israel’ Pasien zatahhuoi mama hi; ama in a mite tungah thahatna le vanglietna a pie hi. Pasien in thupha nga taheh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, ei hundam in, bangzieh ahei cile tuite in ka ngawng cieng ang ban ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keng hlah nading om lona mun buonnawi lahah ka tumsuh hi; buonnawi thuh sungah ka tumsuh a, pansie ding a om vawt sih hi; tuithuh sungah ka tumsuh a, tuikhang in kei ei vuanel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kikona-in ka gim gawp hi; ka dang zong a gawta hi. Keima in Pasien ka ngangana-in ka mitte a miel ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A hang om lopi-a ei mudate, ka lu tunga samzamte sangin a tamzaw uhi; kei ei susie ding mi tam mama a, ka galte in zuouthu tawh kei ei mawsah uhi. Keima in ka guh lopi tu-in piekia ding ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma in ka motna na thei a, nangma kung panin ka tatkhielnate kisel lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, keima ziehin nangma ang lamen mite, maizumna thuohsah sin; Israel Pasien aw, keima ziehin nangma ang sui mite mindaisah vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma ziehin keima in zakona ka thuoh a, maizumna in ka mai a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sanggamte lahah gelta ka suoh ta vanuh a, ka nu sunga ka suopite lahah zong khuolmi ka suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na inn ka deiluotna in keima ei netum hi; nang ang hosiete’ hosietna teng keima tungah ang tu ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in an tangin lungsim ka kiniemkhieh ciengin, tua banga ka bawl ziehin amate in keima ei zako uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Puon bangin la-ip ka sil ciengin a thusie gentena uh ka suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei pen tunkot gei-a a to mite’ gensiet lel bepin ka om a, zukhamte in keima’ thu la-in a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, na kungah thu kang ngen hi. A kiningcing na itna kip tawh a kisan thei hunin ei dawng in, Pasien aw. A muonhuoi na panpina tawh
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />buonnawi lahah ka tumsuh nading panin keima ei suohtasah in. Tuithuhte le ka galte kung panin keima ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuikhang in keima ei vuanelsah sinlen, buonnawi thuhpi in zong ei valtumsah sin, ahi sihle keima tungah Leihawm in a kam ei khanelsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, na itna kip a hoi ziehin keima ei dawng in; a kiningcing nangma’ khuotuona dung zui-in kei lam hing kinga in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na nasempa kung panin na mai phuol sinlen, cimaw zo ta ka hi ziehin, keima ei dawng meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei lam ei neh inlen, ei tankhie in, ka galte kung panin ei suohtasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka thuoh gensietna, maizumna, le mindaina na thei hi; nangma in ka galte zosie na thei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kigensietnate in ka lungsim tamzan sah a, tuaci’n ka lung kie dihdeh hi. Ei khuotuo ding mi ka sui a, ahi vangin koima a om sih hi; ei henem ding mi ka sui a, ahi vangin koima ka mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in an tangin gu ei pie vua, ka dangta ciengin dawn ding tuithua ei pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amahaw adingin a sabuoi uh thang suohsah inlen, a kipawlpite adingin piel suohsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amate in a mu thei lo dingin a mit uh mielsah inlen, a tawntungin a kawng uh kithingsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Amate tungah na lungthahna sungsuh inlen, tuale nangma’ sinsona in amate bansah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Amau’ giephuol gamkhing suohsah in; a puonbuh sung vuah koima tengsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in na satgawp mite a bawlsie vua, tuale na liemsah mite zong a sim sawnsawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amau’ khielna tungah khielna belap in; amate in nang kung panin suotahna nga sih ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hingte’ laibu sung panin amate kiphietmang taheh; midihte lahah a min uh kikhum sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ahi vangin keima ei kiniem bawl a, na ka sa hi; Pasien aw, na hutdamna in keima ei dalsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Keima in la tawh Pasien’ min ka phat ding hi; keima in lungdamkona tawh ama ka liensah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tami in bawngtang khat, ahi sihle ki le kecin tawh bawngtang khat sangin Topa lungdamsah zaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Bawlsietna a thuoh mite in tam thu mu-in kipah ta uheh; no Pasien a sui mite aw, na lungsim nosuosah kia un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in mi cimawte’ aw za a, hentat kolbul a thuoh a mite don loin a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Vantung le leitung, tuipi le tuate sunga a gamta thei zosiete in ama phat ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Azieh pen Pasien in Zion a hundam a, tuale Judah khuopite a lamkia ding hi; tua sungah a nasemte tengin a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A nasemte’ tate in tua khu a luo ding vua, tua sungah ama’ min a it mite a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, nei hutkhiet ding hing lungkim mai in. Topa aw, keima ei panpi meng in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tha dinga ka hinna a suite maizumin buoimang sah in. Ka siet nading a dei mite nuakinin mindaisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ha, Ha!” a ci mite a maizumna ziehun kilesah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang ang suite zosie nangma sungah lungdamin kipah uheh. Na hutdamna a it mite in, “Pasien lien hi!” ci den ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hinanle kei zawngin ka cimaw hi; Pasien aw, hing kinaw ta’n! Nang keima ei hupa le ei hunkhie pa na hi hi; Topa aw, hing kiheh vawt sin!
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nang kang bel hi; kei ei maizumsah ngai sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na dihna sungah ei hun inlen ei suohtasah in; na bil kei lam ei ngat inlen, ei hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kei adingin ka buhna suongpi, ka kulpi muonhuoi hing hi inlen, ei hundam in, azieh pen ka suongpi le ka kulpi na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, migilote’ khut sung pan le mi thuman lote le mi gawgamte’ matna panin ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa aw, ka kinepna nang na hi a, ka khangno lai-a kipanin ka kimuonna nang na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka suo cil a kipanin na tungah kang kingam hi; ka nu gil sung panin keima ei ladawh pa na hi hi. Nangma kang phat ngitnget hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei pen mi tampite adingin a siehil bang ka hi a, hinanle nang a muonhuoi ka kibuhna na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma phatna tawh ka kam kidim a, sunthapai-in nangma’ minthanna tawh a kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka vuoi ciengin kei ei paidawh sin; ka tha a kieh ciengin kei ei nuasie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen ka galte in keima’ thu a gen vua, ei thatnuomin ei vil mite a kikumkum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in, “Pasien in a nuasiesa tua mipa del unlen, man un, azieh pen ama hunkhie ding koima a om sih hi,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pasien aw, keima kung panin gamla op sin; ka Pasien aw, kei ei hu dingin hing mallang in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei ei mawsahte maizumsah inlen, kisiesah in; keima’ siet nading a suite, simmawna le mindaina in tuomcip taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle keima in nang kang lamen den ding a, nangma kang phat semsem lai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na dih gamtatnate le na hutdamna nasepnate, ka thei zawh lo za dongin tam tama nan leh, sunthapai-in ka kam in a gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa Pasien’ a thupi nasepte a phat dingin kang pei ding a, keima in na dihna thu beh genin ka nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien aw, nang in ka khangno lai-a kipanin thu nei hil zo a, keima in na nasepna lamdangte ka gengen lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien aw, keima in ang khang lai ding khangtha zosie kungah na hatna ka pholah masangin, kei vuoi-in ka sam a kan cieng nangawnin ei nuasie vawt sin. Pasien aw, na vanglietna
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />le na dihna in van sangpite tung dong banto hi. Na lienpite a sem zo Pasien aw, nang tawh kibang koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gimna le tuosietna tampi ei musah nang in kei nei hingsahkia ding hi; nangma in lei thuhpite sung panin keima nei lakhie to ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima ei kizatahna na khangsah ding a, tuale nangma in khatvei keima nei henemkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, na thumanna ziehin harp lasahna tawh nangma kang phat ding hi; Israel-te’ Siengpen Pa aw, keima in lyre lasahna tawh na min kang phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangma phatna ka sah ciengin lungdamin ka nephute awng ding hi; na hutkhietsa ka hlagau zong lungdamin a awng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka siet nadinga a hanciemte kimaizumsahin a kiminsietsah zo ziehin, ka leii in sunthapai-in nangma in dihna tawh nei huna a gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma’ thutang, kumpipa pie inlen, nangma’ thumanna kumpipa’ tapa tungah pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in dihna tawh na mite thukhen hinlen, na mizawngte, thutang tawh thukhen heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Muol le tangte in thudih tawh mite adingin citheina piengsah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in mite lahah mizawngte vai panpi hinlen, mi cimawte hutkhietna pie-in, mi bawlsie pa tuoncil taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni le hla a op laisie khang tawntungin ama hing taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama lopa vatsa tunga a kie, lei a tapnom guotui bang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama’ hun sungin dihna pung hinlen, hlapi a om nawn lo dongin nopna om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in tuipi khat pan tuipi khat, Gunpi panin leimong dongin uhna nei taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama mai-ah a galte lukun uh hinlen, a galte in leivui lieh ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarshish kumpite le tuikul neu-a kumpite in ama tungah sieh le kaihte pie uh hinlen, Sheba le Seba kumpite in letsongte puoh ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A mai-ah kumpite zosie khupboh uh hinlen, minam zosie in ama’ na sem ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Azieh pen mi tasamte in a hlat ciengin ama in hunkhie a, a hu ding nei lo mizawngte hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in thanem le a tasamte hepi a, mi tasamte’ hinna hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama muna-ah amau’ sisan manphasa ahi ziehin, bawlsietna le tatsietna panin ama in a hinna uh tankhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama khansau taheh! Ama tungah Sheba khamte kipie taheh. Ama adingin thu kingetpieh zing hinlen, ama dingin sunthapai-in thupha kingetpieh zing taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua gam sungah an tampi pieng taheh; muol sangte dawnah ante kivihin, a gate zong Lebanon gam sunga bangin hoi thei taheh; tuale gamlah lopate bangin khuopi sung mite khanpha uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama’ min kip zing ta hinlen, ni a om laisie-in ama’ minthanna om suoh den taheh. Ama’ sungah minam zosie in thupha nga ta uheh; amate in ama thupha nga pa, ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na lamdang bawl pa ama beh, Israel Pasien Topa in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A minthang ama’ min in kumtawnin thupha nga taheh; ama’ minthanna tawh leitung buppi kidim taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jessi’ tapa David’ thungetnate a tawp ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungsim siengtho-in a thumante tungah Topa hoi tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hizongle kei ka hi leh ka keng a kisuipua dihtah hi; ka keng zong a kitawnkhaw dihtah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in migilote daupeina ka mu a; keima in mi kiliensahte ka eng hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in natna kici nei loin, a pumpite uh cidamin a zol sipsep uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midangte bangin amate in hahsatna a thuoh sih uhi; amate in mite bangin gimna a thuoh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin amau’ khi pen kiphatsahna ahi hi; tatsietna in puon bangin amate a tuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate ahile a thau sengin a mitkhu uh puoh a, a lungtangte uzong motna tawh a dimlet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in mi thusim loin, kimudana kam a ham uhi; amate in kihisahna tawh bawlsiet dingin mi a galgih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A kamte un vantung gensie a, a leiite un leitung bup tuomcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin mite kihei-in amate a phat vua, amate sungah mawna kici a mu sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in, “Pasien in bang a ci thei ding ahei? Sangpen Pa in theina a nei beh diei mah?” a ci uhi
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Migilote tam bang ahi uhi; a nop a thei-in a om vua, hauna lamah amate a khang semsem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka lungtang ka siensahna, le genbang lona-a khut ka silna teng a unpi-in amawhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in sunthapai-in gimna ka thuoh a, tuale zingmawng sielin dan ei kituohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Tam bangin gen vang,” ci leng, na tate tungah a thutah lo ka suoh ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ahi vangin tam thu bangci theitel ding ka hei ci-in ka ngaisut ciengin, keima’ gim nading bep khat hi tuoh ka sa lel a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien’ mun siengtho sung dongah ka va lut cieng behin, amau’ manthaina ding thu ka tel pan na bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma in a nalna munah amahaw na koi tahpi hi; nang in kisie-a a pua dingin amahaw na bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate bangci kisuhsiet a, zauna in amahaw a bangci tawmang dawh a ta diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amahaw pen zan mangmat tawh a kibang lel uhi; ang thawkia ciengun nang in a mangmat uh na thupisim ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka lungkhamin ka lungtang ei kisun bangin a nat ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ka maw dawh ta a, bangma ka thei sih hi; na tungah kei pen gamsa gilo tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hizongle kei pen nang tawh ka omton ngitnget hi; nang in ka zietlam khut nei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nang in thuhilna tawh nei pui a, a nua ciengin patawina tawh nei sangkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nang simlo vantungah koi ka nei ahei? Nang sanga ka lunggul zawh ding leitungah bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka tahsa le ka lungtang zawngkhal mai thei a, hizongle Pasien pen ka lungsim hatna le keima’ satanh ahi zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang tawh kigamla mite kisie tahtah ding uhi; nang in na tunga ang khielte na mangthaisah sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Hinanle kei adingin ahile Pasien tawh ka kinai a hoi hi; nangma’ nasepna zosie ka gen thei nadingin Topa Pasien pen ka kibuhna-in ka bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, bang dinga kote ei paimang zing ta na hei? Lonona muna na tuute tungah bang dingin meikhu bangin na lungthahna omsah na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tanglai-a na neisa na mihonte, nangma’ gouluo minam dinga na tatkhietsate phawh in. Nangma’ ten nading Zion muol khu hing phawh bo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kumtawn sietna-ah hing kalsuon in; galte in mun siengtho sunga na zosie susie zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na mun siengtho sungah na galte hawh vapuoh hi; amate in khum sungah a melcina uh limte a khai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in tunglam lutna-a kidaw singlangte heipi tawh a phua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin a kizem na zosie heipi le sehta tawh a satguoi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in na mun siengtho mei tawh a hal uhi; amate in lei dongin na min kisuonna mun zosie a buasah sieng ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate in, “Tuate i zo mang ding uhi,” a kici uhi; amate in gam sunga kikhopna mun zosie a halmang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kote in melcinate ka mu sih uhi; kamsang khat zong om nawn loin, bang tanvei sawt ding, ci-a a thei kote lahah koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pasien aw, galte in bang tanvei ciemmuina-in ei nei ding uh ahei? Na galte in kumtawnin na min a gensiet ding uh a ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang dingin na khut dawhkia-in; bang dingin na kang sungah na khut koi na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hizongle tanglai-a kipanin Pasien pen leitungah hutdamna na a sem ka Kumpipa ahi ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang in vanglietna tawh tuipi na phalsuo hi; nang in tuite tunga gulpi’ lutangte na satguoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang in Leviathan’ lutangte na satguoipieh hi; senel gam ganhingte’ an dingin ama na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangma in tuisam le tuinahte na phulsah hi; nangma in luitui luonglaite na kangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sun khu nang-a’ ahi a, zan zong khu nang-a’ ma ahi hi; a tang thei nate le ni zong nangma’ phusa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangma in leitung gamgi zosie na hlung zo hi; nangma in phalbi hun le khal hun na bawl zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa aw, galte ang nuisat dan le Pasien zatah lo mite in na min ang gensietna uh hing phawh ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na vakhu’ hinna khu gamsate lahah pie sin; na mizawngte’ hinkhuo hing mangngil zing sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na thuciemna hing thupisim in, bangzieh ahei cile leitunga a mielna munte, mi tatsiete’ zuolna mun suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kituoncil mite maizumsah sin; mizawng le mi cimawte in na min phatsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pasien aw, hing thoto inlen, na thu a dihin hing khen in; Pasien zatah lote in sunthapai-in ang gensietna uh phawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na galte kikona aw mangngil sinlen, ang langpante’ husa ging ang kato zing hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, na tungah nuomthu kang tut uhi; na min ang nai ahi ziehin nuomthu kang tut uhi. Mite in nangma’ silbawl lamdangte a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka sesa hun ang tun ciengin keima in a manin thu ka khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leitung le a tunga tengte zosie a kithin ciengin, a khuompite a tudet pa khu keima ka hi hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte tungah, “Kiphasah sih un,” ka ci a, tuale migilote kungah, “Kidomsang sih un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />na ki uh domsang sih unlen, ahi sihle ngawng vaipuohsa-in ham sih un,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile lapsangna pen nisuona lam pan ahi a, nitumna lam pan ahi a, gamlah pan ahi zongin ang pei ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin thukhen pa pen Pasien ahi bo a, ama in mi khat niemkhiehin, adang khat a lamsang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa’ khut sungah hoitah a kisawpawisa a phuon dildel lenggazu hai khat a om hi; ama in tua sung panin ang bungsuh ding a, tuale leitung migilo zosie in a dopkheng dongin a dawn ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hizongle kei ka kipah zing ding hi; keima in Jacob Pasien kungah phatna late ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in migilote’ hatna zosie ka tansanpieh ding a, hinanle midihte’ hatna kidomsang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Judah gam sungah Pasien kithei a, Israel gam sungah ama’ min lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Salem khuo-ah ama’ om nading kilam a, Zion khuopi sungah ama’ tenna mun a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in tua tahah a te lihleh thaltang lengte, lum, namsau, le galhiemte a hliehtawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na min thang mama a, kumtawna om muolte sangin nang na thupizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihangsante’ vante kilahpieh hi; amate a kimutsuoh gawp uhi; galkapte koima khat beh in a khut uh a lam zo ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jacob Pasien aw, nangma’ hosietna ziehin sakol le a tunga tuong tegel in khuo a phawh tuoh ta sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahi vangin nang na hi leh na zatahhuoi tahtah hi! Nang na lungthah nah leh na mai-ah koi ding ngam ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantung panin thukhenna na genkhie hi; leitunga bawlsietna a thuoh mi zosiete hundam dinga thukhen dingin na din ciengin leitung zau-in sip dide hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihing’ thangpaina pen nangma phatna-in kizang ding a, na lungthahna dangte pen na kawnga na kiga ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa na Pasien tungah kiciemnate bawl unlen, tuate tangtun un; ama’ kimvela a om mi zosie in a zatahhuoi mipa tungah letsongte puoh ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ama in gam-uhte’ lungsim suniem a, leitung kumpite sungah zauna a guon hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien kungah keima a gingin ka kiko a, ama in ei zah nadingin a gingin ka kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lungkham hunin Topa ka sui hi; keima in zanlai-in gim vawt loin ka khut ka zah hi; ka hlagau a kihenem zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien ka ngaisun a, tuale ka maumau hi; thu ka lungngaingai ciengin ka lung a gim mama hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma in a mit sing dingin keima nei koi sih hi; ka lung a kham sengin ka ham thei va-ia sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun luite ka ngaisun a, nidang lai hunte ka phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zanthapai-in ka lungsimah ka kihoho a, lung gelgelin ka lungsim ka kankan hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Topa in ei nuol peisuohin, maipha ei piekia ngai nawn lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama’ itna kip a tawp suoh ta amah? Ama’ thuciemte zong a maimang suoh ta amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi lungsiet ding Pasien in a mangngil ta amah? Ama lungthahin a lainatna a khahtan ta amah?” ka ci hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima in, “Sangpen Pa’ zietlam khut a kikhelna khu keima’ gimna ahi hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka lungsim sungah Topa’ silbawlte ka phawh ding hi; hun lui lai-a na bawl sil lamdangte ka phawh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nasepna zosie ka lungngaingai ding a, tuale a lien na silbawlte ka ngaisunsun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien aw, na lampi a siengtho hi. Eite Pasien za-a a lien bang pasien om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang na lamdangte a bawl Pasien na hi hi; nang in mite lahah na vanglietna na lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang in na banhat tawh Jacob le Joseph’ suon na mite na tankhie zo hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pasien aw, tuite in nangma ang mu ciengun, tuite in ang mu ciengun a zau uhi; tui thuhpi zong a ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Meiite in tui buosuh hi; vante zong to hi; nangma’ thaltangte zong muncin tengah a leng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pumpei sungah na vanto gingpi a om hi; na tunphete in leitung tanvah hi; leitung kilawhin a ling hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuipi tung tawnin lam na hla a, nangma’ lampi pen tuihuolpite tung ahi hi; hinanle na ketotte kimu lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nangma in tuuhonte bangin Moses le Aaron’ khut tawh na mite na pui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mite aw, kang thuhilna ngai un; ka kam tawh ka gen thute na bil ei ngat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in thugentena zangin ka kam ka kah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />i pu i pate in ei gensa, eite in zong i zah i theisa uh, tanglai-a a kigen thuthuhte kang genkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Eite in a tate kungah tua thute i im sih ding hi; eite in ang pieng lai ding khang thate tungah Topa’ minthan nasepnate, ama’ vanglietna le a sepsa sil lamdangte i gen ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in Jacob’ suonte tungah thupiehna khat bawl a, Israel mite tungah thukham khat koi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />tua khu amau’ zaw-a ang khangte le ang suoh nai lo naupangte in thei a, amate in a tate tunga a gensawn thei nading uh ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuaci’n amate in a muonna uh Pasien sungah a nga ding uhi; tuale Pasien’ nasepnate mangngil loin, ama’ thupiehte a zui ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />amate, a lungkhau a ledo khang mite, Pasien tunga lungsim kip nei lo, lungsim muonhuoi lo khang mite ahi, a pu a pate utawh a kibang sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraim-te in thalpi a tawi vua, gal kido ni-in amate a nuakia sieng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ thuciemna a zui sih vua, ama’ thukham tawh kituohin amate a gamta nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in a bawlsa le amate tunga a lahsa na lamdangte a mangngil uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in a pu a pate’ mu-in Egypt gam sung Zoan munte-ah sil lamdangte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in tuipi kikhen sahin, amate a kantansah a, tuite a lompi-in a dingsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in sun hunin meiipi khat tawh ahi a, zanthapai-in meikuong khat tawh ahi zongin amate a pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in senel gama suongpite pawhkeh sah a, ama in tuili thuh pana tui luong bangin, amau’ dawn dingin tui tampitah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in suongpi panin luituite luongsah a, tuale guntui luong bangin tuite a luongsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle ama tungah amate a maw lai veve vua, senel gam sungah Sangpen Pa a ledo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A du mama uh an a ngen vua, a lungsim sung vuah Pasien a zelah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Pasien a gensie vua, “Pasien in senel gam sungah sabuoi a pha thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tui a phul thei nadingin ama in suongpite satin luituite a luonsah mawh vangin, a mite adingin an zong pie-in sa zong a sih zo ngap ding amah,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin Topa in tua thu a zah ciengin, a nah lungthah mama hi; Jacob tungah mei kitaw a, Israel tungah ama lungthah semsem hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile amate in Pasien a um sih vua, ama’ hutdamna vanglietna a muong sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in tung lama om vante thu pie-in ama in van kotte a hong hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />amau’ neh dingin guo bangin manna zusah a, vantung an a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihingte in vantung mite’ an a ne uhi; ama in amate an tampitah a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in vantungah nisuona hui langsah a, ama’ vanglietna tawh leitaw lam hui a peikhietpi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in amate tungah leivui za-a a tam sa guo bangin zusah a, tuipi senel za-a a tam a leng thei vate guo bangin zusah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />ama in amau’ giephuol sung, amau’ tenna kim zosie-ah tuate a kiesah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ama in a dugaw pen uh pie zo ahi ziehin, amate in ne-in a gilva uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Hizongle amau’ du pen a kham masang uh, a kam sung vuah tua an a op laitahin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />amate tungah Pasien’ lungthahna tung a, tuale ama in amate sung panin a thahat pen teng that a, paapal tawh a kibang Israel muon le suon teng a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tam bangin pieng hi tama le amate a maw lailai uhi; amate in ama’ silbawl lamdangte a um tuon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a nite uh husan khat bangin a mangthai dingin bawl a, a khankumte uzong zauna tawh a mangthai dingin a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama in amate a tha ciengin, amate in ama a sui pan na bo uhi; amate a kisiekia vua, lunglut tahin Pasien a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Amate in Pasien pen amau’ suongpi, a tankhie Sangpen Pasien ahi lam a phawh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Hinanle amate in a kampi utawh ama a phat uhi; amate in a leii utawh ama tungah zuouthu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Ama tungah a lungsim uh a kip sih hi; ama’ thuciemna-ah amate a tahtai sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin ama in lainatna lungsim a nei ziehin, amau’ khielnate a maisah a, amate a susie sih hi; ama in khat veivei a lungthahna ip zelzel a, a thangpaina zosie a phong sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate mihing hi lel a, ang peikia nawn lo huilang bang ahina uh ama in a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in gamlahah bang zavei khat ama ledo-in, senel gam sungah lunggimsah uh ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate in Pasien a zelah thithe vua, Israel’ Siengtho Pa a phinphin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amate in ama’ vanglietna hile, ahi sihle ama in a galte panin amate a tatkhietna ni hile, a phawh kha vawt sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />ama in Egypt gam sunga a lah a sil lamdangte hile, Zoan gam sunga a bawl a na lamdangte hile a phawh kha vawt sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Amate in a luituite uh a dawn thei lo nadingun, ama in a guntuite uh sisan a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Ama in amate lahah a pet thei tho honpite, a susie thei uphawhte, amate lahah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Khuombai neh dingin ama in amau’ ante a pie a, amau’ sepsa gate zong kauphe neh dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ama in a lengguite uh gielpi tawh susie-in, a theithehte uh vuakhal tawh a suhsietpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ama in a bawngte uh gielpi in khiehlia sah a, a tuuhonte uzong keh in a khiehlia sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Amate tungah a zauhuoi a lungthahna, a thangpaina, a lungkimlona, a lunggimna, le a susie thei vantung mite honkhat ama in hla hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ama in a lungthah nading lampi khat a bawl hi; ama in sina panin amate hinkhawi loin, pul natna-ah amate a pie sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Ama in Egypt tacil zosie le Ham’ puonbuhte sunga amau’ hatna tawh a pieng ta masa teng a vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in a mite tuu bangin peipi a, tuuhon bangin senel gamah amate lam a pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Ama in muonhuoina munah amate a pui ziehin a zau sih uhi; ahi vangin tuipi in a galte a hlummang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tuale a zietlam khut tawh a zawsa muol ahi, ama’ muol siengtho tungah amate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Ama in amau mai-ah minamte a notmang hi; ama in amate luo dingin neisate a hawmpieh a, a puonbuh sung vuah Israel minamte a tengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Hinanle amate in Sangpen Pasien zelahin ledo uhi. Amate in ama’ thupieh a zui sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />a pu a pate uh ma bangun kihei-in a thuman sih uhi; a lelama a leng thaltang bangin amate a lampiel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a munsangte utawh amate in ama a lungthahsah uhi; amate in a milimte utawh ama’ hazat nadingin a phongkang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Pasien in a zah ciengin, ama thangpai mama a, tuale ama in Israel mite a pumnuol kiukeu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Ama in mihingte lahah ama’ opna puonbuh ahi, Shiloh-a ama’ tenna nuasie-in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />tuale ama in ama’ vanglietna pen sal suoh dingin a pie a, ama’ minthanna zong galte’ khut sungah a pie ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Ama in a mite namsau pie a, tuale gamhluo pa tungah a lungthahna a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Mei in a tangvalte katum a, tuale a numeite un mopawi-a sah ding la a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />A siempute uh, namsau in puasah a, a meigong numeite un zong kaateng a lo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Tua ciengin kimutna panin Topa khanglo a, galhang zukham pa bangin a awng vapo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ama in a galte a zo gawp hi; ama in a maizum zing dingin amate koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Ama in Joseph’ puonbuh nuol a, Ephraim minamte a teel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Hizongle ama in a it Zion Muol, Judah minamte a teel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Ama in a kip den dingin a phusa leitung bang le, a sang vantungte bangin a mun siengtho a lam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />Ama in a nasem David teel a, tuuhuongte panin ama a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Ama’ mi Jacob, ama’ gouluo Israel-te tungah tuu banga a cing dingin ama in tuupi tasen neite a cinna panin ama a la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Ama in thuman lungsim tawh amate a cing a, a khutsiemna tawh amate lam a pui hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, na gouluo gam sungah minamte ang lut hi; amate in na biehinn siengtho a buasah gawp uhi; amate in Jerusalem khuopi a kisiesah gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amate in hui lahah a leng vate neh dingin, na nasemte’ luonghawmte a pie vua, na mi muonhuoite’ sate zong leitung gamsate a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in Jerusalem kimkotah sisan tui bangin a buo vua, tuale amate a vui ding koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote zong khu ka vengte uh’ zako, ka kim vua om mite’ simmaw le nuisat ka hi ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, bang tanvei sawt lai ding na hei? A lungthah den ding na hi amah? Na hazat thangpaina mei banga kuong ding ahi amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma ang thei lo minamte tung le na min ang hlan lo kumpi gamte tungah nangma’ lungthahna sungsuh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate in Jacob a valtum vua, ama’ tenna mun a susie gawp uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate uh’ mawnate, kote tungah ei phul sin; kote kang kiniemkhieh ziehun na lainatna hing tungsah meng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hutdamna uh Pasien aw, nangma’ minthanna dingin kote ei hu in; na min na khuolna-in ei hunkhie inlen, ka mawnate uh zong ei ngaidam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte in bang dingin, “A Pasien uh hei-ah a om ta ahei?” ci thei poma ding uh ahei? Na nasemte’ sisan phu na lahna, minam dangte lah, koma’ muna-ah kitheisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangma mai-ah thongkiete’ tauna hing tung hinlen, na vanglietna tawh kizui-in, a si dinga kikoi mite suohtasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in nang ang zakona ma utawh ka vengte’ kang sungah a za sagi-in thuh in, Topa aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin ko nangma’ mite, na lonona sunga tuute in na tungah lungdam kang ko zing ding uhi; kote in a khang khangin nangma phatnate ka simkiakia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuuhonte banga Joseph a pui, Israel a cingpa aw, ngai in! Cherub-te tunga a to nang pa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephraim, Benjamin le Manasseh mai-ah hing tangkhie in. Na tha san inlen ei hun dingin hing pei in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngaingai uh ei bangsah kia in, Pasien aw; hutdam ka hi thei nadingun na mai hing tangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, na mite thungetna-ah nang bang tanvei lungthah ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in amate hlitui an tawh na vah zo a, amate dawn dingin hlitui a dimin na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma in ka vengte’ simmaw dingin kote nei bawl hi; ka galte un amahaw lahah kohaw nuizat nopna-in ei nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ngaingai uh ei bangsah kia in, Vanglien Pasien aw; hutdam ka hi thei nadingun na mai hing tangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangma in Egypt panin lenggui khat nang puo hi; nang in minamte na notdawh a, tua khu na suon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in tuami adingin leitang na paw sieng hi; tuami in zung thuh hing hla-in gam sung teng a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A hlim in muolte a khu a, a bazaute in zong taamtah singkung golte a khu hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />tuipi lamah a bate zam a, a dawnngehte in Gunpi lam zuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ciengin lampi-a pei mi zosie in ama’ ga a law thei nadingin, bang dingin a daithawte na suhsietpieh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Gamlahah a om ngal in tua khu a susie gawp a, gam sunga om ganhing zosie in kivana-in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hing kilekia in, Vanglien Pasien aw; vantung panin ei ensuh inlen ei mu in; tami lenggui don in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua khu nangma’ zietlam khut tawh na suonsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in mei tawh halin, a phuamat sieng uhi; nangma’ thangpai etna ziehin amate kisiesah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hinanle nang dinga na hatsah, na zietlam a om mipa tungah na khut ngam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hile na kung panin ka kiheikia nawn sih ding uhi; kote hinna ei pie in, tua hile nangma’ min kang hlan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, ka ngaingai uh ei bangsahkia in; hutdam ka hi thei nadingun na mai hing tangsah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I thahatna ahi Pasien tungah nahpitahin la sa un; Jacob’ Pasien tungah lungdamin awng un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />La sa-in tawm tum unlen, a ngaih lyre lasahna le harp tum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hla tha ni, hlalia ni, i pawi ni-in pengkul tum un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen tami khu Israel adingin thukham ahi a, Jacob Pasien’ biehna ngaina a kip khat ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Egypt gam sunga a pei lai-in ama in Joseph tungah thupiehna khat a bawl hi. Keima in ka thei ngai lo aw khat ka za hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Keima in a liengko vua vangih ka zangsah hi; na khutte un zong law a dom nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na lungkham uh ciengin keima nei hlan vua, keima in note kang hunkhie hi; a kilang lo vanto sung panin note kang dawng hi; keima in Meribah tuite ah note kang zelah hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka mite aw, kang thuhil laitahin za un; Israel-te aw, keima’ thu ngai locin ci tei ing e!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Note lahah pasien dang a om sih ding hi; gamdang pasien mai-ah na kun sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei pen Egypt gam panin note ang peipi to, na Topa Pasien uh ka hi hi. Na kam uh golkah un, keima in kang dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hinanle ka mite in ka thugen a ngai sih uhi; keima tungah Israel-te ang kipha sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n a nop banga gamta dingin a lungkhauna sung vuah amate ka ap ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka mite in ka thu ei ngai hinlen, Israel-te in ka lampi zui uleh izaw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuaci’n keima in a galte uh mallangin ka zawpi ding a, a galte uh’ langkhatah ka khuttum ka ziel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa a mudate in ama mai-ah a thum ding vua, amau’ gimthuohna zong a kip peisuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mangbu tuituoh pen tawh note kang vah ding a, suongpi pana khuoizu tawh kang lungtaisah ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vantung thu kikupna sungah Pasien in a panmun a la hi; pasien-te laikimah ama in thu a khen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Note in bang tanvei a man lopi-in thukhenin, migilote tungah angvanna lah ding na hi uh ahei? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi thanemte le pa nei lote tungah a dihin thu khen un; mizawngte le tasamte’ nga ding hamphatna kepcingpieh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thanemte le tasamte suohtasah un; migilote khut sung panin amate hunkhie un,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate in theina hile, theitelna hile a nei sih vua, tuate khuomiel sungah a gamtat ziehun leitung bulpite zosie a kilinglawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ke’n, “Note pasien-te na hi vua, na unpi-un Sangpen Pa’ tate na hi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />hizongle mite bangin na si ding vua, ulien khatpo bangin na pua ding uhi,” kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien aw, hing thoto inlen, leitung thukhen in; azieh pen minam zosie nangma-a’ ahi hi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, dai dide-in om sin; lungnuomin sip dide sin, Pasien aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu nangawnin na galte in buoina a bawl uhi; nang ang mudate in a lu a pongsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in ngienkawi tawh na mite a lebawl uhi; amate in na kepcing mite langpangin a kikum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in, “Hing pei un, amate, minam khat hina panin phietmang vai; Israel’ min kici mawngmawng kiphawhsah nawn sih vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amate kithu khatin a kihosim uhi; nang hing langpangin thuciemna khat a bawl uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Edom’ puonbuhte le Ishmael-te, Moab-te le Hagri-te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebal le Ammon, le Amalek-te, Philistia-te le Tyre-a mite tawh ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assyria-te in zong amate a pawlpi uhi; Lot’ suonlehlahte adingin pawl muonhuoite ahi uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midian-te tung, le Kishon Lui-a Sisera le Jabin-te tunga na bawl bangin amate tungah zong bawl in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />amate En-dor-ah kisusie a, amate leilahah eh a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A miliente uh Oreb le Zeeb bangsah inlen, a lamkaite zosie uh Zebah le Zalmunna bangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pasien’ lonona gam teng i tan dingun kilah vai,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka Pasien aw, amate pumpei sunga a leng buathah le hui in a tawmang ansi leng bangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mei in gampalah a kahtum bang le, meikuong in muolpite a kuonsah vapual bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />na pumpei tawh amate nuadel inlen, na khuopi hui tawh amate zausisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, amate in na min ang sui thei nadingun, a maitangte uh zumna tawh kidimsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate maizumin lungkiesah den in; amate mindaisah inlen, mangthaisah sieng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa a kici min nei nangma beh na hi hi, leitung mun zosie-ah Sangpen Pa na hi lam amate theisah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vanglien Topa aw, na tenna mun bangza-in etlawm ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hlagau in Topa’ huongte a hlangaih seng ziehin a tha a zawm vawt va-ia hi; ka lungsim le ka pumpi in hingzing Pasien tungah lungdam kipahin la a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vanglien Topa, ka Kumpipa le ka Pasien aw, na biehna maitam tungah vato nangawn in a inn ding a mu a, sielpaleng in zong ama op nading, a note a koi nading bu a mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma’ inn sungah tengin, nangma phatna la a sa zing mite thupha nga ahi uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma sungah a thahatna uh omin, a lungtang vuah Zion zotna lampi a zui nuom mite thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Baca kuom kantanin amate a pei laitahun, amate in tuami kuom pen ciatui phulna mun a suohsah uhi; tua mun pen guotui masate in zong buoltuite tawh a kidimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate a pei kawmun a tha uh hat semsem hi; Zion-ah pasien-te’ Pasien kimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, ka thungetna ei za in; Jacob Pasien aw, ka thungetna ei ngai in! Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka kidalna uh lum ei etpieh in; na sathau nu pa’ maitang zong hing en vawi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mun danga ni tulkhat ka op sangin na huong sunga ni khat lenlon ka op a hoizaw hi. Gitlona inn sunga ka ten sangin ka Pasien’ inn sunga kotcing pa ka hi nuomzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile Topa Pasien pen tungsun ni le kidalna lum ahi hi; ama in maipha le patawina ei pie hi. Thumanin a gamta mite tung panin Topa in na hoi bangma hen a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Vanglien Topa aw, nangma ang muong mi zosie thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma in na gam maipha na pie hi; nangma in Jacob’ hamphatnate a ngaingai na bangsahkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na mite’ khielna na maisah a, a mawna zosie uh na ngaidam hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na thangpaina zosie na lamang hi; na sinsona panin na kihei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kote’ ki hutdamna Pasien aw, ka ngaingai uh ei bangsah kia inlen, ka tung vua na lungkim lona ei paimang pieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka tung vuah nang a lungthah den ding na mah? A khangkhangte zosie tungah lungthah peisuoh ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na mite in nangma sungah nuom a sah thei nadingin, ei hingsahkia lo ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, ka tung vuah na itna kip ei lah inlen, na hutdamna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa Pasien’ thugen ding ei zasah un; azieh pen ama in a mite, a mi muonhuoite, le ama lama lungsim a kihei mite tungah kilemna thu a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’ minthanna i gam sungah a ten thei nadingin, ama a zatahte adingin ama’ hutdamna a nai om tahpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Itna kip le citahna kimutuo ding hi; dihna le kilemna zong khatlekhat a kitawp ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leilah panin citahna ang po ding a, dihna in van panin a ensuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in eite tungah sil hoite ei pie ding a, i leitang in zong an tampi a piengsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A mai-ah dihna pei ding a, ama’ kalsuon nading lampi bawlpieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, na bil ei ngat inlen, keima ei dawng in, bangzieh ahei cile kei zawngin ka cimaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima’ hinna ei kem in, azieh pen na tungah kang ki-ap hi; nangma ang muong na nasempa ei hun in. Nangma ka Pasien na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, kei ei hepi in; azieh pen sunthapai-in na kungah keima kang kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na nasempa’ hlagau hing lungdamsah in, azieh pen nangma tungah ka hlagau kang lamto hi, Topa aw,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa aw, nang hoi-in mawna na maisah a, nang ang hlan mi zosie tungah a kicing itna kip na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa aw, ka thungetna na bil ei ngat in; nangma tungah thumin kang kikona ei ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima ei dawng ding na hi ziehin, ka hahsat ni-in keima in nang kang hlan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, pasien-te lahah nang tawh a kibang koima om lo a, nangma’ sepsa tawh a kibang nasep khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, na bawlsa minam zosie ang pei-in na mai-ah ang kun ding vua, amate in nangma’ min ang phat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen nang na lien a, na lamdangte na bawl hi; nang beh Pasien na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, na thutah-ah ka kalsuon thei nadingin nangma’ lampi ei hil inlen, na min ka zatah thei nadingin, a kaakawm lo lungtang keima ei guon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, ka lungsim zosie tawh na tungah lungdam kang ko a, tuale keima in na min ka thangsah zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima nei itna kip lien mama a, Misikhuo thuhpite sung panin ka hlagau nei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pasien aw, mi kihisahte, kei ei langpangin ang kipan hi; thu-helhawt pawlkhat in kei tha ei sawm vua, amate in nangma ang thudon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nang a khuotuo thei le a hepi siem Pasien na hi a, lungthah bai vawt loin, nang itna kip le muonhuoina tawh na kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei lamah hing kihei inlen, keima ei hepi in. Na nasempa thahatsah inlen, na nasem numei nu’ tapa hing hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma in kei ei hu-in ei henem zo na hi ziehin, kei ei mudate in tua thu mu-in a maizum nadingun, nei angvanna lim khat keima ei lah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Muol siengtho tungah ama’ phusa khuopi a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Jacob’ tenna zosie sangin Zion’ tunkotte a itzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pasien’ khuopi aw, na minthanna teng kigengen hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima ei thei mite lahah Rahab le Babylon ka lo hi; Philistia-te, Tyre-te le Ethiopia-te zong ka lo hi, amate in, “Tampa khu Zion-a suoh ahi hi,” ci-in a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion tawh kisai-in, “Tampa le khumpa tua khuopi sunga suoh ahi hi,” kici ding hi; azieh pen Sangpen Pa mama in tua khuopi a phutdet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in mi sazien a lah ciengin “Tampa tua muna suoh ahi hi,” ci-in ciemte hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />La siemte le lam siem pawlte in, “Ka lungdamna zosie nangma sungah a om hi” a ci tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima’ kihutdamna Topa ka Pasien aw, zanin na opna munah kang kiko ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka thungetna na mai-ah hing tung hinlen, ka kikona na bil ei ngat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen ka hlagau gentheina tawh a kidim a, keima’ hikhuo in zong Misikhuo a nai ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leihawm sunga a peisuhte lahah ei kisimton hi; kei ka hi leh panpi ding nei lo mite tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Misite lahah a kinuasie, a kithatlia, han sunga kisiel, na phawkhah nawn lo mite tawh ka kibang hi, azieh pen na khut sung panin amate a kisattan ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miel thuhpi munte sung, Leihawm thuh sungah kei nei koi zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima tungah na thangpaina gih mama a, na tuihuolte zosie tawh nei vuamang ta hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kithuopite’ pelh dingin kei nei na bawl hi; amate dinga a muthada huoi khat bangin kei nei bawl zo hi. A pit thei lo dingin kei ei kikhum hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />ka da seng ziehin ka mit a miel ta hi. Topa aw, nisimin nangma kang hlan a, nangma lamah ka khut kang zah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misite adingin na lamdangte a bawl na hi amah? Nangma ang phat dingin misi hlate a thoto uh amah? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Han sungah ahi a, Sietna sungah ahi zongin na itna kip le na muonhuoina a kigen mawng amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuomiel sung le mangngilna gam sungah, na silbawl lamdangte le na hutdam panpina a kithei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nangma tungah kang kiko a, zingmawng tenga ka thungetna, nangma mai-ah ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa aw, bang dinga nei paimang dawh ta ahei? Bang dingin ka kung panin na maitang na phuol dawh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka neu lai-a kipanin hamsietna ka thuoh a, ka si dihtah hi; nei zausahnate ka na thuoh a, ka cimaw mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thangpaina in kei ei nawh gawp zo hi; a zauhuoi mama nei busimna in kei ei susie gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amate in tuikhang bangin sunthapai-in kei ei kui-im uhi; amate in ka kim ka vel panin kei ei khumcip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka guolte le ka vengte in kei nei pelhsah zo ta hi; khuomiel sungah ka kithuopite a om uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, na itna kip a tawntungin la-in ka sa ding hi; khangsawnsawnte tungah ka kam tawh na citahna ka phuongzah zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in na itna kip kumtawn adingin kiphutdet hi, ci-in ka pholah hi; na citahna zong khu vantungte bangin kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma in, “Ka teelpa tawh thuciemna ka bawl zo a, ka nasempa David tungah ka kiciem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />‘Keima in na suon na hlahte ka kipsah zing ding a, khangsawnsawn zosiete adingin na kumpi topha ka lam ding hi,’” na ci hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, vante in na na lamdangte patawi hinlen, mi siengthote kikhopna sungah na citahna kipatawi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen vante lahah Topa tawh tekah thei ding koi om ahei? Van mite lahah Topa tawh kibang koi om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mi siengthote kikhopna sungah a kizatah Pasien, a kimkota omte zosie tungah lienin a giinhuoi koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vanglien Topa Pasien aw, nang banga vanglien koi om ahei? Nangma’ citahna in nangma ang kimkot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in a husie tuipi na uh hi; a tuihuolte a kato ciengin na daisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang in luonghawm khat bangin Rahab na suguoi hi; nang in na banhat tawh na galte na thezah gawp hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vante nang-a’ ahi a, leitung zong nang-a’ ma ahi hi; leitung le a sunga om na zosie, nangma’ phusa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Leilu lam le leitaw lam, nangma’ piensah ahi hi; Tabor le Hermon muolte in kipahtahin na min a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma in a hat mama ban khat na nei hi; na khut zong a thahat a, na zietlam khut a sang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thuman le thutang khu na kumpi topha’ zungpi ahi hi; nangma masangah itna kip le muonhuoina a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa aw, na maipha khuovah sungah kalsuon a, pawibawlna awging a thei mite thupha nga ahi uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />amate in sunthapai-in na min a patawi vua, na dihna a phat uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen amau’ hatna le minthanna khu nangma na hi hi; nangma’ angvanna tawh ka kite uh kitawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa khu kote’ kidalna lum hi a, kote’ kumpipa khu Israel’ Siengtho Pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaci’n nangma in na mi muonhuoite tungah mukholna tawh thu na gen a: “Keima in a vanglien mi khat tungah kumpi lukhu ka koi zo a, keima in mite lah panin a kiteel mi khat ka lamsang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in ka nasempa David ka mu zo hi; keima in ka sathau siengtho tawh ama ka nu zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keima’ khut in ama ompi zing ding hi; ka ban in zong ama a thahatsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Galte in ama sol zo lo ding a, migilote in nuoisie zo lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama mai-ah a galte ka suguoi ding a, keima in ama a mudate ka satlia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka muonhuoina le ka itna kip in ama a ompi ding hi; keima’ min sungah ama’ ki kitawisang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima in tuipi tungah a khut ka koi ding a, gunte tungah ama’ zietlam khut ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in kei kungah, ‘Nangma ka pa, ka Pasien le ka kihutdamna Suongpi na hi hi!’ ei ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Keima in ama tapa ta pen ka hisah ding a, leitunga a sangpen kumpipa ka hisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama adingin ka itna kip ka kemcing zing ding a, tuale ama tawh ka bawl ka thuciemna a kipden ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama’ suon le hlahte ka kipsah den ding a, vante a kip laisie ama’ topha zong ka kipsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A tate un keima’ thukham nuasie-in, ka biehna ngainakip bangin amate a gamtat sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ka thukhamte palsatin, ka thupiehte a zui sih uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />a thupalsatna tung vuah, ciengpum tawh dan ka pie ding a, amate tawnkhielna zong satna tawh ka gimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Hinanle ama kung panin ka itna kip ka la sih ding a, keima’ muonhuoina ka kidangsah tuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka thuciemna palsat loin, ka kam pana pusuoh sa thute ka khel sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ka siengthona tawh a kimang zing dingin khatvei ka kiciem zo hi; David tungah ka zuou sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama’ suon le hlahte kizom peisuoh ding a, ka mai-ah vantunga ni bangin a kumpi topha kip den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Vante tungah a kipden teci ahi hlapi bangin kip den ding hi,” na ci hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ahi vangin nangma in tu-in ama nawlkhinin na nuol zo hi; na sathau nu pa tungah na thangpai mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nang in na nasempa tawh na bawl thuciemna na phel a, nang in leivui lahah a kumpi lukhu na niehsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Nang in ama’ kulpi zosie na sukhepieh hi; nang in ama’ mun kipte a siesa-in na koipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />A nawh kha zosie in a nate a sutgawp uhi; ama pen a vengte’ simmaw nuoisie a suoh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Nang in a galte’ zietlam khut na domsang zo a, a galte zosie na lungdamsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tua tham loin nang in a namsau dawn na leheipieh hi; Galdona phuol-ah ama na panpi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Nang in ama’ khut panin kumpi ciengkhut na lahpieh a, a kumpi topha zong tuol denna-in na nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A khangno hun na tomsah a, maizumna tawh ama na tuom hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Topa aw, bang tanvei sawt ding na hei? Nang a kiphuol zing ding na hi ta amah? Meikuong bangin bang tanvei na lungthahna kuong ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Ka hinkhuo a tom lam keima ei phawh in, azieh pen nang in a si thei mihingte a mawhna dinga na bawl ahi amah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Sina mu loin a hingzing koi om ahei? Misikhuo’ vanglietna panin koi suohta zo ahei? Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Topa aw, na thumanna tawh David tunga na thuciemna, hun lui lai-a nangma’ itna kip hei sungah a om ta ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Topa aw, na nasempa ei kisimmaw zie, mite’ simmawna ka thuohna ziete ei phawh inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />tua ma tawh na galte in keima ei simmaw vua, amate in na sathau nu pa’ kalsuonna a simmaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Topa in thupha nga zing taheh. Amen, Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, khan tawntungin kote’ tenna mun na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Muolte a kipiensah masang, lei le leitung na bawl masang, tawntung pan tawntung dongin nangma Pasien na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kohaw leivui nei suohsahkia a, “No mihingte aw, kilekia un,” nei ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen nangma’ muna-ah kum tulkhat a tawp ciengin zani tawh kibang a, ahi sihle zanvil hun khat tawh a kibang bep lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in amate na sumaimang sieng hi; amate zanlai mang tawh a kibang vua, zingmawnga a dawngkia lopa tawh a kibang uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />zingmawngin palin thasuoh a, nitah ciengin vulin a gawptum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nangma’ lungthahna in kote ei netum hi; nangma’ thangpaina in kote ei vuanel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang in ka khielnate uh nangma mai-ah na koi a, ka seldap uh mawnate zong na mai khuovah-ah na koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka ni zosie uh nangma’ thangpaina nei-ah a tawp sieng hi; ka kumte uzong husan khat bangin a tawp lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka hinkhuo nite uh ahile kum sawmsagi ahi bo a, ahi sihle thahat lai uleng, kum sawmgiet bang hi thei hi; tua kikal nangawn zong gimna le hahsatna vive ahi hi; tua teng mallangin a tawp a, tuaci’n ka mangthai pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na lungthahna vanglietna zie koi in thei ding ahei? Na thangpaina zong khu na zatahhuoina za-in lien hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n kote in pilna lungsim ka nga thei nadingun ka hinkhuo nite uh ka sim dan ding uh ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa aw, hing kilekia in! Bang tanvei sawt lai ding na hei? Nangma in nasemte tungah lainatna ei nei in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hin sung tung tawn uh lungdamin ka kipah thei nadingun, zingmawngin na itna kip tawh kote ei lungkimsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kote nei gimsah ni zaza, sietna ka tuo uh kum zaza ma kote ei kipahsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na nasemte tungah na nasepna, a tate uh tungah a minthang na vanglietna hing kilangsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa i Pasien uh’ ang vanna eite tungah hing tung hinlen, i khut vua i septe uh eite dingin lawcing taheh. Aw, ka khut utawh ka septe uh hing lawcingsah in!
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sangpen Pa’ liena sungah tengin, Vanglienpa’ hlim a bel nangma in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa kungah, “Ka kibuhna le ka kulpi; ka muon ka Pasien na hi hi,” na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in thangsie pa’ thang pan le a zauhuoi pul natna panin nang ang hunkhie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in a hlakuite tawh nangma ang hui ding a, ama’ hla nei-ah kibuhna na mu ding hi; ama’ muonhuoina khu lum le kawngga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan lai-a zauhuoina hile, sun lai-a a leng thaltang hile,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />miel lahah a vahdap pul natna hile, suntang lai-a sietnate hile, na giing sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na gei-ah mi tulkhat pua-in, na ziet lamah mi tulsawm pua zong nan uleh tuate in nang ang neh kha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na mit tawh na en lel beh ding a, migilote kithuhkiana na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma in Topa na kibuhna dingin bawlin, Sangpen Pa na tenna mun dingin bawl zo na hi ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nang tungah sietna ang tung sih ding a, na puonbuh gei-ah zong gimna ang tung sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in na lampi cin tengah nang ang cing dingin a vantung mite thu a pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na kengte in suong a suikhah lo nadingin, amate in a khut utawh nang ang dom ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Humpi le gulsum na tuon ding a, humpi khanglai le gulpi zong na tuoncil ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ei it mite ka hunkhie ding a; ka min a thei mite ka dal ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei ei hlat ciengun amate ka dawng ding hi; keima in hahsat hun ciengin amate ka ompi ding a, amate hunkhie-in ka patawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Keima in khansauna tawh amate ka lungkimsah ding a, tuale ka hutdamna amate ka lah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko ding le na min phatna lasah ding hoi hi, Sangpen Pa aw;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />zingmawngin na itna kip, zanlai-in na muonhuoina,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />theile le harp tumgingte le lyre gin ngaite tawh tangko dinga a kilawm ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />bangzieh ahei cile Topa aw, nangma’ nasepna tawh nei lungdamsah hi; keima in na khut a na sepnate ziehin lungdamin la ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, na nasepnate bangza-in lien ahei! Na ngaisutnate zong bangza-in thuh ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi lungmawlte in a thei zawh lo uh, mimawte in a tel zawh lo uh thu tami ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lopa bangin migilote mengin, sietna bawlte a pun vangun, amate kumtawn sietna thuoh dinga kisesa ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />ahi vangin Topa aw, nang pen mun sanga om zing na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa aw, na galte a mangthai ding hi; sietna bawl mi vannuoi zong a kithethang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ahi vangin zangsiel’ ki bangin keima’ ki nei lamsang a, nang in keima’ tungah sathau siengtho nei buohsuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mit in ka galte’ puana a mu zo ta uhi; ka bil in zong keima ei do migilote’ manthaina za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midihte lutu kung bangin khanpha ding a, Lebanon gam sunga taamtah kung bangin khang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa’ inn sungah amate kisuon hi; i Pasien’ huong sungah amate a khanpha uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A vuoi ciengun zong ga a ga lai uhi; amate dum kihkiahin a nosuoh silsel den vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua in Topa pen thuman hi, ci lah hi; ama ka suongpi zong ahi a, ama sungah thuman lona a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa pen kumpi hi a, thupina puon ama kisilsah hi; Topa kumpi puon kisilsah a, thahatna tawh a kawng kigah hi. Ama in leitung phutdet hi; tua khu a kilawh ngai nawn sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tanglai-a kipanin na kumpi topha kiphut hi; nang kumtawn-a om na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, gunte hing khangin, tua gunte in a aw uh a sangsah uhi; gunte a hawh vapuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuipi liente hawh sanga a hatzaw, tuipihuolte sanga a hatzaw, a sangna muna om a thupi Topa khu nang na hi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thupiehte man mama hi; Topa aw, siengthona pen a tawntungin na inn tawh a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Phu la Pasien, phu la Topa Pasien aw, hing tho in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leitung thukhen pa aw, hing thoto in; mi kiphasahte tungah amahaw’ nga dinga kilawmte pie in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, bang tanvei migilote lungdamin, bang tanvei migilote nuomin kipah ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate in kihisahna kammalte a suo vapual uhi; sietna a bawl mite zosie a kiphasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, amate in na mite a suguoi vua, na gouluote a gimsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in meigongte le khuol mite thatin, pa nei lote zong a that uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuale amate in, “ Topa in mu sih; Jacob’ Pasien in thei kha sih,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mite sung panin a lungmawl pente aw, tel ta un; mimawte aw, bang huna pil tabep ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bil bawlpa in khuo a za sih amah? Mit bawlpa in khuo a mu sih amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte khalna pie-in, mihingte tungah thu theitelna a hil pa in thu sam lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ngaisutnate uh i dih hui hawmpi tawh kibang ahina Topa in thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa aw, migilote adingin dum khat a kitaw masang, buoina nite panin amate a kipel thei nadingin, na thukham na hil mi, thu na sap mite thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in ama’ mite a nuasie sih hi; ama in a gouluote a taisan sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />azieh pen midihte kungah thutang ang kilekia ding a, lungsim sunga thutang a kuo zosie in a zui ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei adinga migilote do dingin, koi pang ngam ahei? Kei dinga sietna bawlte do dingin koi pang ngam ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Topa khu ei hupa hi sihle, gamkhing sungah ka hlagau a tung zo ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Kitawnkhaw tang e,” ci-a ka ngaisut ciengin, Topa aw, na itna kip in keima ei kaito hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka lunghimawna a tam ciengin, na henepna in keima nei lungnuomsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi sol nading thukham a bawl, a gilo gam-uhte, nang tawh a kipawl thei ding uh amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Midihte’ hinna a do dingin amate a kikhawm vua, tuale amate in maw nei lote tha dingin thu a khen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa khu keima’ mun muonhuoi hi a, tuale ka Pasien zong ka bel suongpi suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in a khielna uh ziehin amate a thuhkia ding a, a gitlona uh ziehin ama in amate a maimangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hing pei un, Topa phat vai; ei kihutdamna suongpi tungah lungdamin kiko vai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’ opna munah lungdamkona tawh pei-in, ama tungah phatna late tawh lungdamin kiko vai!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa a lien Pasien hi a, pasien zosiete tungah Kumpi lienpa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’ khut sungah leitung thuhpite a om hi; muol sangte zong khu ama-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi ama’ bawlsa ahi ziehin ama-a’ ahi a, tuale a khuta a bawlsa leigawte zong ama-a’ ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hing pei un, ama bie-in kun vai, ei Siem Topa mai-ah khupdin va vui!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama pen eite’ Pasien ahi a, eite a gankhawh sunga om mite le ama’ khut sunga a om a tuute i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meribah munah na lungkhau bang ule Senel gam Massah munah na pu na pate in kei ei zelah lai-in, amate in ka nasepna mu zo napi gamtatna tawh lah ding hun ei kal hun lai uh bangin, na lungsim khausah sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen tua khang mite kum sawmli sung ka na kidah a, “Amate pen lungsim lepeisate le ka lampi a thuse lote ahi uhi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka thangpai kawmin ka kiciem a, “Ka tawlngahna sungah amate a lut sih ding uhi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung mi zosie aw, Topa tungah la tha khat sa un; Topa tungah phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah lasa unlen, ama’ min phat un; ni khat zaw ni khat ama’ ei hutdamna thu gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Minamte lahah ama’ minthanna tangko unlen, mi zosiete lahah a sil lamdang bawlte tangko un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa lienin, nahpitah a phat ding ahi hi; ama pen pasien zosiete sanga zatah zawh ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile mihingte’ pasien zosie milimte hi lel a, ahi vangin Topa in vantungte a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama mai-ah patawina le thupina a om hi; ama’ mun siengtho sungah thahatna le hoina a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Minamte’ innkuonte aw, Topa ahi ding bangin hisah unlen, Topa tungah a minthanna le a hatna bangin hisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa tungah ama’ min zieha a nga dinga kilawm minthanna pie un; biehpiehnate tawi-in ama’ huong sungah hing lut un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Puon siengtho tawh kizemin Topa bie un; leitung mi zosie aw, ama mai-ah citun un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minamte lahah, “ Topa kumpi ahi hi! Leitung kiptahin kiphut zo hi; tua khu a kilawh ngai nawn sih ding hi. Ama in deidan nei loin mite thu khen ding hi,” ci-in gen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vantungte kipah uh hinlen, leitung lungdam heh; tuipi le a sunga om zosie awng vapo uheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />lo le a sunga om zosie nuomin kitom uheh. Tua ciengin gamlahah a po singkung zosie in
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa mai-ah lungdamin la sa ding uhi; azieh pen leitung thukhen dingin ama ang pei ta hi. Ama in dihna tawh leitung thu khen ding a, ama in a thuman tawh mite thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa kumpi ahi hi! Leitung lungdam heh; tuikul neu tampite zong kipah uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meiipite le miel sapite in ama a kimvel uhi; ama’ kumpi topha bulpi pen dihna le thutang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama mai-ah meikuong pei a, a kimvela om galte a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama’ tunphete in leitung tanvah hi; leitung in mu-in a kithing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa mai, leitung mi zosie’ Topa mai-ah khuoinun bangin muolte zungmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantungte in ama’ thumanna a gen hi; mi zosie in ama’ minthanna a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kimanna a nei lo milimte a kisahtheipi, milimte a bie mi zosiete kimaizumsah ding hi; pasien zosiete zong ama mai-ah a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pasien aw, Zion in za-in nuom a, na thukhennate ziehin Judah khuopite a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa aw, leitung zosie tungah nangma a sangpen na hi hi; pasien zosiete tung pehah nang ang kitawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa in sietna a muda mite a it hi; ama in mi muonhuoite’ hinna a kepcing pieh hi; ama in migilote khut sung panin amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Midihte adingin khuo ang vah a, lungsim mante adingin kipahna ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />No midihte aw, Topa sungah lungdam unlen, ama’ min siengtho phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah la tha khat sa un, azieh pen ama in sil lamdangte a bawl zo hi. A zietlam khut le a ban siengtho in ama a guolzosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in ama’ guolzawna a kitheisah zo ta hi; ama in minamte muna-ah a thumanna lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Israel innkuonte tungah a itna kip le a muonhuoina a phawhkia zo hi. Leimongte zosie in i Pasien’ guolzawna mu sieng zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leitung mi zosie aw, Topa tungah lungdamna aw gingsah un; lungdamin awngin phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lyre lasahna tawh phatna la sa unlen, lyre tumin aw ngaih tawh phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pengkulte le saki aw tawh Topa, Kumpipa’ mai-ah lungdamna aw gingsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuipi le a sunga om zosie le leitung le a tunga teng zosie awng uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuikhangte in khut beng uheh; Topa’ opna munah muoltangte in lungdamin la sa ton uheh. Azieh pen leitung thukhen dingin ama ang pei ta hi. Ama in dihna tawh leitung thu khen ding a, guptuom paituom nei loin mite thu a khen ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa kumpi ahi hi; mite citun uheh! Cherub-te tungah ama a to hi; leitung kiling taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zion ah Topa lien a, mite zosie tungah kitawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in a lien le a zatahhuoi na min phat ta uheh. Ama a Siengtho ahi h!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thutang a it Vanglien Kumpipa aw, nang in deidan op lona na kipsah a, nangma in Jacob sungah thutang le thudih tawh na na sem zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I Topa Pasien phat un; a keng zungah bie un. Ama a Siengtho ahi hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ siempute lahah Moses le Samuel kihal a, a min-a a kilote lahah Samuel zong kihal hi. Topa kungah amate a kiko vua, ama in a dawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Meii khuompi sung panin ama in amate hopi hi; amate in ama’ thupiehte le ama in amate a pieh thukhamte a zui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kote’ Topa Pasien aw, nangma in amate na dawng hi; amate tungah maw a maisah Pasien na hi a, hinanle nang na hi leh a gamtat khielna uh tungah phu la pa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I Topa Pasien phat unlen, a muol siengtho-ah bie un; azieh pen eite’ Topa Pasien siengtho hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leitung mi zosie aw, Topa tungah lungdamna aw gingsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lungdamna tawh Topa bie un; ama’ opna munah la sa kawmin hing pei un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa Pasien ahi lam thei un. Ei bawlpa ama ahi a, eite ama-a’ i hi hi; eite ama’ mite i hi vua, a gancinna sunga om a tuute i hi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lungdamkona tawh ama’ kotpite-ah lut unlen, phatna tawh ama’ huong sungah tum un. Ama tungah lungdam ko unlen, ama’ min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa hoi hi; tuale ama’ itna kip tawntung hi. Tuale ama’ muonhuoina zong a khang khangin kip hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Keima in thumanna le thutanna la ka sa ding hi. Topa aw, na tungah la kang sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in nuol baang lo lampi ka sin ding hi. Tua khu bang hunin nga ding ka hei? Lungsim citahna tawh ka inn sungah ka kalsuon ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />keima in kimanna nei lo na khat popo ka mitsuon sih ding hi. Lamkhielte’ nasepna ka muda hi; tua khu ka tungah a beh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A lungsim kawi mi kei tawh a kigamla ding hi; keima in sietna kici bangma ka thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Keima in a vengpa a dap gensiet mipa ka susie ding hi. Kiphatsahna, kihisahna lungsim a nei mi ka thuoh zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Gam sunga thuman mite kei tawh a ten thei nadingin, maipha ka pie ding hi; nuol baang loin a gamta poma in keima’ na a sem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Solna a zang mi poma ka inn sungah a om thei sih ding hi; zuouthu a gen poma ka opna-ah a om thei sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keima in zingmawng sielin gam sunga migilote zosie ka susie ding a, Topa’ khuopi panin sietna a bawl mite zosie, ka sumaimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka thungetna ei za in; nangma tungah ka kikona hing tung taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lunggim hun ciengin ka kung panin na mai phuol sin. Nangma in na bil ei ngat in; kang hlat ciengin mallangin ei dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka nite meikhu bangin tawp a, ka gu ka tangte zong meikhuh bangin kavam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka lung a kham a, lopa bangin a vul hi; ka tha a zawmgawp a, an zong ka ne zo ta sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A gingin ka tautauna ziehin ka gu guohin ka om ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Senel gam sunga om simbu le ngalgawta lahah a om keising tawh ka kibang ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka lup lai-in ka hah hi; innkhum dawna a tuomtuon va tawh ka kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sunthapai-in ka galte in keima ei tawh uhi; kei ei simmawte in ka min samsietna-in zang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in an-in vut ka ne a, na lungthahna le na thangpaina ziehin, ka tuidawnte hlitui tawh kihal hi; azieh pen nangma in nei domto a, nei paimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hinkhuo nite ahile nitah lama a om nihlim tawh kibang a, lopa bangin ka vul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa aw, nang pen tawntung kumpi na hi hi; a khang khangin na min a kip peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangma tho-in Zion na hepi ding hi; bangzieh ahei cile nang in ama maipha na pieh ding hun ang tung ta ding hi; a kisesa hun ang tung ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen na nasemte in tua suongtumte a it uhi; tuale a leivuite tungah zong khuotuona a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minamte in Topa’ min a zatah ding vua, leitung kumpi zosie in na minthanna a zatah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in Zion khuopi a lam ding hi; tuale a minthanna tawh ama ang kilang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in mi cimawte’ thungetna thupisim ding a, a thungetna uh a simmaw sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A suoh nai lo mite in Topa a phat thei nadingun, ang pieng lai ding khang mite adingin tam thu kiciemte taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa a bie dingin mite le kumpi gamte a kaikhop ciengin, Zion ah Topa’ min, Jerusalem ah ama phatna a pulah thei nadingun, thongkiete’ tauna a za ding le a si dinga kisate a hla dingin, Topa in a siengtho ama’ mun sang panin ei ensuh a, vantung panin ama in leitung a ensuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama in ka khan a kimsuhin ka thahatna ei suhtanpieh hi; ama in ka hinkhuo nite zong ei tomsahpieh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Keima in, “Khang tawntunga a kip ka Pasien aw, ka nuntah kimtanin kei ei la sin” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tanglai hunin nang in leitung bulpi na phut a, tuale vantungte na khut tawh na bawlsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate mangthai ding a, hinanle nang na kip den hi; amate ahi ule puon bangin a siepaat ding uhi. Nangma in amate puon bangin na kheel a, amate a mangthai uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />ahi vangin nang na kibang den a, na kumte in mong a nei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na nasemte’ tate lungmuongin a teng ding uhi; nangma’ opna munah a suon a hlahte uh kisukip ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, Topa phat in, ka sunga om zosiete aw, ama’ min siengtho phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, Topa phat inlen, ama’ zieha phattuomnate mangngil sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in na khielna zosie maisahin, na natna zosie damsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in Leihawm panin na hinna tankhie a, itna le khuotuona ang khusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Muvanlai bangin na khangno lai hun ang thasuo theikia nadingin, na khan sung tungtawnin hoina tawh nangma ang lungkimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A kibawlsie mite adingin Topa in thumanin na a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in a lampite Moses tung le a sepnate Israel mite tungah theisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa pen mi khuotuo siem le mi hepi siem pa ahi a, lungthah bai loin, a kiningcing itna kip a nei pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in mi a mawsah den sih ding a, zong a lungthah den sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Eite’ mawna tawh kituohin ama in eite tungah ei bawl sih a, eite’ khielnate tawh kituohin ama in eite ei thuhkia lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen leitung panin vantungte a san ma bangin, ama a zatah mite tungah ama’ itna kip lien mama hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nitumna panin nisuona a gamlat ma bangin, ama in i khielnate uh i kung panun gamlapi-ah a hem dawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pa in tate a khuotuo bangin, Topa in ama a zatah mite a khuotuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zieh pen ama in eite ei kipiensah dan a thei a, ama in eite leivui i hi lam uzong a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihingte adingin ahile a hinkhuo uh lopa bang ahi hi; amate pen gamlah pape tawh kibang ahi lel bo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />bang zieh ahei cile hui in ama semin mangthai a, khumi mun in ama a thei kha nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hizongle ama a zatahte tungah a tawntung pan a tawntung dongin Topa’ itna kip om ngitnget a, ama’ thumanna zong
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a thuciemna a zuite le ama’ thupiehte zui ding a phawh mite tungah a tu a ta khang dongin a kip peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in vantung ah ama’ topha phut zo a, ama’ kumpi gam in mun vannuoi a uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />No, ama’ vantung mite aw, Topa phat un, ama’ sawlna bang a sem no a thahat mite aw, ama’ gensa thu mang un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ dei lam a bawl, a nasemte, ama’ mihon zosie aw, Topa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama’ uhna mun zosie-a om ama’ bawlsa zosie aw, Topa phat un. Ka hlagau aw, Topa phat in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, Topa phat in. Topa ka Pasien aw, nang na lien mama hi. Nangma in patawina le thupina na sil a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />puon tawh tuom bangin khuovah sungah na kituom hi. Nangma in puonbuh bangin vantungte na zah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />nangma in tuite tungah na innkhan zawlte hlungin, na sakol leeng adingin meiipite na bawl a, huipi’ hlate tungah nangma na tuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma’ kamtai dingin huite na bawl a, nangma in mei le meikuongte na nasemte na hisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leitung a kilawh ngai nawn lo dingin a bulpite tungah na phut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang in puon tawh tuom bangin tui thuhpi tawh leitung na tuom hi; tuite in muolte a hlumto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na hosiet ziehin tua tuite a tai uhi; vanto ging ziehin a taimang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Muol tung dongah letto-in, muolkuom tengah luong a, amate adinga a kisesa mun-ah a luong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua tuite in leitung tuomkia loin, a kantan lo nadingin gamgi na phupieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma in muolkuomte sungah tuisamte na pulsah hi; muol le muol kikalah tua tuite luong a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />gamsate’ dawn ding tui na pie hi; gamlah sakolte in zong tua khu dangta phatna-in a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua luitui gei-ah huilah vate a busa uhi; amate in singbate lahah zeila a awi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A sangna mun na opna panin nangma in muolte tui na buoh hi; nangma’ nasepna ga tawh leitung a nuomsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ganhingte’ neh ding le mihingte’ zah dingin lopa le ankungte na posah a, leitung panin an na piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihing’ lungsim a nuomsah dingin zu, mai a zolsah ding sathau le mihing’ lungsim a hatsah dingin an na piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa’ singkungte, ama in Lebanon-a a suon taamtah singkungte in tui a kham mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuami singkungte tungah vate in bu a bawl uhi; gun vapi in taasingte lahah ama ading bu a nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Muolsangte ahile gam sakelte ading ahi a, suongtumte zong khu bilpite adingin kibuhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khuohun ciemte nadingin hlapi na bawl hi; ni in a tum hun ding thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang in khuomiel na bawl a, tua khu zan hun kici a, tua hun ciengin gamsa zosie pusuohin a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sa man dingin humpi khanglaite a hawh uhi; amate in Pasien kung panin a an ding a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni a suo ciengin amate a gelmang vua, a kuo sung vuah a lum uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na sem dingin mite a kuon vua, tuale nitah dongin na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa aw, na silbawlte tam sam e izaw! Na pilna tawh tua zosie na bawl hi; na siemsa ganhingte leitung a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A gal lama tuipi pen lienin zai a, tua sungah a bawhva hinna a nei ganhingte a lien a neu sim zawh loin a tam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua tuipi tungah tembawte pei a, tua sunga guolnuom dingin na bawlsa Awle a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A hun ciengin an na pieh ding ngahin tam teng zosie in nangma ang en uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An na pieh ciengin amate in ang khawm uhi; na khut na zah ciengin, na hoinate tawh a kidim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Na maitang na phuol ciengin, amate a lungkie uhi; nang in a naahu uh na lah ciengin amate si-in leivui ah a peikia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na hlagau nang sawl ciengin, amate kipiengsah hi; nang in leitung maitang na siemthakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa’ minthanna kumtawnin kip den hinlen; ama’ nasepnate ah Topa lungdam taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in leitung a et ciengin tua leitung kiling a, muolte a tham ciengin meikhu a pusuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Keima ka hin laisie Topa tungah la ka sa ding hi; ka hin sungin ka Pasien tungah phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa sungah ka lungdam ziehin ka thu ngaituonate in ama lungkimsah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Leitung panin mawnei mite mangthai sieng hinlen, migilote om nawn sih heh. Ka hlagau aw, Topa phat in. Topa phat in!
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdamko-in, ama’ min hlan unlen, ama’ silbawlte mite lahah theisah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama tungah la sa un, ama tungah phatna la sa un; ama’ silbawl lamdang zosie genkhie un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama’ min siengtho sungah kisathei unlen, Topa a sui mite lungdam ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa le a thahatna sui un; a tawntungin ama’ ompina sui un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A bawl a lamdang nate, ama’ na lamdangte, ama in a genkhiet thukhennate,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a nasem Abraham’ suonlehlahte, a teeltuom Jacob’ tate in phawh un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama pen eite’ Topa Pasien ahi hi; leitung mun zosie-ah ama’ thukhenna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in, “Na luo dingin Canaan gam kang pie ding hi,” ci-a Abraham tawh a bawl thuciemna, Isaac tungah kiciem-a a pieh kamciem, Israel tungah kumtawn a thuciemna, Jacob tunga a kipsahsa thukhamte ahi, a thuciemnate khang tulkhat dongin phawh den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate mi tawmno khat ahi lai ule bangma gentham nai loin, tua munah khuolmi ahi lai-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />minam khat pan minam khat, kumpi gam khat pan gam khatah amate a va kawi lai-un,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama in koima’ nuoisie ding a phal sih a, ama in amau’ ziehin kumpite hosie-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka sathau nusa mite sukha sih un; ka kamsangte zong bawlsie sih un,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tua gam a susie dingin kielpi hlanin, ama in an namcin a sietsah ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />sila banga a kizua Joseph kici mi khat, a masang vuah a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kengah kengkol kibulin, siakol sungah a ngawng kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A gensa thu a tangtun masangin, Topa’ kammal in ama ze-et den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kumpipa in mi sawlin ama a hlakhie hi; mipi uhpa in ama a suohtasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Joseph in a lungkim bangin ama’ uliente lamlah ding, a upate pilna a hil dingin innkuon vaihawm pa le ama’ neisa zosie uhpa-in ama a koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin Egypt ah Israel a va pei ta hi; Ham-te’ gamah pemta-in Jacob a va teng ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa in a mite pungsahin, a galte sangin hatzawsah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />ama’ mite a muda ding le ama’ nasemte ngian tawh a vat dingin amau’ lungsim a heipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in a nasempa Moses le a teel pa Aaron a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate in amahaw lahah ama’ limte a lah vua, Ham’ gam sungah na lamdangte a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in khuomiel sawlin, gam sung khim a zingsah hi; amate in ama’ thugente a langpang uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Ama in a tuite uh sisan a suohsah a, a ngate uh a sisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A gam sung uh uphawh tawh kidim a, a kumpite’ inn sung nangawnah a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama ham a, gam sung zosie-ah thohonpi le thokangte a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ama in guo tangin amate gielpi pie a, amate, a gam sung zosie uh a tanvah tunphe a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in a lengguite ule a theikungte uh vattan a, a gam sung vua singkungte a hliehtawng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ama ham a, tuale kauphete le kauphe note, sim zawh loin a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tuate in a gam sung vua singte le lohing zosie netum a, a leitang pan vua a pieng ga zosie khawng sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ama in a gam sung vua tacil zosie le a thagui vua a pieng masa zosie a satlia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tua ciengin ama in ngun le kham tawh Israel-te peipi a, a minamte lah vuah a kipalpua koima a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />A giinhuoina uh amate tungah a tun ziehin, amate a pei dawh bepin Egypt-te a nuom mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amate a lie dingin meiipi kaisah a, zan ciengin khuovah a pie dingin mei a tangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Amate in a ngen vua, ama in vamimte puohin, vantung panin a kicingin amate an a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Ama in suongpi hong a, tuale tui a phulkhie hi; tua khu senel gam sungah gun bangin a luong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in a siengtho a thuciemna le a nasem pa Abraham a phawh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in ama’ mite lungdamna tawh peipi a, la sa kawmin a teeltuom mite a peikhietpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Minamte’ gamte amate pie a, amate in ama’ thukipte zui-in, a thukhamte a tan thei nadingun, tua mite’ hauna teng a tang uhi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Topa tungah lungdam ko un; azieh pen ama hoi a, ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ nasepna lienpite koi in gen thei ding a, ama’ phatna zosie koi in pulah thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thutangin na semin, huncin tengah dihna tawh a gamta zingte khu thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, na teelsa mite’ hauna ka mu thei nading, na minamte’ kipahna sungah keima ka lungkim thei nading, nangma gouluo sungah ka kisahthei nadingin, na mite maipha na pieh ni ciengin keima ei phawh inlen, amate na hutkhiet ciengin kei zong ei hu in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka pu ka pate ule kote ka ni-un ka maw zo ta uhi; khielna ka bawl zo ta vua, ka gitlo gamtat ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Egypt ah ka pu ka pate a op lai-un, amate in na nasepna lamdangte a ngaisun kha sih uhi; amate in a kicing na itna kip a na phawh kha sih vua, tuale mahin San Tuipi ah Sangpen Pa a na langpan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hinanle a lien mama ama’ vanglietna a kitheisah nadingin, ama’ min a khuolna tawh amate na hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in San Tuipi hosie a, tuale a kanggaw pai hi; senel gam kantan bangin ama in tuithuh kantanin amate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n ama in a langte’ khut sung panin amate hundam a, a galte’ khut sung panin zong amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A langte uh tui in hlummang a, a suohta khat zong om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in ama’ thugen a um uhi; amate in ama phatna la sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ahi vangin amate in ama’ nasepte a mangngil pai uhi; amate in thukuppi dingin ama a ngah tuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hinanle amate in gamlahah a dugawna uh ki-ip zo loin, senel gam sungah Pasien a ze-et uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ama in amau’ nget pen pie a, ahi vangin amate lahah gawngtam natna a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate in giephuol-a om Moses le Topa’ mi siengtho Aaron a haza uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei kihongin Dathan valtum a, tuale Abiram pawlte zong lei in a vuamang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amau’ pawl sungah mei zong kuong a, tua meikuong in migilote a katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in Horeb ah bawngno lim khat bawlin, a kisung tua milim a bie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amate in Pasien’ minthanna pen lopa a ne bawngtang lim tawh a khel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amate in Egypt gam sungah na lienpi a bawl, Ham gam sungah na lienpi a sem, San Tuipi ah a giinhuoi nate a bawl, a hundampa uh Pasien a mangngil ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ama in amate susie ding a, a susie ding ahi ama’ lungthahna panin a heikhie dingin a mai-ah ama’ teelpa Moses ding lo hi leh, amate ka susie ding hi, a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in tua gamnuom a simmaw vua, ama’ kamciemna a um sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A puonbuh sung vuah amahaw a phuncieh vua, Topa’ thugen a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ziehin ama in a khut lamto-in, gamlahah amate a pua nadingun amate tungah kiciem a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />tuale minamte lahah a suonlehlahte uh kithezahin, leitung gam zosie-ah amate a thethang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in Peor-a Baal pasien a bel vua, misite dinga kithoina-a kipie sate a ne uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Amahaw’ gamtatna tawh Topa a lungthah sah vua, tuale amate lahah pul natna a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n Phinehas dingin a thum pieh a, tuale pul natna a veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Tua thu pen a khang khangin ama’ dihna-in kiciemte zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Meribah tui gei-ah amate in Topa a lungthahsah vua, amate ziehin Moses in hahsatna a na thuohlaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />amate in a hlagau a lungthahsah ziehun, ama in kamkhauh a na suo dawh ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Topa’ thupieh bangin, amate in mite a that sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />hinanle minamte tawh amate kisawhalin, amau’ gamtat banga gamtat ding a kisin uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Amate adinga thang ahi, a milimte uh’ na a sem uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate in dawite biehna-in a tapate ule a tanute uh a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Amate in Canaan gam milimte biehna-in mawna a nei lo a tanute ule a tapate uh’ sisan a luongsah vua, sisan tawh gam sung a buasah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tua bang a sepnate un amate buasah a, a gamtatnate sung vuah amau le amau a kizua a suoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Tua ciengin a mite tungah Topa’ lungthahna kikuontaw a, tuale ama in a gouluo a kidah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Amate a muda mite in amate a uh thei nadingin, ama in minamte’ khut sungah amate a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A galte un amate a bawlsie vua, tuale a khut nei vuah amate koi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Ama in tam veipi amate hunkhie a, ahi vangin amate in ledona lungsim a vom uhi, tuale amau’ khielna ziehin amate a kiniemkoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tua bang hinanle zong amau’ kikona a zah ciengin, ama in a cimawna uh a don hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Amau’ vang tawh ama in a thuciemna a phawhkia a, a kicing ama’ itna kip dung zui-in khuotuona a lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Amate sala a man mi zosie in a hlasietpi za dong dingin ama in a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Topa aw, kote ei hun inlen, kote in na min siengtho tungah lungdam ka ko thei nading ule kote in na minthanna ka phat thei nadingun, minamte kung panin kote ei kaikhawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Topa Israel Pasien in a tawntung pan a tawntung dongin thupha nga taheh. Mi zosie in, “Amen” ci ta uheh. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdam ko un; azieh pen ama hoi a, ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nisuona le nitumna lam, leilu lam le leitaw lam, gam teng pana a kaikhop, hahsatna pana a tatkhiet Topa’ tatsa mite in tu-a teng ci kiakia uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pawlkhatte ahile senel gamdai-ah a vahvai vua, a tenna ding uh khuopi tunna lampi a mu zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Gilkiel dangta-in a om vua, a sung vuah a hlagau uh a balia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin lungkhamin Topa kungah a kiko vua, ama in a lungkhamna uh panin amate a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A tenna ding khuopi a tun dongun ama in lampi manah amate a pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama’ itna kip le mihingte tunga a lamdang ama’ nasepte ziehin, Topa tungah amate in lungdam ko ta uheh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />azieh pen ama in a dangtate taisah a, tuale ama in a gilkielte, na hoite tawh a dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pawlkhatte khuomu lah, mielking sungah a to vua, thongkiete in gentheina le siakol bulna a thuoh uhi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />azieh pen amate in Pasien’ thugente a ledo vua, Sangpen Pa’ lamlahnate a niel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na ham sepna tawh amate a lungkie uhi; amate a puasuh vua, a panpi ding koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ciengin a lung uh khamin Topa kungah a kiko vua, ama in a lungkhamna panun amate a hunkhie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ama in khuomielna le lungzinna panin amate a peipi a, a kikhina uh botsan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama’ itna kip le mihingte tunga a lamdang a nasepnate ziehin Topa tungah lungdamko ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in sumngo kotpite sukeh a, sia zawlte tun ni a suo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pawlkhatte a gitlo gamtat ziehun a ci uh na a, amau’ khielna ziehin gentheina a thuoh uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />amate in an kici mawngmawng du loin a luoh uh suoh a, sina dawngkot tawh amate a nai ta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate lungkhamin Topa kungah a kiko vua, tuale a lungkhamna uh panin amate a hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in thu vaihlahin amate damsah a, suhsietna panin amate suohtasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ama’ itna kip le mihingte tunga a lamdang a nasepnate ziehin Topa tungah amate in lungdamko ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Amate in lungdamko biehpiehnate pie uh hinlen, lungdam lasahna tawh ama’ nasepnate gen uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pawlkhatte tembaw tawh tuipi tungah a pei vua, tuipi liente tungah sumbawl nasep a sem uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Topa’ nasepnate, tuili thuhpi sunga ama’ nasep lamdangte amate in a a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in thu pie a, huipite langin, tuipi huolte sangtahin a kato hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Amate vanlam sena-in a kinei vua, a thuhna lamah a kiesuh uhi. Amau’ tuosietna sungah a hanna uh a tuisuoh mang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Amate zukham bangin a hawilen kawikawi vua, ci nading mel a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate lungkhamin Topa kungah a kiko vua, ama in a lungkhamna uh panin amate a hunkhie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />ama in huipi daisah a, tuipi huolte a sip dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tua ciengin tuate a khawl zo tah ziehin amate a lungdam vua, tuale ama in a lunggulna mun vuah amate a peipi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ama’ itna kip le mihingte tungah a lamdang a nasepte ziehin, Topa tungah lungdamko ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mihon kikhopna sungah amate in ama patawi-in, upate kikhopna munah ama phat ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in guntuite senel gam suohsahin, ciatuite leigaw suohsah a, tua gam sunga a teng mihingte’ gitlona ziehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />an tampi pienna gam pen cilei gawta a suohsah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in senel gam buoltui suohsah a, ngal gawta ciatui a suohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Khum munah ama in a gilkielte tengsah a, amate in a tenna ding uh khuopi a sat uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />amate in lo-ah khaici tu-in, lenggui a suon vua, an tampitah a la uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ama’ thupha tawh ante nahpi-in pung a, ama in a bawngte uzong a kiemsah sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Bawlsietna, buoina, le dana ziehin amate kiemsuhin, a kiniemkoi suh ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />ama in a bawlsiete tungah a lungkim lona sungsuhin, lam op lona gamlahah kivielesah kawikawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />hinanle a gentheina uh panin ama in tasamte lamto a, tuuhon bangin a innkuonpite a pungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Thuman mite in tua khu mu-in a kipah vua, tuale gitlona zosie in a kam uh a sipsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A pilte in tamte thupi sanin, Topa’ itna kip lungngai ta uheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pasien aw, ka lungsim kip hi, ka lungsim kip hi; keima in ngaitahin la ka sa ding hi. Ka hlagau aw, khanglo in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Harp le lyre lasahna aw, khanglo un! Zingmawng phalvah ka phong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, mite lahah nangma tungah lungdam kang ko ding a, minamte lahah nangma tungah phatna la ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen vantungte sangin na itna kip sangzaw a, nangma’ thumanna in meiipite dong banto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien aw, vantungte tungah kidomsang to inlen, leitung mun vannuoi-ah na minthanna om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na it mite a suotah thei nadingun, na zietlam khut tawh guolzawna ei pie inlen, keima ei dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pasien in a mun siengtho sungah thu a ciem zo hi: “Guolzaw lungdamna tawh Shechem ka phalsuo ding a, Succoth Kuom ka sekhen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead khu keima-a’ ahi hi; Manasseh zong khu keima-a’ ma ahi hi. Ephraim ka sia lukhu ahi hi; Judah pen keima’ ciengkhut ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab ka kisilna kuong ahi hi; Edom tungah ka kedap ka sep ding hi; Philistia gam tungah guolzawna tawh ka awng hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koi in kulpi nei khuopi-ah keima ei peipi ding ahei? Koi in Edom gamah keima ei pui ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pasien aw, nang in ko ei nuol zo ta hi lo na mah? Pasien aw, ka galkapte utawh na kuonkhie ton sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw, ka galdona vuah kote ei panpi in, azieh pen mihing’ panpina a mawhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pasien tawh hangtahin i do ding uhi; i galte tuoncil ding ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kang phat Pasien aw, dai op mawh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ka langkhatah migilote le zuouthu gente a kamkah vua, amate in ka langkhatah zuou genna leii tawh thu a gen uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in mudana kammalte tawh kei ei imtawm vua, thu om lopi-in ei do uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka itna ei thuhna-un amate adinga thungetna ka nei laitah nangawnin, keima ei mawsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaci’n amate in kei tungah hoina sietna tawh, itna mudana tawh ei thuhkia uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in, “Ama do dingin migilo khat koi un; ama’ ziet lamah a mawsah ding mi khat dingsah un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama thu a kisit ciengin, thu lelin kimu heh; ama’ thungetna zong mawna-in kisimpieh heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khan kumte tom hinlen; midang khat in ama’ za luo taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama’ tate pa nei loin om hinlen, ama’ zi zong meigong hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tate khutdaw ngenin vah kawikawi heh; a kisie amau’ tenna panin kinotmang ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A leibatna pa in a neisa zosie kilah dawh taheh; khuolmite in ama’ sepsa gate tomgam pieh ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama tungah a migi koima khat zong om loin, pa nei lo ama’ tate khuotuo ding koima om sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama’ suonlehlahte mangthai taheh; khang nina ciengin ama’ min kiphietmang taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa mai-ah a pa’ khielna kiphawhkia hinlen, a nu’ mawna kiphiet mang sih taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa mai-ah tuate omsah suoh unlen, leitung panin ama’ kiphawna om ta sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen ama in migitna lah ding phawh kha loin, mizawng mi cimawte le lungsim kitamzan mite a si dongin a gamdel zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in mi samsiet nuom a sa hi; ama tungah samsietna tung taheh. Ama in thupha a dei sih hi; ama le thupha kigamla taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in samsietna puon tungsil bangin sil a, ama’ pumpi sungah tui bangin, a gu a tangte sungah sathau bangin, tuate lutin kizel taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tua samsietna khu ama’ kituomna puontuol bang hinlen, nisima a kigahna khu kawnggah bang taheh,” a ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua khu keima ei mawsahte tung, ka hinkhuo ei gensiete tungah, Topa kung pana ang pei a thaman uh hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa ka Pasien aw, na min na khuolna tawh keima tangin hing pang in; na itna kip hoi ahi ziehin keima ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile kei zawngin ka cimaw a, keima sungah ka lungtang kisun pailet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nitah nihlim bangin ka tum ta hi; kauphe bangin ei kithingkhe hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Antanna ziehin ka khupte a zaw hi; ka pumpi gawngtam zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Keima ei mawsah mite’ nuisatin ka om ta hi; amate in kei ei mu ciengin a lu ei peisan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa ka Pasien aw, keima ei hu in! Na itna kip dung zui-in keima ei hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tami nangma’ khut tawh kibawl ahi lam amate theisah in; Topa aw, nangma in tuate na bawl zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Amate in ei samsah in, hizongle nang in thupha nei pie ding hi. Ka langte maizumsah in; na nasempa ei lungdamsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Keima ei mawsah mite mindaina silsah inlen, puontuolpi sil bangin a maizumna sung vuah kituomcip ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka kam tawh nahpitahin Topa tungah lungdam ka ko ding hi; keima in mihonte lahah ama ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile a sina ding dong uh a mawsah thukhenna a pie dingte kung panin, amate a hundam dingin mi cimawte’ ziet lamah ama a ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in ka pu pa kungah, “Na galte na keng ngahna ka hisah masangsie, ka ziet lamah to in,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa in Zion panin a vanglien na kumpi ciengkhut ang sawl hi. Na galte lahah vaihawm in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangma’ galkapte Muol siengthote tungah na pui ni ciengin, na mite lungsim lawptahin amau le amau ang kipie ding uhi. Na tangvalte uh zong zingmawng naubu sung pana ang suoh daitui bangin na kungah ang pei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa kiciem zo ta a, a lungsim a khel sih ding hi. “Melchizedek siempu gui zui-in kumtawn siempu na hi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na ziet lamah Topa om hi; ama’ thangpai ni-in ama in kumpite a suzan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in mite lahah thukhen ding a, tua munte siluong tawh a kidimsah ding hi; ama in a zai mama leitungah lutangte a tansan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in lam gei-a tui a dawn ding hi; tua ahi ziehin ama in a lu a phongto ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Mi thumante kipawlna, mihon kikhopna sungah ka lungsim zosie tawh Topa tungah lungdam ka ko ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ nasepnate lien a, nuom a sa zosie in tuate a kan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A nasepna pen patawina le thupina tawh kidim a, a thumanna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in a na lamdang sepnate thei zing dingin a bawl hi; Topa pen migi-in mi khuotuo siem pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ama in ama a zatahte an a pie hi; ama in a thuciemna a phawh zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in a mite tungah minamte’ gouluo piehna tawh a vanglien ama’ nasepnate a lah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A khut tawh a nasepnate muonhuoi-in thutang hi; a thuhilnate zosie zong muontah mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate a tawntunga a kipden ahi a, muonhuoina le thutang tawh a kisem ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a mite tungah tatkhietna a sawl hi; ama in kumtawn man dingin a thuciemna a bawl zo hi. Ama’ min siengtho giinhuoi mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa zatahna in pilna kipatna ahi hi; tua pilna a zuite zosie in theitelna hoi a nei uhi. Ama phatna kumtawnin kip hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Topa zatah a, ama’ thupiehte nuom a sa mite thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amau’ suon le hlahte leitungah mi thahat ahi ding uhi; thuman mite’ khanggui thupha kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A inn sung vuah neilelam le haunate om ding a, tuale a thumanna uzong kumtawnin a kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuman mite adingin khuomiel sungah amate khuovah bangin a tang uhi; amate pen a migi, mi hepi siem, le midihte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kiphal tahin mi sum palahsah a, thutang tawh vaihawmin a gamta mite tungah thu a hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile midihte kiling ngai lo ding hi; kumtawnin amate a kiphawh zing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in thusie kithangte a giing sih uhi; Topa’ sungah a lungsim uh kipin a kho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Amate a lungmuong hit hiet vua, amate a zau vawt sih ding uhi; a tawpna-ah amate in guolzawna tawh a galte a en ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hlawnna-in a hawm vua, mizawngte tungah a pie uhi; amau’ dihna kip tawntung hi; amau’ ki kitawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />migilote in mu-in a lungthah uhi; A ha uh gawi-in amate a mangthah ta uhi; migilote’ lungtup bangma lo a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Topa’ nasemte aw, phat un; Topa’ min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa’ min in tu huna kipanin kumtawnin thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nisuo-a kipan nitum dongin Topa’ min phat ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Minam zosie tungah Topa kitawisang a, vantungte sangin ama’ minthanna a sangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A sangna muna a to pa, i Topa Pasien tawh kibang koi om a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a gamla pana vante le leitung a ensuh koi om ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in leivui panin mizawngte lamto a, ninphuol panin mi cimawte domto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in uliente tawh amate toton sah a, ama’ mite’ uliente tawh zong amate a totonsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in a ciing nupi nu ten nading inn pie a, ama pen tate a tawi nu kipah a suohsah hi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-te, Egypt panin a pusuoh vua, kam lamdang a zang mite kung pan Jacob innkuon a peidawh ciengun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Judah, Pasien’ mun siengtho suoh a, Israel, a uhna gam a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuipi in enin taimang hi; Jordan gun a nuakia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Muolte tuutangte bangin kitom a, muoltangte tuunote bangin a kitom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuipi aw, nang bang dinga taimang dawh na hei? Jordan aw, nang bang dinga nuakia dawh na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Muolte aw, bang dingin tuutang bangin kitomin, muoltangte aw, bang dingin tuuno bangin kitom na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung aw, suongpi buoltui suohsahin, thausuong ciatui a suohsah pa, Jacob Pasien’ opna ahi, Topa’ opna-ah citunin om in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ko tungah hi loin, Topa aw, ko tungah hi loin, na itna kip le na thumanna hangin na min in minthanna nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bang dingin minamte in, “A Pasien uh hei-a om ahei?” ci laizang ding uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vantungah i Pasien uh om hi; ama in a dei popo a sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amau’ milimte pen kham le ngun hi lel a, tuate mihingte’ khut tawh kibawl ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuate in kam a nei vangun a ham thei sih uhi; mit a nei vangun khuo a mu thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate in bil a nei vangun khuo a za thei sih uhi; nahkuo a nei vangun a gimnam a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in khut a nei vangun a tham thei sih uhi; amate in keng a nei vangun, lam a pei thei sih uhi; a lawlhawm un zong aw a gingsah thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuate a bawlte le tuate a muong zosiete, tuate ma tawh kibang ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Israel aw, Topa muong in! Ama pen amau’ hupa le amau’ kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aaron innkuonte aw, Topa muong un! Ama pen amau’ hupa le amau’ kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />No Topa a zatah mite aw, Topa muong un! Ama pen amau’ hupa le amau’ kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in eite ei phawh hi; ama in eite thupha ei pie ding hi; ama in Israel innkuon thupha a pie ding hi; ama in Aaron innkuonte thupha pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />ama in Topa a zatahte a lien a neu-in thupha pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in noma le na tate na nipi-un hing pungsah taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vantung le leitung a bawl Topa in note thupha hing pie taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vantungte ahile Topa’ vantungte ahi a, ahi vangin ama in mihingte tungah leitung a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Misite in ahi a, gamdaina sunga a peisuh poma in ahi zongin Topa a phat sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ahi vangin tuhun a kipanin Topa i phat zing ding uhi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa ka it hi, azieh pen ama in ka aw le ka thumnate ei za zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kei lamah a bil ei ngat ziehin, ka hin laisie-in ama ka hlan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sina thangte in kei ei kimkot hi; Misikhuo natnate in kei ei tucip hi; keima in lungkham mangbahnate ka thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ciengin keima in Topa’ min ka hlan a: “ Topa aw, ka hinna ei hun in,” ci-in thu ka ngen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa pen hepi siemin thuman hi; i Pasien in mi a khuotuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in thu thei lote kem hi; ei kinetniem ciengin ama in keima ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka hlagau aw, Topa in nangma tungah a kicingin hing bawl zo ahi ziehin na toidamna munah hing kilekia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile nangma in sina panin ka hlagau na hunkhie a, hlituite panin ka mit hunkhie-in, kipaina panin ka keng na hunkhie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hingte’ gam sung Topa mai-ah kei ka vah kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Keima in nahpi-in gimna ka thuoh hi,” ka ci hun nangawnin keima in ka upna ma ka tu lenlon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka cimaw ziehin, “Mi zosie zuou gen vive hi,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Keima tunga ama’ hoina zosie ziehin Topa tungah bang tawh thuhkia ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Keima in hutdamna hai ka domsang ding a, Topa’ min ka hlan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mite zosie’ opna mai-ah Topa tungah ka thuciemna, ka pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Topa muna-ah ama’ thuman mite sina pen manpha mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa aw, keima na nasempa ka hi hi; nangma’ nasem ka hi a, na nasem nu’ ta ka hi hi. Nangma in kei ei kikhinate nei sutpieh zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Keima in nangma tungah lungdamko biehpiehna lui-in, Topa’ min ka hlan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, ama’ mite zosie mai, Topa’ inn huong sung, nangma’ laizangah Topa tunga ka kiciemnate ka pie ding hi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Minam zosiete aw, Topa phat un! Mi zosiete aw, ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile eite tungah ama’ itna kip lien mama a, Topa’ muonhuoina kip tawntung hi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdam ko un, azieh pen ama hoi hi; ama’ itna kip tawntung hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-te in, “Ama’ itna kip tawntung hi,” ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aaron innkuonte in, “Ama’ itna kip tawntung hi,” ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa a zatah mite in, “Ama’ itna kip tawntung hi,” ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka lungkhamna panin Topa ka hlan hi; Topa in ei dawngin, mun tanzau-ah ei koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka gei-ah Topa ang om a, kei ka zau sih hi. Mihingte in kei bang ei law zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima ei panpi dingin kei lamah Topa a om hi; keima in ei muda mite guolzawna tawh ka en ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi i muon sangin Topa bel ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Uliente i muon sangin Topa bel ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Minam zosie in ei imtawm uhi; Topa’ min tawh amate ka vatmai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in ei kimkot vua, ka kimvelah ei imtawm uhi; keima in Topa’ min tawh amate ka vatmai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate in khuoi bangin kei ei imtawm uhi; amate ahi uleh lingkung kuong bang uhi; keima in Topa’ min tawh amate ka vatmai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka pua nadingin nahpitahin ei kisawn a, ahi vangin Topa in keima ei panpi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa pen ka hatna le ka vanglietna ahi hi; ama pen keima ei kihutdamna a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Midihte’ puonbuh sungah guolzawna la kisa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“ Topa’ zietlam khut kilamto hi; Topa’ zietlam khut in hangtahin na sem hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei si loin ka hingzaw ding a, Topa’ nasepte ka gengen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Topa in nasie tahin kei thu ei hil zo a, hinanle ama in sina cieng ei thuohsah sam lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdam ko-in ka lut thei nadingin, thumanna kotpite kei ei hon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tami Topa’ kotpi ahi hi; tua panin midihte a lut ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma in kei ei dawngin, ka hutdamna na hi ziehin nangma tungah ka lungdam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Innlamte in a nuolsa suongpi pen innkiu suongpi a suoh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tami Topa’ nasep ahi hi; tam pen eite’ mitah lamdang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tuni pen Topa’ bawlsa ni ahi hi; tami ni-ah nuomin kipah va vui.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa aw, kote ei hun in, nangma tungah kang thum uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa’ min tawh ang pei pa in thupha nga taheh. Kote in Topa’ inn panin thupha kang pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa pen Pasien ahi a, ama in eite khuovah ei pie zo hi. Singnate tawi-in maitam sakite dongah guol nuomin kizawt un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang ka Pasien na hi a, na tungah lungdam kang ko ding hi; nang ka Pasien na hi a, nangma kang phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Topa tungah lungdam ko un, azieh pen ama hoi a, ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ thukham zui-in kalsuon a, a gamtatna vua a genbang lote thupha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama’ thupiehte zui-in lungsim tahpi tawh ama a suite thupha nga ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khielna zong bawl loin ama’ lampi a zuite thupha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangma’ thuhilte limtaha a kizui nadingin thu na pie zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na thukipte ka zuina ah ka lampite suhkipin om taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ciengin na thupiehte zosie mit tuhna’n ka nei ziehin, ei kimaizumsah lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A dih na ngaina kipte ka sin ciengin keima in lungsim man tawh kang phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na thukhamte ka zui ding hi; kei ei nuasie malmal sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tangvalte in amau’ gamtatna a sientho nadingin bangci kep ding uh ahei? Na kammal banga zuina tawh siengthosah thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka lungsim zosie tawh nang kang sui hi; na thupiehte panin kei ei pielsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Na tunga kang maw lo nadingin ka lungsim sungah na thu ka khol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa aw, thupha nga ta in; na thukhamte kei ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na kam pana ang pusuoh na ngaina kipte zosie ka nephu tawh ka pulah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hauna zosie a nga tawh kibangin na thukipte zui nuom ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na thuhilnate lungngai-in na lampite mit tuhna’n ka nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na thukham sungah nuom ka sa ding hi; na thu ka mangngil sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nungta-in nangma’ thu ka zui thei nadingin na nasempa keima ei lawcingsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Na thukham sung pan a lamdang nate ka mu thei nadingin ka mit ei honpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Kei pen tam leitungah pemta bangin ka teng hi; keima kung panin na thupiehte phuol sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na ngaina kipte a tawntungin ka lunggul ziehin ka hlagau a haisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na thupiehte pana a vahmang, a kisamsie, a kiphasahte na phawhsie hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />na thukipte zui ka hi ziehin ka kung panin amau’ ei nuisatna le ei simmawnate la dawh ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Miliente in kei ei langpan nading thu a dap vaihawm vangun, na nasempa in na thupiehte a lung ngaingai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na thukipte keima’ nopsahna ahi a, tuate ka thukuppite ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka hlagau leivui lahah a kipawi hi; na thu om bangin ei hingsahkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka gamtatnate kang gen ciengin nangma in keima nei dawng hi; na thukhamte ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na thuhilna dante ei telsah inlen, na bawl nalamdangte ka lung ngaingai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Dana ziehin ka hlagau a zungmang dawh ta hi; na thu om bangin keima ei thahatsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A man lo lampite tawh ei kigamlasah in; hepina tawh na thukham ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Thuman lampi ka tel zo hi; ka mai-ah na ngaina kipte ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Topa aw, na thukipte ka pom hi; kei ei maizumsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka theitelna na khansah ziehin na thupiehte bangin ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa aw, na thukham lampite ei hil in. tua hi leh a tawpna dongin ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Na thukhamte kemin ka lungsim zosie tawh ka zui thei nadingin thutelna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Na thupieh lampite ah keima ei pui in, bangzieh ahei cile tuate ah nuom ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka lungsim pen angsung khuolna lam hi loin, na thukip lamah ei heipieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Bangma lote ka etna panin ka mit ei heipieh in; na lampite ah hinna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Ang zatah mite dinga na kamciem, na nasempa tungah hing kipsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Na ngaina kipte hoi ahi ziehin ka kung panin ka giin mama mindaina ei heimangpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />En in, keima in na thuhilnate ka lunggul hi; Na thumanna sungah hinna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Topa aw, na kamciem bangin itna kip, na hutdamna kei tungah hing tungsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Tua ciengin na thu muong ka hi ziehin ei zako mite ka dawn nading ka nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Na ngaina kipte lamen ka hi ziehin, ka kam panin thutah kammalte la dawh malmal sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A tawntungin tatsat loin na thukhamte ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Na thuhilnate ka sui ziehin suohta tahin ka vah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Kumpite mai-ah zong nangma’ thukipte ka gen ding a, maizumna ka thuoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Keima in tuate ka dei ziehin tua na thupiehte sungah keima’ nopsahna ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Keima’ dei ahi na thupiehte ka zatah a, nangma’ thukhamte ka lung ngaingai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Keima nei lametsah ahi na nasempa tunga na kammal phawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Tam khu ka lunggim hun cienga ka kihenepna ahi a, tua na kamciem in keima hinna ei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte in kei ei zako vua, hinanle na thukham panin kei ka piel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Topa aw, hun lui lai-a kipanin nangma’ ngaina kipte ka ngaisut khah ciengin, ka lung a nuom hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Na thukham a nuasie migilote ziehin ka sin a so hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ka opna inn popo ah na thukhamte la-in ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Topa aw, zanin na min ka phawh a, na thukham ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Na thuhilnate ka zui ziehin keima tungah tam thuphate ang tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Topa keima’ satanh ahi hi; na thute zui ding ka kiciem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ka lungsim zosie tawh na maipha kang ngen hi; na thuciem a omsa bangin keima ei hepi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Na lampite ka ngaisut ciengin, na thukipte lamah kang kalsuon hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />na thupiehte zui ding ka kinaw a, ka kiheh sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Migilote’ thangkhau tawh ei kisie nanleh keima in na thukham ka mangngil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A dih na ngaina kipte ziehin nang ang phat dingin zankim laitahin ka tho hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Kei, nang ang zatah mite le nangma’ thuhilnate a zui mi zosiete’ kigoppi a guolpa uh ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Topa aw, na itna kip tawh leitung a kidim hi; na thukhamte kei ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Topa aw, na thu om bangin na nasempa na limbawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Na thupiehte um ka hi ziehin thu khentel siemna le thu theina ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Ei kigenthei bawl masangin kei lam ka piel a, ahi vangin tu-in nangma’ thu ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Nang na hoi a, sil hoi na bawl hi. Na thukhamte kei ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte in kei zuouthu tawh ei mindaisah vua, hinanle ka lungsim zosie tawh na thuhilnate ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />A lungsim uh sathau bangin khalh a, ahi vangin keima in nangma’ thu nuom ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Na thukhamte ka sin thei nadingin ei kibawlsiet pen kei adingin hoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Na kam pana ang pusuoh na thukham khu kei adingin kham le ngun tul tampite sangin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />Nangma in khut tawh kei ei bawlin nei na zem hi; na thupiehte ka sin thei nadingin theitelna kei ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Na thu sungah lametna ka nei ziehin nangma ang zatahte in kei ei mu-in a lungdam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Topa aw, na thukhennate man hi, ci-in ka thei a, tua na thumanna sungah nei gentheibawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />Na nasempa tunga na kamciem a om bangin nangma’ itna kip pen ka kihenepna hi taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Nangma’ thukham in ka nopsahna ahi ziehin, ka hin thei nadingin kei tungah na lungsietna hing tungsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte in solna tawh ei lebawl ahi ziehin, amate maizumsah in. Kei ka hi leh na thuhilnate ka lungngaingai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Na thukipte a thei nadingun nangma ang zahtahte kei lamah hing kiheisah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Maizumna ka thuoh lo nadingin nangma’ thukhamte ah ka lungsim paubang loin om taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Na hutdamna lunggulin ka hlagau a vulnang hi; keima in na thu sungah kinepna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />Na kamciemte ka etetna-in ka mitte a kham ta hi; keima in, “Bang hun ciengin ei henem ding na hei? ci-in ka dong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />Bang ding ahei cile kei pen meikhu lahah a om savun-um ka bang a, hizongle na thukhamte ka mangngil tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />Na nasempa in bang tanvei thuoh lai ding ahei? Keima ei bawlsiete bang hun ciengin thukhen ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte in ka kieh nading dum a to uhi; amate in na thukham a mang sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />Nangma’ thupiehte zosie a tawntungin kip hi; a thu om loin kei ei kibawlsie hi; keima ei hu in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Amate in leitungah keima ei that zo dihtah uhi; ahi vangin keima in na thuhilnate ka taisan tuon vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />Nangma’ kam pana na thukipte ka zui thei nadingin na itna kip sungah keima nei hinkhawi lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Topa a om zing a, vantungah na thu kip tahin kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />Na muonhuoina khang tawntungin kip hi; nangma in leitung na phut a, tua khu kiptahin a ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Nangma’ sena bangin tuni dongin tuate a kip uhi, bangzieh ahei cile na zosie nangma’ nasem ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />Na thukham nuom a sa lo hi leng, ka hamsat hunin ka kisie zo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />Keima in na thuhilnate ka mangngil ngai sih ding hi. Bangzieh ahei cile tuate tawh kei hinna nei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />Kei nangma-a’ ka hi hi; na thuhilnate ka sui ziehin, keima ei hundam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Kei ei susie dingin migilote in ei buhdap uhi, ahi vangin keima in na thukipte ka ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />Kicinna vannuoi in ciengtan a nei lam ka mu zo a, ahi vangin na thupiehte ahile nahpi tahin a zai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Aw, bangza tahin na thukham it ka hei! Sun tungtawn a ka lungngaingai khu tuami ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />Na thupieh in ka galte zosie sangin a pilzaw-in ei bawl hi, Bang ding ahei cile tua khu keima tawh a omton zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />Keima in ka siete zosie sangin thutelna ka neizaw hi, azieh pen na thukipte khu ka lungngaingaite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Khanghamte sangin thu ka telzaw hi, azieh pen na thuhilnate ka zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />Na thu ka zui thei nadingin sietna lampi zosie panin ka keng ka nuatuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />Nangma in ei hil zo na hi ziehin na ngaina kipte panin ka piel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />Na thute a hlum ta mama a, ka kamah khuoizu sangin hlumzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />Na thuhilnate tung panin theitelna ka nga hi; tua ahi ziehin keima in a man lo lampi zosie ka muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />Na thu in ka keng adingin meivah ahi a, ka lampi-ah khuovah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />A thuman na ngaina kipte zui dingin ka kiciem a, ka kipsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Nahpi tahin gimna ka thuoh hi; Topa aw, na thu a om bangin keima hinna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Topa aw, ka phatna biehnate ei sang inlen, na ngaina kipte ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Ka khut sungah ka hinna humin ka kem zing a, hizongle nangma’ thukham ka mangngil tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Migilote in thang ei sie nan ule, na thuhilnate panin ka piel tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />Nangma’ thukipte khu tawntung ka gouluo ding ahi a, tuate keima’ lungdamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Na thukhamte a tawp donga a zui zing dingin ka lungsim ka khensat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Keima in a lungkaa mite ka muda a, ahi vangin na thukham ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nang pen ka kibuhna mun le ka kidalna lum na hi hi; na thu sungah lametna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />No, sietna a bawl mite aw, Pasien’ thupiehte ka zui thei nadingin keima kung panin peidawh ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />Keima ka hin thei nadingin na kamciem a omsa bangin ei panpi inlen, keima’ lametna-ah ei maizumsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />Keima ka bih nading le na thukhamte ka thusim den nadingin keima ei tudet in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />Nangma in thukhamte panin a lampiel mite na hosie hi; bangzieh ahei cile amau’ khelpilnate a mawhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />Nang in leitunga migilote zosie sia-eh bangin na ngaisun hi; tua ahi ziehin keima in na thukipte ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Kang giin ziehin ka citun a, na thukhennate zong ka giing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />Thutang le thuman tawh ka gamta zo hi; kei ei bawlsiete kungah ei nuasie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />Na nasempa a nopsah nadingin nangma hing kikham inlen, Pasien thei lo mite in kei ei gawtsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />Nangma’ hutdamna le a man na kamciem ang tangtun ding ka etna-in ka mitte a gim ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />Nangma’ itna kip tawh kituohin na nasempa tungah ei bawl inlen, na thukhamte ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />Keima na nasempa ka hi hi; na thukipte ka thei nadingin theitelna ei guon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Topa aw, na thukham kipalsat zo ahi ziehin na sepkhiet hun ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />A mantahin kham le kham citahte sangin nangma’ thupiehte ka itzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Na thuhilnate zosie tawh kituohin a mantahin ka kalsuon a, a man lo lampi popo ka muda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />Na thukipte a lamdang hi; tua ahi ziehin ka hlagau in tuate a zui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />Na thute telgenna in khuo a vahsah hi; thu thei lote tungah theitelna guon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Na thupiehte ka lunggul ziehin ka kam kahin ka haisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Nangma’ min a itte tunga na bawl ngai bangin kei lamah hing kihei-in keima ei hepi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />Nei kamciemsa bangin ei kalsuonsah inlen, keima tungah khielna in thu hing vaihawmsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />Keima in nangma’ thuhilnate ka zui thei nadingin mihingte’ ei bawlsietna panin keima eitan dawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />Na nasempa tungah na maipha hing tangsah inlen, na thukhamte ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Na thukham a kizui lo ziehin ka hlitui hawh luon bangin a luong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Topa aw, nang na dih a, na thukhennate a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />Na koisa na thukipte man a, a unpi-in muontah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka galte in na thute a mangngil tah ziehun ka deiluotna in kei ei katum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />Na kamciem kicien mama a, na nasempa in a dei mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Kei ka neu a, ei kisimmaw hi, ahi vangin na thuhilnate ka mangngil sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />Na thumanna khu tawntung thumanna ahi hi; na thukhamte zong thuman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Buoina le lungkhamna keima tungah ang tung a, ahi vangin na thupiehte ahile keima’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />Na thukipte a tawntungin a man hi; keima ka hin thei nadingin theitelna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka lungsim zosie tawh kang kiko hi; ei dawng in Topa aw! Na thukhamte ka zui ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />Nangma kungah kang kiko hi; na thukipte ka zui thei nadingin keima ei hun in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Phalvah masangin ka tho a, huna ngenin kang kiko hi; na thu ah ka lametna ka koi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />Na kamciemte ka lungngai thei nadingin, zan vilte hun masangin ka mit a hahhah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />Na itna kip sungah keima’ aw za inlen, nangma’ thutang sungah ka hinna ei kem in, Topa aw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />Gitlona ngimna tawh kei ei bawlsiete in kei ei neh uhi; na thukham tawh amate a kigamla mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Hinanle Topa aw, nangma na nai om a, na thupiehte zosie zong ahi tahtah vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Tuate a tawntunga a kip dingin na phukip ahi lam, nangma’ thukipte panin sawtveipi-in ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Na thukham ka mangngil lo ziehin keima ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />Ka thu ei panpi inlen, keima ei tankhie in. Nangma’ kamciem tawh kizui-in hinna ei pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />Amate in na thukhamte a sui lo ziehun, migilote kung panin hutdamna a gamla om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />Topa aw, na khuotuona lien hi; na thutanna tawh kituohin ka hinna kei nei pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />Keima ei bawlsie ka galte tampi om a, hinanle na thukipte panin kei ka piel tuon sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Amate in na thupieh a zui lo ziehun, kidahna tawh Pasien nei lote ka en hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />Na thuhilnate bangza tahin dei ka hei ci ngaisun in. Nangma’ itna kip tawh kituohin nangma in ka hinna nei keppieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />Na thugente a unpi-in thuman ahi a, a man na ngaina kipte zosie a tawntungin kip peisuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Uliente in a thu om lopi-in ei bawlsie uhi. Ahi vangin ka lungsim in na thute a giing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />Van kinuasie tampi nga pa bangin nangma’ thu sungah ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Zuouthu muda-in ka huo a, hinanle na thukhamte ka it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />A dih na ngaina kipte ziehin ni khatin sagivei nangma kang phat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />Nangma’ thukham a itte in lungnopna lienpi a nei uhi; amate bangma in a puasah zo sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Topa aw, na hutdamna ka lamen a, na thupiehte ka sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Ka hlagau in na thukipte a zui hi; keima in tuate ka nah it mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />Keima in na thuhilnate le na thupiehte ka zui hi, azieh pen ka lampi zosie na masangah a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Topa aw, kang kikona na mai-ah hing tung hinlen, nangma’ thu omsa tawh kizui-in theitelna kei ei guon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Keima’ ang thumna na mai-ah hing tung hinlen, na kamciem omsa tawh kizui-in kei ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />Na thukhamte nei hil ziehin ka nephu pan phatna ka luongsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Na thupiehte zosie man ahi ziehin ka leii in na kamciemna la-in a sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />Na thuhilnate ka teel zo tah ziehin keima ei hu dingin na khutte kithawisa-in omsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Topa aw, na hutdamna ngahla-in ka om a, na thukhamte ka kipahna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Nangma kang phat thei nadingin keima ei hingsah inlen, na ngaina kipte in kei ei husah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />Tuu mang bangin lam ka piel zo ta hi; na thupiehte ka mangngil lo ziehin na nasempa ei sui in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama in ei dawn thei nadingin ka genthei ciengin Topa tungah ka kiko hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“ Topa aw, zuouthu genna leii pan le mi solte kam panin kei ei hun in,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang zuouthu gen leii aw, na tungah bang hing kipie ding a, na tungah bang hing kiseppieh lai ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Galhang pa’ thaltang hiemte le luonglau meikam sa du na hi amah!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Meshech gam sunga pemta ka hina le Kedar buhte lahah ka ten khah pen mi hamsie ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kilemna a dei lo mite lahah sauveipi ka na teng kha ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei kilem nading dei ka hi hi; hizongle tua thu ka gen ciengin amate in galin ei bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Muoltung lam enin ka dahto hi, keima ei kihuna hei pana ang pei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vantung le leitung a bawl Topa kung panin ei kihuna ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in na keng a piasah sih ding hi; nang ang kem pa zong a lusu sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel a kem pa lusu lo ding a, zong kimu lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa pen nangma ang cingpa ahi hi; Topa pen na ziet lama om na kibuhna sing hlim ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sunin ni in ang ka sih ding a, zanin hla in ang gimsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sietna vannuoi panin Topa in nangma ang hu ding hi; ama in na hinna ang keppieh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in tu huna kipan a tawntungin na sungtum na pusuona-ah nangma ang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate in keima kungah, “ Topa’ inn-ah pei vai!” ei ci uh ciengin ka kipah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem aw, na tunkotte sungah ka keng utawh ka ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khuopi khat a kilam Jerusalem khu dettah a kilam ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel ading thukip a omsa bangin Topa’ min tawh lungdamna ko dingin tua sungah Topa’ minamte a peito uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile thukhenna tophate, David innkuon’ tophate khum munah kikoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem kilem nading thungen un: “Nangma ang it amate a dau uh pei taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Na kulpite sungah kilemna om hinlen, na tausangte sungah zong bihna om taheh,” ci-in ngen un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka sanggamte le ka guolte vang tawh, keima in, “Nangma sungah kilemna om taheh,” ka ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa i Pasien uh’ inn ka khuolna-in nangma’ hoi nading ka sui ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vantungte-a mang topha tunga a to pa aw, nangma kang ento hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nasem pasalte in a mangpate’ khut a mitsuon bang le nasem numeite in a pi nute’ khut a mitsuon bangin, ama in eite tungah lainatna ei nei masangin, eite in Topa i Pasien i mitsuon lenlon uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kote ei khuotuo in, Topa aw, kote ei khuotuo in. Bangzieh ahei cile kote in ka thuoh zawh lo uh simmawna ka thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keima’ hlagau in a nopnop-a gamta mite’ hosietna, a kiphasah mite’ simmawna, a thuoh ding za sangin a tamzaw a thuoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eite lamah Topa ang pang lo hi leh, Israel-te in ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I galte in ei do ciengin eite lamah Topa ang pang lo hi leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />eite lamah a lungthahna uh a kikuontaw ciengin, amate in eite a hingin ei nawmval zo ta ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />tua ciengin tuikhang in eite ei taimang ta ding a, tuihuol in zong eite ei hlummang ta ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tua ciengin eite tungah tuipi husiepi a luong den ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amau’ ha tawh eite ei petzansah lo Topa in thupha nga taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thangsiete’ thang pana a suohta vasa bangin, thangmung kikuoitanin eite i suohta zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Van le lei a bawl Topa’ min sungah eite huna a om hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa a muong mite pen a kilawh zo lo, a kip tawntung Zion muol tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Muolte in Jerusalem a kimkot bangin, tu-a kipanin Topa in a mite a kimkot tawntung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midihte in khielna a bawl dingin a khutte a zah lo nadingin, midihte tunga kipie gamah migilote’ kumpi ciengkhut a om sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, mi hoite tung le lungsim thuman mite tungah na hoi hing sem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ahi vangin lampi kawi a a piel mite ahile Topa in sietna bawl mite tawh a pui ton ding hi. Israel tungah kilemna om taheh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in Zion’ vangphatna ang piehkia ciengin, i mang tawh a kibang va-ia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua ciengin i kam uh nuina tawh a kidim a, i leii zong lungdam lasahna tawh a kidim hi. Tua ciengin minamte lahah, “ Topa in amahaw dingin na lienpite a bawl zo ta hi,” kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in eite adingin na lienpite bawl zo a, tuaci’n eite i kipah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, Negeb-a luite bangin ka vangphatna uh ei piekia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlitui tawh khaici a tute in lungdamin kikona tawh an kilah ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kap kawmin kuonin a tu ding khaici a puo mi in lungdamin kikona tawh bulomte puo-in ang kilekia ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in inn lam sih leh, a lamte’ gimna a mawhna ahi hi. Topa in khuopi cing sih leh, a cingte’ cinna a mawhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zingmawng thobai-in zanlai-in na lup ha a, - nangma’ thalawsa an gim le tawl a na neh zong a mawhna ahi hi; azieh pen ama in a it mite tungah kimut hun a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tahtahin tate pen Topa tung pan gougil ahi a, gil sung pana pieng a ga zong khu ama’ ei pieh thaman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi khat in a khangdawn lai-a a nei tate pen galhang pa’ khut sunga om thaltangte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thallawng dima thaltang a nei mipa khu thupha nga ahi hi. Kulkotpi-ah a galte tawh a kiholim ciengin ama a kimaizumsah sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa zatahin ama’ lampite a zui mi zosie thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma in na khuta nasep gimna ga na ne ding hi; nang na lungdam ding a, tuaci’n nuomsa-in na daupei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na zinu pen na inn sungah a bawhpha lenggui bang ding hi; na tate pen na sabuoi kimvela olive singno dawng ngihngehte a bang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa a zatah mipa tua bangin thupha kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa in Zion panin nang thupha hing pie taheh. Na nuntah sung tungtawnin Jerusalem’ nopsahna mu ta in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na tusawnte mu inlen, Israel tungah lemna om taheh!
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Amate in ka neu lai-a patin tamveipi ei sim uhi,” tu-in Israel in ci heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka neu lai-a patin amate in tamveipi ei simmaw vangun, amate in ei zo sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lokaite in keima’ elzangah lo a kai uhi; amate in a tuma-kuohte uh a sausah uhi,” ci ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa a thuman a, migilote’ khaute a sattan zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zion a muda mite zosie maizumin kinuale sahkia in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a khan hlit masanga a vul, innkhum vuma lopa bangsah inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />tuate pen anlate in a sip dim zong a nga lo, buphai ia-te in lom khat zong a nga lo,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />lama peite in zong, “Na tungah Topa thupha om taheh! Topa’ min tawh thupha kang pie uhi,” a ci lo mite tawh kibangsah in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, a thuhna panin nangma kungah kang kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa aw, ka aw ei za in! Kang thumna awgingte na bil ei ngat inlen, limtahin ngai in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, nangma in khielnate ciemte lacin, Topa aw, koi in thuoh zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle ang kizatah thei nadingin mawmaisahna nang tawh a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa ka ngah hi, ka hlagau in zong a ngah hi, ama’ thu sungah lametna ka nei hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />galvilte in zingmawng a ngahla sang, galvilte in zingmawng a ngahla sangin, ka hlagau in Topa a ngahla zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel aw, Topa sungah kinem in! Azieh pen Topa tawh itna kip a om a, ama tawh a lien mama tatkhiet nading a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A khielnate zosie panun Israel tankhie ding pa khu ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka lungsim kihisah loin, ka mitte a sangda sih hi; kei dinga a thupi sengte le a lamdang sengte ka buoipi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hizongle a nu’ nawi a tang nausen bangin siptah le daitahin ka hlagu ka omsah zo hi; ka hlagau pen keima tawh a omton nawi tang nausen tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israel aw, tu-a patin a tawntungin Topa sungah kinepna nei in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, David’ maipha tawh ama’ thuoh hahsatna zosie phawh in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Topa tungah ama kiciemin, Jacob’ Vanglien Pa tungah kamciem pie a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka inn sungah lut loin ka lupna-ah ka lum sih ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa ading mun khat, Jacob’ Vanglien Pa’ ten nading mun khat ka mu masangin, kimu-in ka mit ka sing sih ding a, ka mitkhu ka khupsah sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eite in Ephathah gam sungah tua thu i za vua, Jaar gamlah ah i mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Ama’ tenna munah va pei ta vai; ama’ kengngahna-ah va bie ta vai,” ka ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, tho inlen, nangma’ tawlngahna munah nangma le na hatna singkuong tawh pei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na siempute in dihna puon bangin silin, na mi muonhuoite zong lungdamin awng ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen na nasempa David’ vang tawh na sathau nu pa’ maitang heimangpieh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa in David tungah a thawn lo kiciemna khat bawl a, tua panin ama a kiheikia sih ding hi: “Keima in na kumpi topha tungah nangma sung panin a pieng na tapate khat ka koi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na tapate in ka thuciemna le amate ka hil ding ka thukipte a zui nah po uleh, na kumpi topha tungah a tapate uh zong kumtawnin a to ding uhi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in Zion a teel zo hi; ama in khum mun pen ama’ ten nadingin dei hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tami mun pen kumtawn a ka tawlngahna mun ahi hi; tami mun dei ka hi ziehin tam sungah ka teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima in a an nehte uh niengtahin thupha ka pie ding hi; a mizawngte uzong an tawh ka lungkimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A siempute hutdamna puon ka silsah ding a, ama’ mi muonhuoite lungdamin a awng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua munah David adingin ki khat ka mengsah ding hi; keima in ka sathau nu pa adingin meivah khat ka bawlpieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama’ galte mindaina puon ka silsah ding a, hinanle ama tungah a kumpi lukhu a val lihleh ding hi,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Unaute pumkhat suohin a ten ton valiei ciengun bangza tahin hoi-in etlawm ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tua khu Aaron’ luzang panin a khamul kai a zuisuh, a puontuol ngawng donga a taasuh sathau manpha tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua pen Zion muolte tunga a kie, Hermon daitui tawh kibang hi. Bang ding ahei cile Topa in hin dendenna ama’ thupha tua munah a pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa’ inn sungah zan lai-a a cing, no, Topa’ nasemte aw, hing pei unlen Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mun siengtho lamah na khut uh lamto-in Topa phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Van le lei a bawl Topa in Zion panin thupha hing pie taheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! I Pasien’ inn huong sung, Topa’ inn sunga a ding, Topa’ nasemte aw, Topa’ min phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa phat un, azieh pen Topa hoi hi; ama’ min phatna la sa un, azieh pen ama in mi hepi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile Topa in ama dingin Jacob teel zo a, ama’ neisa dingin Israel teel zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Azieh pen keima in Topa lien hi, ci ka thei hi; i Topa uh pen pasien-te zosie sangin lienzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vantung le leitung, tuipite le a thuhna zosiete sungah Topa in a dei bangin na sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leimong panin meiilumte a kaisah pa ama ahi hi; ama in guo a zuh nadingin tunphesah a, tuale a kholna panin hui pusuohsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Egypt gam sungah mihing le ganhing tacil zosie a vatmai pa ama ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Egypt aw, Pharaoh le a nasem zosie a do nadingin ama in nangma sungah lim le na lamdangte a sawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in minam tampi vatmai-in kumpi thahatte that hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amor-te’ kumpipa Sihon, Bashan kumpipa Og, Canaan kumpite zosie that a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />amau’ leitang, ama’ mi Israel-te, gouluo dingin a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa aw, na min kumtawnin kip a, Topa aw, na minthanna khang tawntungin kip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in ama’ mite tungah thukhen a, ama’ nasemte tungah lainatna nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Minamte’ milimte pen mihingte’ khut tawh kibawl, ngun le khamte ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuate in kam a nei vangun a ham thei sih uhi; tuate in mit a nei vangun khuo a mu thei sih uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />tuate in bil a nei vangun khuo a za thei sih vua, tuate’ kam sungah naahu a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuate a bawl mite, tuate a muong mite zosie pen tuate ma tawh kibang ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Israel innkuonte aw, Topa phat un! Aaron innkuonte aw, Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Levi innkuonte aw, Topa phat un! Topa a zatahte aw, Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Zion panin Jerusalem-a a teng Topa in thupha nga taheh. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama hoi ahi ziehin Topa tungah lungdam ko un, bang ding ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, pasien-te’ Pasien tungah lungdam ko un, azieh pen ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, topate’ Topa tungah lungdam ko un, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nalamdang lienpite a bawl pa khu ama beh ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Theitelna tawh vante a bawl pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuite tunga leitung a pha pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khuovah liente a bawl pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sun hun a uh dinga ni a siem pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zan hun a uh dinga hlapi a siem pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Egypt gam sung tenga tacilte a vatmai pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate lah panin Israel a peipi pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A baan zahin a khut thahat tawh a pui pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />San Tuipi phalni a suo pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A laikima Israel-te a kantansah pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hinanle Pharaoh le a galkapte San Tuipi sunga a thalpai pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mite senel gam pana a peipi pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumpi liente a satlia pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kumpi minthangte a that pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amor-te’ kumpipa Sihon a that pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Bashan kumpipa Og a that pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amau’ leitang gouluo dinga a pie pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama’ nasem Israel-te gouluo a pie pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I nam dinmun uh a niem laitaha ei phawh pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I galte kung pana ei hunkhie pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi zosie tungah an a pie pa khu ama ahi hi, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vantung Pasien tungah lungdam ko un, bangzieh ahei cile ama’ itna kip tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion khuopi i ngaituo khah ciengin, Babylon gunte gei-ah tosuhin i kapkap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khum taha gielheh kungte tungah i lyre lasahnate i khai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen tua munah sala ei mante le ei bawlsiete in guolnop thei nadingin la i sah ding ei dei vua, amate in, “Zion late ei sahpieh un,” ei ci uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Gamdangah Topa’ la bangci sah thei ding uh ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jerusalem khuopi aw, nang kang mangngil tah leh, ka zietlam khut buisum taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangma kang phaw khah sih a, ka lungdamna a sang pena Jerusalem kang koi sih tah leh, ka dangtawngah ka leii beh den taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, Jerusalem a pua ni-in Edom mite in, “A zung dongin guoicimsah un! guoicimsah un!” a ci khu phawh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi a guoicimsah nang Babylon tanu aw, kote tunga nei bawl bangin nangma tunga ang thuhkia mite lungdam ding uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na taneute hing lahpieh a, suongtum denna-a ang neipieh mite a lungdam ding uhi!
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka lungsim zosie tawh nangma tungah lungdam kang ko hi; keima in pasien-te mai-ah nangma phatna la-in ka sa hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na biehinn siengtho lam nga-in ka kun a, tuale nangma’ itna kip le na muonhuoina ziehin, na min kang phat hi; azieh pen nang in sil bangkim na min le na thu na tawisang zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kang hlat ni-in nei dawng a, ka hlagau thahatna na khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, leitung kumpi zosie in nangma ang phat ding uhi, azieh pen amate in na kam tawh na thugente a za zo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ minthanna lien mama ahi ziehin amate in Topa’ nasepna ziete la-in a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa a sangpi hinanle, ama in tuolngiem mite don a, gamlapi panin a kiphasah mite a mu veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hahsatna kawmkalah ka pei vangin ka galte’ lungthahna panin nei kem hi; Nangma in na khut na zah a, na zietlam khut in ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in kei dinga a tupna a tangtun ding hi; Topa aw, na itna kip tawntung hi. Na khuta na sepsate nuasie sin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nang in kei nei kan a, nei thei zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang in ka suh ka to na thei hi; ka ngaisutnate nang in gamlapi panin na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka lampi le ka lupna na long dawh a, ka gamtatna zosie na thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, ka kam panin thu khat ka gen masang nangawnin, nangma in ka thugen ding teng a unpi-in na thei zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangma in ka nua ka ma-ah nei dal a, keima tungah na khut na ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tam banga nei theina pen kei adingin lamdang mama hi; tua khu a san seng ziehin ka thei ban zo sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma’ hlagau kung panin kei hei-ah pei ding ka hei? Nangma’ opna mun panin kei hei-ah tai ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vantungah kato leng lah tua sungah nang na om hi; Misikhuo lupna-in nei nan leng zong tua sungah nang na om veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zingmawng’ hlate tungah tuongin tuipi mong dongah teng zong nan leng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nangma’ khut in tua mun nangawnah ei peipi a, nangma’ zietlam khut in keima ei tudet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Keima in, “Khuomiel in ei tuom valon hinlen, ka kima om khuovah zan khuomiel suoh heh,” ci ta leng zong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />nangma adingin tua khuomiel nangawn a miel tuon sih hi; tuami zan pen sun nitang tawh kibang hi, azieh pen nang adingin tua khuomiel khuovah bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Azieh pen ka pumpi sunglam nate a siem nangma na hi hi; nangma in ka nu’ gil sungah keima nei phan ditdet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang in a giinhuoi le a lamdanga kei nei bawl ziehin nangma kang phat hi. Nangma’ nasepnate lamdang mama hi; tua khu ka thei siem mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thuhna leisiet mun simtham ah ei kiguonggatin ei kisiem laitahin, nangma kung panin ka gu ka tangte a kisel sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in a kipiengsah nai lo ka pumpi nate na mit in a mu hi. Tuate khat beh a op masang, ka ni za ding zosie a kise lai-in, nangma’ laibu sungah tua thu teng zosie kigiel zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pasien aw, na ngaisutnate kei dingin bangza-in manpha ahei! Tuate zosie a kigawmna bangza-in zai ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua tengpi ka sim sawm ciengin, senel sangin a tamzaw hi; a sim ka man zo ta hi, nang tawh ka omton lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pasien aw, migilote that lacin, keima kung panin sisan a luongsah mite a kihem pan bep ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gitlo lungsim tawh nangma’ thu a gen mite in nangma’ siet nadingin na langkhatah a pang uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Topa aw, nang ang mudate ke’n zong muda hi lo ka mah? Nangma langpanga a ding mite ke’n kidah hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ke’n amate ka tah muda hi; amate galte bangin ka tuot hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pasien aw, keima ei kancien inlen, ka lungsim ei thei in; keima ei sittel inlen, ka ngaisutnate ei thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka sungah gitlona lampi khatpo a om kha amah ei en inlen, tawntung lampi-ah ei pui in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, sietna bawlte kung pan kei ei hunkhie in; mi tatsiete kung panin keima ei dal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lungsim sung vuah amate in thusie a gel vua, gal a phuong mielmuol uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in gulpi’ leii bangin a leii a hiemsah vua, a leii dangnei vuah muoltan’ gu a om hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa aw, migilote khut panin keima ei cing in; ka pua nading a gel mi tatsiete kung panin keima ei dal in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi kiphasahte in thang ei siedap vua, amate in lenthang zahin lamdung ah ei sie uhi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in Topa kungah, “Nang ka Pasien na hi hi; keima’ ang thumna aw ei ngai in, Topa aw,” ka ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa , keima’ Topa , a thahat ei hunkhie pa aw, gal kido hun ciengin nangma in keima’ lu nei tuompieh zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa aw, nang in migilote’ deina pie vawt sin; a gitlo sawmnate uh maban sotsah sin. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ei kimkot mite in a lu a domsang uhi; a zuouthu gente uh amau’ lu tungah tu taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amate tungah mei-am kiesuh taheh! A thawkia zo nawn lo nadingun dum sungah amate kiesuh ta uheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Gam sungah mi gensiete kikipsah sih heh; sietna in mi tatsiete mallang tahin sulzui taheh!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa in mi cimawte’ thu a vaihawmpieh a, ama in mizawngte adingin tangtaha a khen lam ka thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thu man mite in nangma’ min ang phat valon ding uhi; nangma’ opna munah mi thumante a teng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, nang kang hlan hi; keima kungah hing pei meng in; nang kang hlat ciengin ka aw ei ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thungetna na mai-ah panamtui bangin ei simpieh inlen, ka khut kang laptona zong khu nitah biehpiehna bangin ei simpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, ka kam a cing ding khat ei koipieh inlen, ka nephu kotkhahte a vil ding khat ei koipieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khielna a bawl mite tawh kipawlin gitlo nasepnate-ah kitahla loin, sietna khatpo bawl ding lamah ka lungsim hing kiheisah sin; amau’ an tuituohte zong ei nesah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thuman mite in ei vuosah in; mi muonhuoite in ei thu hilsah in. Ka lu tungah migilote’ sathau kinu ngai vawt sih heh, azieh pen ka thungetna in a gitlo gamtatnate uh a langpang den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amate a mawsah ding mite tungah a ki-ap ciengun, ka thugente man hi, ci thu amate in a thei pan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi khat in suongpi satkehin lei tungah a thethang bangin, Misikhuo’ kam sungah amahaw’ gute kithezah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahi vangin Topa ka Pasien aw, nangma lam kang mitsuon hi; keima in nangma kang beel hi; kep lo huoi loin kei ei nuasie sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei dinga a sie uh thang pan le migilote’ thang panin kei ei kem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keima beh ka suotah laitahin migilote a thang vuah awh ta uheh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa tungah ka aw tawh ka kiko hi; Topa tungah ka aw tawh thumna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in ama mai-ah ka lungkim lona teng ka sung hi; keima in ama mai-ah ka buoina teng ka gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hlagau basamin a op ciengin nangma in ka lampi na thei hi. Amate in ka peina lampi-ah keima thang ei siedap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka zietlam ka en a, ka mu hi, ei phawh kha koima om lo hi; ka kibuh nading mun a om ta sih hi; koima in kei ei don lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, nang tungah kang kiko hi; keima in, “Nang ka kibuhna na hi a, a hinglai mite’ leitangah keima’ tanh na hi hi,” kang ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kang kikona ei ngaipieh in, azieh pen a niem mama-in kei ei kikoi hi. Kei ei bawlsiete kung panin ei hundam in, azieh pen kei adingin amate a hat seng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Keima in nangma’ min tawh lungdam kang ko thei nadingin, thong sung panin ei la dawh in. Nangma in nei limbawl ding ziehin midihte in ei kimkot ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa aw, ka thungetna ei za inlen, na muonhuoina sungah kang thumnate na bil ei daw in; na dihna sungah keima ei dawng in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na nasempa kei tungah thu hing khen sin, azieh pen nangma mai-ah mihing a thuman koima om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen gal in kei ei delin, ka hinna tuoldenna-in nei a, hun sawtpi lai-a a site bangin khuomiel lahah ei tosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahi ziehin ka sunga ka hlagau a tha zawm gawp hi; ka sunga ka lungtang zong zau-in a citun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hun luite phawhkia-in, na silbawlte zosie ka ngaisun a, na khut tawh na sepsate ka lungngaingai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Keima in na tungah ka khut kang zah hi; gam gawta in tui a du bangin ka hlagau in nang ang hlangai hi. Selah
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa aw, kei ei dawng meng in; ka hlagau a cimaw ta hi. Keima kung panin na mai phuol sin, tua ahi sihle kei pen Leihawm sunga a pei mite ka bang ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nang kang muon ziehin zingmawngin na itna kip ei zasah in. Nangma tungah ka hlagau kang lapto ziehin ka pei nading lampi ei hil in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa aw, ka galte kung panin keima ei hun in. Nangma beel dingin na kungah kang tai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang ka Pasien na hi ziehin na deilam ka sep thei nadingin keima ei hil in. A hoi nangma’ hlagau in lamphei-ah ei pui taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa aw, na min na khuolna-in ka hinna ei keppieh in. Buoina kawmkal panin na dihna sungah ei peipi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na nasempa ka hi ziehin ka galte le ka langte zosie nangma’ itna kip sungah sumang in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka khutte galdo zie ding le ka khutmete galkap zie ding ei zilsah pa ka suongpi, Topa in thupha nga taheh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ama ka suongpi le ka kulpi, ka munkip muonhuoi le ei hunkhie pa, ka kidalna lum le ka bel pa ahi a, ka nei-a mite a zo pa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa aw, na phaw tham dingin mihingte bang hi a, na ngaisut tham dingin mihingte bang hi lel ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amate husan khat tawh kibang hi; a hinkhuo uzong ei liepsan nihlim bang ahi lel bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa aw, na vanpite kuoikun inlen, hing kumsuh in; amate meikhu a suo nadingin muolsangte tham in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tun phesah inlen, amate kithezah sah in; na thaltangte kap inlen, amate susie gawp in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A sangna mun panin na khut hing zah in; a thahat tuithuhte le gamdang mite’ khut sung panin keima ei hunkhie inlen, ei suohtasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kamte un zuouthu vive gen a, a zietlam khut uh a zuoutat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien aw, nangma tungah la tha kang sa ding hi; harp zamsawm lasahna tumin nangma la kang tap ding hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />nang pen kumpite guolzawna a pie pa, si theina namsau pana na nasem David a hunkhie pa na hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Si theina namsau panin keima ei hunkhie inlen, a kam utawh zuouthu genin, a zietlam khut utawh a zuoutat, gamdang mite’ khut sung panin kei ei hunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka tapate uh a tangval lai-un hoitaha a khang singkungte bang hinlen, ka tanute uh a ngahnut lai-un kumpi inn lam nadinga a kisui inn ninga kiphut khuompite bang ta uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ansalte uh zong an namcin tawh kidim taheh; ka tuute uh gamlahah a tultul a thenthenin pungin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />ka bawng ka lawite uzong a note tawh kiphamat taheh. Kulpi a vang kici om sih hinlen, sala kikai zong om loin, ka khuolai vuah lunggim kikona awging om sih taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tam bang thupha a tunna mite thupha nga ahi uhi; Topa pen amau’ Pasien ahi mite thupha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pasien le ka Kumpipa aw, nangma kang patawi ding a, a tawntungin na min ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nisimin thupha kang pie ding a, a tawntungin na min ka phat ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa lien hi, nahpitaha phat ding ahi hi; ama’ lietna pen kan zawh ding hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khang khat in adang khang khat tungah na nasepnate phat ding a, a vanglien nangma’ silbawlte phuongzah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A minthang na thupina le a lamdang na silbawlte tungah ka lungngaingai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lien a lamdang na silbawlte kitangko ding a, keima in nangma’ lietna ka pulah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in minthang a kicing na hoina a gengen ding vua, amate in nangma’ dihna nahpitahin a sa ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa pen mi hepina le mi lungsiet siempa ahi a, lungthah bai vawt loin a kicing itna kip nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi zosie tungah Topa hoi a, ama in a bawlsa zosie tungah lainatna nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa aw, na bawlsa na zosie in nangma tungah lungdam ang ko ding vua, na mi muonhuoi zosie in zong thupha ang pie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in na kumpi gam’ a minthanna thu genin, na vanglietna a sut ding vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />a vanglien nangma’ sepnate le nangma’ kumpi gam a hoina, a minthannate mi zosie tungah a theisah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na manggam pen tawntung manggam ahi a, nangma’ uhna zong khu khang tawntungin a kip hi. A thugenna zosie-ah Topa muonhuoi a, ama in a gamtatna zosie-ah mi hepina nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Topa in a pua mizosie tukip a, ama in a kiniemkhieh mite a domsang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mit zosie in kinepna tawh nangma ang en vua, nangma in a hun a tun ciengin a an ding uh na pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangma in na khut na zah a, hinna a nei zosie’ deina pie-in na lungkimsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama’ lampite vannuoi-ah Topa thutang a, ama’ gamtatna vannuoi-ah mi a khuotuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama a hlan mi zosie, thutaha a hlan mi zosie kungah Topa a nai op hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama a zatah mi zosie’ deina ama in tangtungsah hi; ama in amau’ kikona zong za-in, amate a hundam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Topa in ama a it zosie cing a, ahi vangin ama in migilote zosie susie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka kam in Topa’ phatna a gen ding a, mi zosie in kumtawnin ama’ min siengtho a phat ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Ka hlagau aw, Topa phat in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Keima in ka hin laisie Topa ka phat ding hi; ka hin sung tungtawnin Topa phatna late ka sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ei panpi thei lo uliente le mihingte muong sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A husan uh a tawp ciengin amate lei lahah a kilekia uhi; khum ni ma-in amau’ gelnate a mangthai sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A panpi dinga Jacob Pasien a nei, amau’ Topa Pasien sunga kinepna a nei mite thupha nga ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama in van le lei, tuipi le a sunga om zosie a bawl hi; a tawntungin ama in upna kemcing den hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ama in a kibawlsie mite adingin thu a tangin khen hi; a gilkielte an a pie hi. Topa in thongkiete a suohtasah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Topa in mittawte khuo a musah hi. Topa in a kiniemkhiehte a domsang hi; Topa in midihte a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in pemtate kem hi; ama in pa nei lote le meigongte panpi a, ahi vangin migilote’ gamtatna suhsietpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Zion aw, khang tawntungin Topa na Pasien a maang den ding hi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! I Pasien tungah phatna late i sah ding hoi hi; azieh pen hepina tawh ama kidim a, phatna la i sah ding a kilawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Jerusalem khuopi khu Topa’ lam ahi hi; ama in a kipampaih Israel mite kaikhawm hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in lungsim kitamzante damsah a, amau’ liemnate zong a tuompieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama in aasite a pha za ding se hi; tuate zosie a min uh phuo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I Topa uh lien a, a kicing vanglietna nei hi; ama’ theitelna pen tezawh ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Topa in a kituoncilte lamto hi; ama in migilote tuoldenna-in nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lungdamkona tawh Topa tungah lasa un; lyre lasahna tawh i Pasien uh tungah la ngaih sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in meiilum tawh vante tuom a, leitung ading guotui bawlin, muoltangte tungah lopa posah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in ganhingte le va-ah note a ham uh ciengin an a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama’ lungkimna khu sakol thahatna ahi sih a, ama’ nopsahna khu a tai mipa’ kalhatna zong ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hinanle ama a zatah mite le ama’ itna kip sunga kinepna a nei mite tungah Topa a lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jerusalem khuopi aw, Topa phat in! Zion aw, na Pasien phat in!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile ama in na tunkot zawlte tosah a, na sunga a om na tate thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in na gamgi zui-ah lemna ang pie hi; mangbu hoi pente tawh nangma ang gilvasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ama in a thupiehna leitungah a sawl hi; a thu mallangtahin a tungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in tuumul bangin vuakhal ei pie hi; ama in vut bangin daitui a thezah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Annengkie bangin ama in gieltang a khiesuh hi. Koi in thuoh zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in thupie a, tuate tui a suoh hi; ama in a hui langsah a, tuite zong a luong pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in Jacob tungah ama’ thu gen a, Israel tungah a thukhamte le a ngaina kipte a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tua bangin ama in minam dang khat popo tungah a bawl ngai sih hi; amate in a ngaina kipte a thei sih uhi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Vantungte panin Topa phat un; a sangnate-ah ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vantungmi zosie aw, ama phat un; A mihon zosie aw, ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni le hlapi aw, ama phat un; no a tang aasite aw, ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />No, van sangpente le no, vantungte-a om tuite aw, ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Topa’ min amate phatsah un, azieh pen ama in thupie a, tuate kipieng sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tawntunga om dingin ama in tuate kipsah hi; kantan thei lo dingin ama in a gamgi uh a bawlpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung panin Topa phat un, no, tuipi ganhing golte le a thuhna zosie,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />mei le giel, vuakhal le daitui, a thupiehna a mang khuopi hui!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Muol le tang zosie, ga nei singkungte le taamtah sing zosie!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Gamsa le innsa vannuoi, a bawhva ganhing le a leng vate zosie!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leitung kumpite le mite zosie, uliente le leitung a uhte zosie!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ngahnute le tangvalte, a vuoi le khangnote in Topa phat ton un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Amate Topa’ min phatsah un, azieh pen ama’ min beh kitawisang hi; ama’ minthanna pen leitung le vantung sangin sangzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in ama’ mite adingin ki khat tawisang zo a, tua khu ama tawh kinai-a a om a muonhuoi Israel mi zosie’ phatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Topa tungah la tha sa unlen, thuman mite kikhopna sungah ama phatna la sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A Bawlpa tungah Israel lungdam heh; amau’ Kumpipa tungah Zion’ tate kipah uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amate in lamna tawh ama’ min phatsah unlen, tawm le lyre lasahna tawh ama tungah la ngaih sa un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Azieh pen ama’ mite tungah Topa lungdam hi; ama in a neilut mite guolzawna tawh zem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A guolzawna vuah mi muonhuoite lungdamin kitom uheh; amate in a lupna tung vuah lungdamin la sa uheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minamte tungah phu la-in, mite tunga dan a pie ding, a kumpite uh siakhau tawh khi-in, a uliente uh sia kengkol a bul ding, a kigielsa thukhenna bangin amate tunga a semkhie dingin, a khut vuah langni a hiem namsau tawi-in lawl pawhkeh khielin awngin, Pasien phat ta uheh! Tam khu a mi muonhuoi zosie’ guolzawna ahi hi. Topa phat un!
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa phat un! Ama’ mun siengtho sungah Pasien phat un; ama’ vanglietna mun vantungah ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vanglien ama’ sepnate ziehin ama phat un; tepi om lo a lietna tawh kituohin ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pengkul aw tawh ama phat unlen, theile le harp lasahna tawh ama phat un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tawm le lamna tawh ama phat un; khausai lasahna le theile tawh ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Daltuote tawh ama phat un; a gin ngaih daltuote tawh ama phat un!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A naa thei zosie in Topa phat heh! Topa phat un!
  </para>
</usx>
